    # yt "Thank god Aine isn't sleeping here tonight..."
    yt "还好艾妮今晚不睡在这里……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:468
translate chinese skystressrelief_cd2fb79e:

    # mc "*chuckles* I'd like that."
    mc "*笑* 没问题啊。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:469
translate chinese skystressrelief_a98b0cf6:

    # s "Great! Now, come here so we can cuddle just like old times."
    s "好的！快过来，我们跟以前一样好好抱一抱。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:470
translate chinese skystressrelief_2b026c18:

    # mc "In a minute. I need to clean myself up first."
    mc "等一下。我先去洗一洗。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:471
translate chinese skystressrelief_62d71d64:

    # s "Fine, fine."
    s "好的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:473
translate chinese skystressrelief_19cbdfca:

    # yt "Yeah, no, nevermind!"
    yt "哎呦我的妈呀！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:474
translate chinese skystressrelief_96de369d:

    # s "What's wrong, [mc]?"
    s "怎么了，[mc!t]？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:475
translate chinese skystressrelief_0d29652a:

    # mc "[landlady]'s coming up the stairs! Dress up, quick!"
    mc "[landlady!t]上楼了！快穿衣服！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:477
translate chinese skystressrelief_92f1eae0:

    # k "Oh... I guess Sky went to comfort him. What was all that thud I heard, then?"
    k "噢……看来是斯凯过来安慰他了。那我听到咚咚咚的声音又是怎么回事呢？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:479
translate chinese skystressrelief_62b38463:

    # s "Is she gone?"
    s "她走了没？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:480
translate chinese skystressrelief_f4d60154:

    # mc "Yeah, we're good."
    mc "嗯，安全了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:481
translate chinese skystressrelief_93e01400:

    # yt "*sighs* How do we even start to tell her about all this?"
    yt "*叹气* 我们该怎么开口告诉她呢？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:482
translate chinese skystressrelief_192a1632:

    # yt "It's not just about Sky, but I've been fucking every single woman in this house!"
    yt "不光是斯凯的事，我跟这个房子的所有女人都上过床啊！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:483
translate chinese skystressrelief_4394a47f:

    # yt "Well... except for her..."
    yt "呃……除了她以外……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:484
translate chinese skystressrelief_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:485
translate chinese skystressrelief_0d14a859:

    # yt "Huh?! You fucking asshole, don't even think about it!"
    yt "啊？！你他妈的畜生，这种事你想都不要想！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:487
translate chinese skystressrelief_4a4d53ce:

    # mc "As tempting as that sounds, I'm just not really feeling it right now, Sky. I'm sorry."
    mc "尽管这建议很诱人，但我现在没那个心情，斯凯。对不起。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:488
translate chinese skystressrelief_247083d2:

    # s "Oh... well, it's ok, I understand."
    s "噢……好吧，没事的，我理解。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:489
translate chinese skystressrelief_14baa1d4:

    # mc "It's not that I don't want to, it's just not the right time."
    mc "不是我不愿意，只是现在不是时候。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:490
translate chinese skystressrelief_8a855630:

    # s "Don't worry, [mc]. I know you're dealing with a lot right now."
    s "没事的，[mc!t]。我知道你现在心里很乱。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:491
translate chinese skystressrelief_72e166df:

    # s "But don't think I'm letting you off the hook that easily!"
    s "但别以为我会轻易放过你！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:492
translate chinese skystressrelief_0501fc2a:

    # s "{size=-10}Next time you'll have to fuck me twice as hard."
    s "{size=-10}下次你要用两倍的力气操我。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:493
translate chinese skystressrelief_2178d665:

    # mc "Say that again?"
    mc "你说什么？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:494
translate chinese skystressrelief_1eaefbc4:

    # s "I said next time, you'll have to take me somewhere nice where it's just the two of us!"
    s "我说下次，你得带我去个好地方，跟我过二人世界！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:495
translate chinese skystressrelief_c1b3da92:

    # mc "*chuckles* Fine, you have a deal!"
    mc "*笑* 好，一言为定！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:496
translate chinese skystressrelief_5d22f93c:

    # s "Good night, [mc]. Promise me you'll try not to worry too much?"
    s "晚安，[mc!t]。你得跟我保证，不要操心过度了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:497
translate chinese skystressrelief_a5fefbdc:

    # mc "I'll do my very best. Good night, Sky."
    mc "我会注意的。晚安，斯凯。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:504
translate chinese skystressrelief_7c31f311:

    # mc "Who-?"
    mc "谁——？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:505
translate chinese skystressrelief_b7a8da2a:

    # mc "Oh, it's you guys... from before."
    mc "哦，是你们啊……我们以前见过。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:506
translate chinese skystressrelief_ae516426:

    # nic "Hey there! We did run into each other previously but never got around to proper introductions."
    nic "你好啊！我们之前的确见过一面，不过没有机会正式认识一下。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:507
translate chinese skystressrelief_db12986a:

    # nic "I'm Nicole, Nicole Fitzcharles."
    nic "我是妮可，妮可·菲兹查尔斯。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:508
translate chinese skystressrelief_a55c56a3:

    # nic "And this is Yuna."
    nic "这位是由奈。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:509
translate chinese skystressrelief_2567d71c:

    # mc "Fitzcharles?"
    mc "菲兹查尔斯？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:510
translate chinese skystressrelief_03459791:

    # mc "Wait, you're that-!"
    mc "等等，你是那个——！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:511
translate chinese skystressrelief_7d231dec:

    # nic "Yep, that's me. But let's keep that under wraps for now, okay?"
    nic "对，是我。但现在就先不提那个了，好吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:512
translate chinese skystressrelief_bae525a4:

    # nic "Carrying that name comes with its burdens. We'd really appreciate being treated like anyone else, if you don't mind."
    nic "那个名字也会是带来负担的。就把我们当成普通人对待，好吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:513
translate chinese skystressrelief_0a4b5454:

    # mc "Got it, no problem at all. I was just a bit surprised, is all."
    mc "好的，没问题。我就是有点惊讶。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:514
translate chinese skystressrelief_2d55e436:

    # mc "So, you're here to look out for everyone while we're away?"
    mc "所以我们不在的时候，就是你们来照顾其他人吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:515
translate chinese skystressrelief_b1bc3905:

    # nic "Exactly. Jess sent us. I'm part of the Intelligence Department, and Yuna here is one of our best mercenaries."
    nic "没错。婕斯派我们来的。我是情报部门的人，而由奈是我们最强的战士之一。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:516
translate chinese skystressrelief_e1e884a0:

    # nic "You can count on us to keep everyone safe while you handle your business."
    nic "我们绝对可以在你们外出办事的时候保证其他人的安全。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:517
translate chinese skystressrelief_cb7e1489:

    # yt "Their actual roles in this city are still a mystery to me..."
    yt "我依然不知道她们在这个城市里真正扮演的是什么角色……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:518
translate chinese skystressrelief_dc93f3aa:

    # yt "But... I can confirm that these two are actual monsters..."
    yt "但是……我能确定，这两个人是真正的怪物……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:519
translate chinese skystressrelief_1a7b9e10:

    # yt "Treating them like just anybody else? How can I do that if I feel like they could slit my throat at any moment?"
    yt "把她们当做普通人对待？我觉得她们随时都可能割开我的喉咙，这怎么可能做得到啊？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:520
translate chinese skystressrelief_d1f7c2be:

    # yt "Such intense pressure..."
    yt "实在太紧张了……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:521
translate chinese skystressrelief_6c832ef3:

    # mc "Anyway, I'm [mc]. Appreciate you two stepping in to help."
    mc "总之，我是[mc!t]。感谢你们来帮忙。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:522
translate chinese skystressrelief_1ddd7faf:

    # nic "Happy to. Just a heads-up, though."
    nic "非常乐意。不过提醒你一句。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:523
translate chinese skystressrelief_582359ea:

    # mc "Hm?"
    mc "嗯？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:524
translate chinese skystressrelief_b3880931:

    # nic "This is a paid gig for us. Jess will be deducting it from your salary."
    nic "我们是拿钱办事的。婕斯会从你的工资里扣。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:525
translate chinese skystressrelief_3e60481a:

    # mc "*sighs* Should've seen that coming."
    mc "*叹气* 早该想到的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:526
translate chinese skystressrelief_99eed2c2:

    # nic "*laughs* Don't sweat it; we're not charging an arm and a leg."
    nic "*大笑* 别太担心；我们的收费标准不高的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:527
translate chinese skystressrelief_f42966bd:

    # nic "Jess might be a friend, but she's all business at the end of the day. Some things never change."
    nic "婕斯虽然是朋友，但依然还是把生意摆在第一位啊。有些事就是不会变。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:528
translate chinese skystressrelief_5ebfe654:

    # mc "Sounds about right."
    mc "说得对。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:530
translate chinese skystressrelief_19fdf8ff:

    # nic "Oh, hey there, Fang!"
    nic "噢，你好，獠牙！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:531
translate chinese skystressrelief_655fcbd7:

    # m "'Sup."
    m "你好啊。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:532
translate chinese skystressrelief_71a86863:

    # y "..."
    y "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:533
translate chinese skystressrelief_e612037c:

    # m "..."
    m "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:534
translate chinese skystressrelief_ccdd9ed9:

    # y "Are you happy?"
    y "你开心吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:535
translate chinese skystressrelief_8cb62253:

    # m "Yes."
    m "嗯。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:536
translate chinese skystressrelief_9f47a418:

    # y "Good."
    y "好。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:537
translate chinese skystressrelief_4a882adf:

    # nic "You two might just set a world record for least words used in a conversation."
    nic "你们俩说不定都创造字数最少的聊天的世界纪录了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:538
translate chinese skystressrelief_744c3730:

    # nic "It's been a while, why not loosen up a bit?"
    nic "都过了很久了，为什么不放松点呢？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:539
translate chinese skystressrelief_72fab9ef:

    # y "That's unnecessary. A warrior's silence speaks louder than words..."
    y "没有必要。战士的沉默比话语更有分量……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:540
translate chinese skystressrelief_6c6889f5:

    # m "... For each action carves fate, while unnecessary words are but whispers lost to the wind."
    m "……因为行动能决定命运，而废话只会随风飘散。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:541
translate chinese skystressrelief_5f4c41c0:

    # y "Glad that's still your mantra."
    y "看来这依旧是你的信条。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:542
translate chinese skystressrelief_1e2d98a9:

    # m "Always."
    m "永远不变。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:544
translate chinese skystressrelief_52498726:

    # k "Are these our guests?"
    k "这两位是我们的客人吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:545
translate chinese skystressrelief_41debb24:

    # nic "Good morning, Miss Hahn."
    nic "早上好，汉恩女士。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:546
translate chinese skystressrelief_05af7bc6:

    # y "Good morning."
    y "早上好。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:547
translate chinese skystressrelief_0aba0dc6:

    # mc "They're going to keep an eye on things while we're out."
    mc "我们出发之后，她们负责安保。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:548
translate chinese skystressrelief_904c5b62:

    # k "Thanks. I trust you'll keep everyone safe."
    k "谢谢。我相信你们一定能保证大家的安全。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:549
translate chinese skystressrelief_5b791327:

    # nic "Absolutely, Miss Hahn. We never fail to deliver."
    nic "当然了，汉恩女士。我们从未失败过。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:550
translate chinese skystressrelief_803d08bf:

    # k "I noticed you've been on your feet for a while. Please, feel free to come in for refreshments."
    k "你们在外面站了很久了吧。快进来，休息一下。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:551
translate chinese skystressrelief_e75c2c5f:

    # nic "We appreciate it, but we'll stay on guard out here for as long as needed."
    nic "感谢你的好意，不过只要有必要，我们在外面站岗多久都可以。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:552
translate chinese skystressrelief_2e1340b8:

    # mc "Ready to get going?"
    mc "准备好出发了吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:553
translate chinese skystressrelief_deee818e:

    # k "*taking a deep breath*"
    k "*深呼吸*"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:554
translate chinese skystressrelief_c892b34f:

    # k "Yes, let's go."
    k "嗯，走吧。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:555
translate chinese skystressrelief_2b35b6fe_1:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:556
translate chinese skystressrelief_e612037c_1:

    # m "..."
    m "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:557
translate chinese skystressrelief_37a46d7c:

    # m "... Just so you know, if even one person gets hurt, that's enough reason for me to kill you."
    m "……告诉你们，哪怕这里有一个人受伤，都足够让我杀了你们。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:558
translate chinese skystressrelief_d165a659:

    # nic "Feel free if that happens. But trust us, it won't come to that."
    nic "如果真是那样，欢迎你动手。但相信我们吧，绝对不可能的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:559
translate chinese skystressrelief_88957389:

    # nic "If anything, who do you take us for?"
    nic "你把我们当什么人了？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:560
translate chinese skystressrelief_779b5249:

    # m "Your blood doesn't scare me, Fitzcharles."
    m "你的血脉吓不到我，菲兹查尔斯。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:561
translate chinese skystressrelief_b14b2dd5:

    # nic "Am I not that intimidating anymore?"
    nic "难道我已经吓不到别人了吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:562
translate chinese skystressrelief_6880687e:

    # y "I don't know, I just got here."
    y "我不知道。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:569
translate chinese skystressrelief_817bc201:

    # mc "So, what's the story with the outfit?"
    mc "你这身衣服是什么情况？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:570
translate chinese skystressrelief_82091822:

    # k "..."
    k "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:571
translate chinese skystressrelief_ec2024e9:

    # mc "[landlady]?"
    mc "[landlady!t]？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:572
translate chinese skystressrelief_1e10d133:

    # k "Oh, uhh..."
    k "噢，呃……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:573
translate chinese skystressrelief_443f70ba:

    # k "Well... I just wanted to feel more like myself today."
    k "我……我今天就是想更像自己一些。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:574
translate chinese skystressrelief_572ccdf5:

    # mc "And what's been stopping you? You should always wear what makes you comfortable."
    mc "你平常怎么不这样呢？穿自己觉得舒服的衣服就好了嘛。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:575
translate chinese skystressrelief_fb556b06:

    # k "Aside from acting like my age, I feel like I should present myself in a certain way, something respectable in everyone's eyes."
    k "我年纪大了，总不能继续乱来。而且，我觉得我的形象有必要让每个人都能理解、尊重。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:578
translate chinese skystressrelief_6a1a556a:

    # mc "That's totally understandable."
    mc "说得很有道理。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:582
translate chinese skystressrelief_387c4c34:

    # mc "Honestly, it's not every day that I see you in that kind of clothing, but I don't see it being an issue."
    mc "说实话，我不经常看你打扮成这样，但我不觉得这是什么问题。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:583
translate chinese skystressrelief_291d36b5:

    # mc "You look great, and it really suits you."
    mc "这衣服很适合你，你看着很好看啊。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:584
translate chinese skystressrelief_3f261e85:

    # mc "Right, Em?"
    mc "对吧，小艾？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:585
translate chinese skystressrelief_c881c526:

    # e "Yeah, it does make you look younger, Miss Klara."
    e "是的，显得你很年轻，克拉拉女士。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:586
translate chinese skystressrelief_a0e78629:

    # k "*laughs* Thanks, you two. I appreciate it."
    k "*大笑* 谢谢，二位。我很开心。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:588
translate chinese skystressrelief_2bde548a:

    # mc "Speaking of someone with clothing issues, how's she doing?"
    mc "说到穿衣打扮有问题的人，她怎么样了？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:589
translate chinese skystressrelief_96534a98:

    # e "She's fine, but she fell asleep ten minutes after we hit the road."
    e "没事，不过刚上路十分钟她就睡着了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:590
translate chinese skystressrelief_944da721:

    # mc "Seems I wasn't the only one struggling to sleep last night. It's nice to see you two bonding, though."
    mc "看来昨晚不止我一个人睡不着觉。不过能看到你俩关系变好也算是好事。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:591
translate chinese skystressrelief_2a461ec5:

    # e "It's not like I've warmed up to her."
    e "我跟她的关系没有变好。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:592
translate chinese skystressrelief_04a41e9a:

    # k "You're not still at odds, are you?"
    k "你们该不会还在闹矛盾吧？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:593
translate chinese skystressrelief_dcf4e0d8:

    # e "No, it's not that. She's just unpredictable in ways that I can't understand, and it bothers me."
    e "不，不是那样的。只是她的行动难以预测，我理解不了，让我很心烦。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:594
translate chinese skystressrelief_a4688862:

    # mc "Can't blame you. She has been acting odd lately."
    mc "不能怪你。她最近表现一直很奇怪。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:595
translate chinese skystressrelief_c61e4fb3:

    # e "In what way?"
    e "奇怪？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:596
translate chinese skystressrelief_97da1054:

    # mc "There's this unexplainable connection between us. It's hard to describe."
    mc "我们俩之间有种说不清楚的联系。很难用语言描述出来。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:597
translate chinese skystressrelief_99ae7b7b:

    # k "Can you elaborate on that?"
    k "你能再详细说说吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:598
translate chinese skystressrelief_d17484a6:

    # mc "Imagine you're walking on a straight path, eyes wide open. Then suddenly, you're walking blind."
    mc "就好像你正走在一条笔直的路上，眼睛睁得很大。然后突然，你就变成闭着眼睛在走了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:599
translate chinese skystressrelief_46a79e33:

    # e "That analogy doesn't really hold up..."
    e "这个比喻太奇怪了吧……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:600
translate chinese skystressrelief_9692f09c:

    # mc "Just go with it for a second. What would you feel?"
    mc "你就先配合一下。这种情况下，你们会有什么感觉？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:601
translate chinese skystressrelief_f4242a18:

    # k "Well, I'd keep walking since I know the path, but closing my eyes would make me uneasy."
    k "嗯，因为我知道路是直的，所以我会继续走，但闭着眼睛还是会让我紧张。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:602
translate chinese skystressrelief_9bfd6b70:

    # mc "Now, you can open your eyes."
    mc "现在，可以把眼睛睁开了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:603
translate chinese skystressrelief_21c7c039:

    # k "In that case, I will feel a tremendous amount of relief knowing that I can see again."
    k "那样的话，我会一下子安心不少，因为我又能看见了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:604
translate chinese skystressrelief_6c53174c:

    # mc "Exactly my point. That's the kind of unsettling feeling I get around her."
    mc "就是这种感觉。我在她身边的时候就是会有这种不安的感觉。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:605
translate chinese skystressrelief_9eb278e6:

    # e "Sounds like basic human instinct to me..."
    e "我感觉像是人类的基础本能……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:606
translate chinese skystressrelief_ae48dffe:

    # mc "It might be, but for two people who've only recently met, it's odd to establish such a connection so quickly."
    mc "可能吧，但对两个最近才认识的人来说，能这么快建立起这种联系很奇怪吧。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:607
translate chinese skystressrelief_9ee9edda:

    # mc "I just wish I could figure out what it means."
    mc "我只希望我能搞清楚这到底是怎么回事。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:608
translate chinese skystressrelief_02d2e116:

    # k "Maybe it's not something to puzzle over but to be grateful for. It might be exactly what you both need."
    k "或许这事不是需要破解的谜团，而是值得感恩的赐福也说不定。可能正好是你们两个需要的东西。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:609
translate chinese skystressrelief_443288d8:

    # mc "Hope you're right. It's been perplexing, to say the least."
    mc "希望如此吧。这事往最小了说，也让我天天都发愁。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:611
translate chinese skystressrelief_72a33094:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:612
translate chinese skystressrelief_ba7ac537:

    # yt "Uh-oh... Looks like I hit a nerve. Forgot she's the type to get jealous."
    yt "啊哦……我好像说错话了。都忘了她是爱吃醋的类型。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:614
translate chinese skystressrelief_296340ef:

    # mc "Changing topics, how did you come to know about this place?"
    mc "换个话题，你是怎么知道这个地方的？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:615
translate chinese skystressrelief_8c9fbcff:

    # k "Jovian and I lived there briefly before we settled in Golden City. It's owned by the Winters, a married couple. And they'd better remember me."
    k "我和乔维安在金城定居之前，在这里短暂地住过一段时间。房东是一对夫妻，温特斯一家。希望他们还记得我。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:616
translate chinese skystressrelief_51aa08b1:

    # mc "Point us in the right direction then."
    mc "那就给我们指路吧。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:617
translate chinese skystressrelief_a388c5df:

    # k "It's a few hours' drive from here. Are you sure you want to keep on the wheels?"
    k "离这里有几个小时车程。你确定要继续开车吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:618
translate chinese skystressrelief_acbbc9d3:

    # mc "Absolutely. I got this."
    mc "当然。我没问题的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:624
translate chinese skystressrelief_46f8553f:

    # ew "Love, they're here again."
    ew "亲爱的，他们又来了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:625
translate chinese skystressrelief_8dc7966f:

    # tw "Who?"
    tw "谁？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:626
translate chinese skystressrelief_6825cfca:

    # ew "His family."
    ew "他的家人。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:627
translate chinese skystressrelief_49fbec52:

    # tw "I see..."
    tw "我知道了……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:629
translate chinese skystressrelief_62c4fc03:

    # e "Let me handle this. Don't do anything unless I say so."
    e "交给我处理吧。除非我发话，否则什么也不要做。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:632
translate chinese skystressrelief_853ef7a6:

    # ew "Yes?"
    ew "谁啊？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:633
translate chinese skystressrelief_b2dafd9c:

    # k "Good morning, Mrs. Winters. It's been a while."
    k "早上好，温特斯夫人。好久不见了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:634
translate chinese skystressrelief_f05642ea:

    # ew "*laughs* Oh, Klara? Yes, it has been a while!"
    ew "*大笑* 噢，克拉拉？是啊，的确是好久不见了！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:635
translate chinese skystressrelief_18a43490:

    # e "Good morning. Are you Eudora Winters?"
    e "早上好。你是尤多拉·温特斯吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:636
translate chinese skystressrelief_0f6aa6be:

    # ew "Yes, that's me. And who are you?"
    ew "对，没错。你是哪位？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:637
translate chinese skystressrelief_4e2d1195:

    # e "I'm Detective Meyer. I'm here for an ongoing investigation."
    e "我是梅耶警探，来这里查案的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:638
translate chinese skystressrelief_f27574ef:

    # e "I have a search warrant authorized by the court to search your house. Here's the paperwork."
    e "我有法庭下发的搜查令，有权搜查你家。这是文件。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:639
translate chinese skystressrelief_31870955:

    # ew "..."
    ew "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:640
translate chinese skystressrelief_f0aabe64:

    # ew "I see. Well, if it's all correct, then... you have the right. May I ask what you're looking for?"
    ew "好吧。嗯，看起来是没什么问题……那你请吧。能问问你在找什么吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:641
translate chinese skystressrelief_0be78cba:

    # e "I can't share the investigation details right now, but we'll be quick and try not to disturb too much. Thank you for cooperating."
    e "我现在不能透露案件的细节，不过我们会尽快完成，不会过多打扰。感谢你的配合。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:643
translate chinese skystressrelief_21cb9937:

    # k "You're not very good at {i}hiding{/i} that you're {i}hiding{/i} something, are you, Eudora?"
    k "你不太擅长{i}隐瞒{/i}你有{i}隐瞒{/i}着我们的东西啊，尤多拉。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:644
translate chinese skystressrelief_5b8e92f1:

    # ew "What do you mean-"
    ew "什么意思——"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:645
translate chinese skystressrelief_c536d9d9:

    # tw "We're ending this curse right now!"
    tw "我们现在就要让诅咒结束！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:646
translate chinese skystressrelief_c6f1863c:

    # mc "Whoa!"
    mc "啊！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:647
translate chinese skystressrelief_8892a2f9:

    # e "Hold the wife down!"
    e "把他老婆按倒！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:648
translate chinese skystressrelief_5a5e51b0:

    # m "On it."
    m "明白。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:650
translate chinese skystressrelief_55edb011:

    # m "Please don't move. I don't want to hurt you."
    m "不要动。我不想伤害你。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:651
translate chinese skystressrelief_ea3e9d77:

    # mc "W...well... that's one way to say welcome..."
    mc "这……这……可真是热烈欢迎啊……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:652
translate chinese skystressrelief_ae06c173:

    # tw "You cursed people! You're not welcome here! Leave our house, now!"
    tw "你们被诅咒了！这里不欢迎你们！快从我家滚出去！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:653
translate chinese skystressrelief_9381322b:

    # ew "L-let my husband go! You have my cooperation, I promise you! Just don't hurt him!"
    ew "放-放开我丈夫！我配合你们，我保证！别伤害他！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:654
translate chinese skystressrelief_5998ce2d:

    # k "We came in peace, Eudora. But it seems that's not the case anymore after what your husband did."
    k "我们本无意争斗，尤多拉。但在你丈夫的行动之后，情况可就不一样了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:655
translate chinese skystressrelief_2060c377:

    # k "You know why we're here, right?"
    k "你知道我们为何而来吧？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:656
translate chinese skystressrelief_02f63aa7:

    # ew "I don't know what you're talking about-"
    ew "我不知道你在说——"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:657
translate chinese skystressrelief_b8d6a184:

    # k "Denying it will just make things harder for you."
    k "否认只会让你的处境更艰难。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:658
translate chinese skystressrelief_945ea4fd:

    # k "If we've caused you trouble, I'm truly sorry. But you're not the only one who's suffered because of him."
    k "如果我们给你带来了麻烦，我向你道歉。但因为他而吃了苦头的人不止你一个。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:659
translate chinese skystressrelief_148379d6:

    # k "So, please... I'm asking you. Tell us where he is."
    k "所以，拜托……请回答我。告诉我们他在哪。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:660
translate chinese skystressrelief_b199941c:

    # tw "Don't tell them anything, Love! We promised him!"
    tw "什么也不要说，亲爱的！我们向他保证过的！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:661
translate chinese skystressrelief_31870955_1:

    # ew "..."
    ew "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:662
translate chinese skystressrelief_43ea4554:

    # ew "Enough, Thaddeus..."
    ew "够了，撒迪厄斯……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:663
translate chinese skystressrelief_bdcaec09:

    # ew "It's time. We've hidden this for too long."
    ew "是时候了。我们已经瞒了太久。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:664
translate chinese skystressrelief_99fda2a4:

    # ew "We deserve peace, and so do they."
    ew "不管是我们，还是他们，都该把悬着的心放下了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:665
translate chinese skystressrelief_4c944893:

    # k "That's right."
    k "没错。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:666
translate chinese skystressrelief_bc112751:

    # ew "Help me up. I have something to show you."
    ew "扶我起来。我有东西给你看。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:673
translate chinese skystressrelief_ccf5e277:

    # k "This is... the house where we both stayed back then..."
    k "这里……是我们以前住过的房子……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:674
translate chinese skystressrelief_c56394cc:

    # k "And he's here?"
    k "他在这里吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:675
translate chinese skystressrelief_31870955_2:

    # ew "..."
    ew "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:676
translate chinese skystressrelief_64fe9f16:

    # k "Eudora?"
    k "尤多拉？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:677
translate chinese skystressrelief_a05a6dd9:

    # ew "All your questions will be answered soon."
    ew "你的所有问题很快都会得到解答。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:678
translate chinese skystressrelief_b7eea0cf:

    # mc "This isn't a trap, is it?"
    mc "这该不会是个陷阱吧？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:679
translate chinese skystressrelief_22eb4c24:

    # ew "I understand your concerns, but my husband's actions were in defense of us."
    ew "我理解你的担忧，但我丈夫只是想保护我们。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:680
translate chinese skystressrelief_58c9be1f:

    # mc "Defend you from what? He was the one who made things worse, not us."
    mc "保护？保护什么？是他让情况变糟了，又不是我们。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:681
translate chinese skystressrelief_07caba0d:

    # ew "Please, follow me."
    ew "请跟我来。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:683
translate chinese skystressrelief_98dfda79:

    # ew "This is the room where he used to stay."
    ew "这就是他以前住的房间。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:684
translate chinese skystressrelief_732af2cb:

    # k "Used to?"
    k "以前？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:687
translate chinese skystressrelief_190ac5bc:

    # m "Commander, this place makes me uncomfortable."
    m "指挥官，这地方让我很不舒服。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:688
translate chinese skystressrelief_3eafb0dd:

    # mc "Yeah, something's been off since we got here. Glad it's not just me feeling it."
    mc "是啊，从我们来开始，就有东西不对劲。还好不是只有我一个人这么想。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:689
translate chinese skystressrelief_e98a2ce4:

    # ew "Here."
    ew "给。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:690
translate chinese skystressrelief_81ae05f8:

    # k "This is..."
    k "这是……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:691
translate chinese skystressrelief_2857e982:

    # mc "Should this look familiar to me?"
    mc "我应该没见过这玩意儿吧？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:692
translate chinese skystressrelief_e9d7a1f2:

    # k "I'm not sure I'm ready for what's inside..."
    k "我可能没办法面对里面的东西……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:693
translate chinese skystressrelief_425c01a7:

    # k "[mc], would you?"
    k "[mc!t]，拜托你了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:694
translate chinese skystressrelief_2b35b6fe_2:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:695
translate chinese skystressrelief_d6131d45:

    # mc "Yeah... let's see what's in it."
    mc "好……看看里面有什么吧。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:696
translate chinese skystressrelief_34988005:

    # ew "Let's head to the living room."
    ew "我们去客厅吧。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:699
translate chinese skystressrelief_08d7a10b:

    # mc "You sure you don't want to watch this?"
    mc "你真的不想看吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:700
translate chinese skystressrelief_34df83da:

    # k "... Just leave it. I can still hear it from here."
    k "……你放就是了。我还是能听见的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:701
translate chinese skystressrelief_2b35b6fe_3:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:705
translate chinese skystressrelief_61f592f5:

    # k "Really? You actually went and got it?"
    k "你真的去买了啊？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:706
translate chinese skystressrelief_640fd309:

    # jov "Hey, don't give me a hard time. You know I've been wanting one."
    jov "哎，别这样嘛。你知道我一直想要一个的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:707
translate chinese skystressrelief_e89aa788:

    # jov "So, I got this camcorder... and, uh..."
    jov "嗯，我买来了这个摄像机……然后，呃……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:708
translate chinese skystressrelief_18f5af82:

    # jov "... I'm not really sure why I'm doing this..."
    jov "……我也不知道我为什么要这样……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:709
translate chinese skystressrelief_77849799:

    # jov "I'm thinking about capturing all the moments that matter to us. The everyday stuff, the laughs, the trips out."
    jov "我想着把对我们来说重要的时刻都记录下来。每天的日常，欢声笑语，还有出去旅行之类的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:710
translate chinese skystressrelief_b6bb9d51:

    # jov "Maybe someday, someone will find these videos and see a bit of our lives. Today, it's just enjoying the little things—like how much [mc] means to us."
    jov "或许有一天，有人会发现这些视频，看到我们的生活。今天，就只是享受一下小事——比如[mc!t]对我们来说有多重要。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:711
translate chinese skystressrelief_7eaecae5:

    # k "That was a few weeks after you came to our lives."
    k "那是你出生之后几个星期的事。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:712
translate chinese skystressrelief_f20d93d1:

    # k "Jovian finally got his camcorder and started recording. Well, he tried to."
    k "乔维安终于有了摄像机，开始录像了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:713
translate chinese skystressrelief_a7bcf340:

    # mc "I see..."
    mc "这样啊……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:715
translate chinese skystressrelief_3d8b19cf:

    # jov "It's been over a year since I last used this thing. Life's been crazy, with work and everything."
    jov "我上次用这东西都是一年以前了。生活太忙碌了，又是工作，又是其他事的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:716
translate chinese skystressrelief_7f39227a:

    # jov "Sky's been with us for a year now, always following [mc] around. They're the best of friends, and it's the cutest thing."
    jov "斯凯也已经一岁了，天天跟着[mc!t]到处跑。他们的关系好得很，实在太可爱了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:717
translate chinese skystressrelief_793a859e:

    # k "Can you put the camera down for a bit? You've been staring at that thing all day!"
    k "你就不能把摄像机放下一会吗？你都玩了一天了！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:718
translate chinese skystressrelief_cac4af76:

    # k "Sky needs you, and I need help in the kitchen!"
    k "斯凯需要你照顾，我在厨房里也需要人帮忙！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:719
translate chinese skystressrelief_5ba2408e:

    # jov "Okay, okay, just a sec!"
    jov "好吧，好吧，等一下！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:720
translate chinese skystressrelief_f47e24ef:

    # jov "Guess I need to wrap this up. I'll record more later, promise."
    jov "看来我得尽快结束了。我之后会拍更多的，我保证。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:721
translate chinese skystressrelief_6ae5bedf:

    # jov "Oh, [mc], no, don't touch that!"
    jov "哎哎哎，[mc!t]，不行，别碰那个！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:722
translate chinese skystressrelief_ba67980b:

    # jov "Oops, duty calls!"
    jov "好吧，该干活了！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:724
translate chinese skystressrelief_e13c223e:

    # k "Awww! Aren't they adorable?"
    k "哈哈哈！你看他们多可爱啊！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:725
translate chinese skystressrelief_4cafd60c:

    # jov "Here we are, [mc] trying to teach Sky to walk. He's barely got it down himself, but he's so eager to help her."
    jov "看啊，[mc!t]想教斯凯走路呢。他自己都不怎么会，但还是急着教她。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:726
translate chinese skystressrelief_08403c24:

    # jov "Their laughter, their games—it's full of love."
    jov "他们的笑声，他们的游戏——都充满了爱意。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:727
translate chinese skystressrelief_b4ba986d:

    # jov "Watching [mc] help Sky, and her looking up to him like he's a superhero—it's perfect."
    jov "看着[mc!t]帮斯凯，还有她像看超级英雄一样看着他——太完美了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:728
translate chinese skystressrelief_d6b5762d:

    # jov "Capturing these moments feels like I'm keeping something precious forever."
    jov "这些时刻都是我最珍贵的东西，我要永远保存。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:729
translate chinese skystressrelief_5360e246:

    # jov "I just hope we can keep these good times going..."
    jov "我只希望这样的好日子可以一直持续下去……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:731
translate chinese skystressrelief_779f8909:

    # jov "This entry's hard... [mc]'s been feeling sick a lot..."
    jov "今天的视频有点难受……[mc!t]最近病得很重……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:732
translate chinese skystressrelief_d9d517dc:

    # jov "The coughing doesn't stop, and it's not just a regular cold..."
    jov "咳嗽怎么也停不下来，而且也不是普通的感冒……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:733
translate chinese skystressrelief_f9078927:

    # jov "He's also been clumsy, tripping over nothing, which isn't like him..."
    jov "他还变得笨手笨脚的，莫名其妙就会摔倒，非常不正常……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:734
translate chinese skystressrelief_fdae40df:

    # jov "And he looks pale, even though we've been outside a lot. It's got to be something more..."
    jov "而且他肤色也很白，尽管我们经常带他出去玩。肯定是出什么事了……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:735
translate chinese skystressrelief_cbbde31e:

    # jov "You can tell, he's not his usual self..."
    jov "一下子就能看出来，他非常不正常……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:736
translate chinese skystressrelief_92ab26d2:

    # jov "It's hard seeing him try to keep up with Sky and get tired so fast..."
    jov "看到他努力想跟上斯凯，却很快就累了，我心里非常难受……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:737
translate chinese skystressrelief_66d6d74a:

    # jov "He's frustrated because he can't keep going like she does..."
    jov "他没法跟她一样，肯定心里很不高兴……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:738
translate chinese skystressrelief_933e1961:

    # jov "The nights are tougher. His coughing keeps us all up..."
    jov "到了夜里就更不好受。他一直咳嗽，让我们每个人都睡不着……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:739
translate chinese skystressrelief_7f46bd6b:

    # jov "I stay with him, holding his hand, until he falls asleep..."
    jov "我陪着他，握着他的手，一直到他睡着……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:740
translate chinese skystressrelief_9a47b291:

    # jov "Even in his sleep, he's restless..."
    jov "哪怕睡着了，他也没法安心……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:741
translate chinese skystressrelief_96ac6b26:

    # jov "I keep hoping it'll get better, but deep down, I'm worried..."
    jov "我一直希望能有好转，但心底却只有担心……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:742
translate chinese skystressrelief_1c7de57a:

    # jov "We've got doctor appointments lined up. I'm trying to be strong for Klara and Sky, but I'm scared. What if..."
    jov "我们已经预约了医生。我一直为了克拉拉和斯凯在保持坚强，但我其实很害怕。万一……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:743
translate chinese skystressrelief_2ca82780:

    # jov "*sighs* I need to stop here..."
    jov "*叹气* 就拍到这里吧……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:745
translate chinese skystressrelief_7ecc8c20:

    # jov "Things have been non-stop, but we're most worried about [mc]'s health."
    jov "事情一直忙个不停，但我们最担心的还是[mc!t]的身体。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:746
translate chinese skystressrelief_713fe2c4:

    # jov "It's been a constant worry in the back of our minds."
    jov "我们心里的忧愁一刻都没有停下来过。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:747
translate chinese skystressrelief_cbdee9aa:

    # jov "Sky, being younger, is so energetic, always dragging [mc] into her adventures."
    jov "斯凯年龄小，特别活泼，总是拉着[mc!t]到处冒险。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:748
translate chinese skystressrelief_95dbf363:

    # jov "It's beautiful to see her trying to cheer him up, even if she doesn't fully understand. Their bond is the bright spot in all this."
    jov "看到她尽管不太理解情况，但还是给他加油打气，我心里好受多了。他们之间的感情是我唯一的慰藉。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:749
translate chinese skystressrelief_2f9c39f3:

    # jov "On good days, [mc] is almost like his old self, laughing and playing with Sky."
    jov "情况好的时候，[mc!t]几乎就跟以前一样了，跟斯凯一起玩，一起笑。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:750
translate chinese skystressrelief_2b660381:

    # jov "But on bad days, he can't even get out of bed. Those days are tough on everyone."
    jov "但是情况不好的时候，他连床都下不了。那些日子对每个人来说都实在受不了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:751
translate chinese skystressrelief_24d8e691:

    # jov "Explaining to Sky why [mc] can't play is heartbreaking."
    jov "跟斯凯解释[mc!t]为什么没法陪她玩让我心都碎了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:752
translate chinese skystressrelief_82c0b6f0:

    # jov "But focusing on [mc] and Sky keeps us going. They remind us of what matters most."
    jov "但是[mc!t]和斯凯是我们前进的动力。他们让我们知道最重要的东西是什么。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:753
translate chinese skystressrelief_16f783ff:

    # jov "We take it one day at a time, cherishing the good and staying strong through the bad."
    jov "我们就过好每一天，珍惜好日子，咬牙度过不好的日子。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:754
translate chinese skystressrelief_0bc883ec:

    # jov "It won't be easy, but with [mc] and Sky's light, we keep hope alive."
    jov "肯定不会容易，但有了[mc!t]和斯凯这两道光，我们就有希望。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:755
translate chinese skystressrelief_620f8a10:

    # jov "Yes, there's still hope in all this. I won't give up."
    jov "没错，还是有希望的。我不会放弃。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:757
translate chinese skystressrelief_8a4da593:

    # jov "The last few weeks have been hard. [mc]'s laughter, which used to fill our home, has gone quiet."
    jov "这几个星期过得很艰难。以前家里满是[mc!t]的笑声，可现在也听不到了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:758
translate chinese skystressrelief_0e46b3a8:

    # jov "His energy, now drained by constant tiredness."
    jov "他每天都昏昏沉沉的，一点劲也没有。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:759
translate chinese skystressrelief_824faef6:

    # jov "Sky tries to help in her own sweet way, her little hands bringing comfort."
    jov "斯凯一直都在用她自己的方式帮忙，想用她的小手安慰我们。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:760
translate chinese skystressrelief_4de61ef6:

    # jov "And Klara's been so strong for us, but I can see it's wearing on her."
    jov "克拉拉也很坚强，但是我看得出来她也快支持不住了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:761
translate chinese skystressrelief_813d8add:

    # jov "If only I could find something, anything, to help [mc]..."
    jov "我只希望我能找到办法，不管是什么办法都行，救救[mc!t]……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:763
translate chinese skystressrelief_ea57f8c5:

    # jov "Jovian. Entry for April 6th, XXXX."
    jov "我是乔维安。这是XXXX年4月6日的记录。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:764
translate chinese skystressrelief_c9920410:

    # jov "In my search for answers, I've explored every option, reaching out to old colleagues, even those whose research has ventured into... unconventional territories."
    jov "我在不断地想办法，联系以前的同事，就连那些研究……不太寻常的领域的人也没落下。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:765
translate chinese skystressrelief_5ca2593b:

    # jov "I've heard about new treatments, stuff that sounds almost too good to be true."
    jov "我听说了新的治疗方法，效果好到不像是真的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:766
translate chinese skystressrelief_825d78e3:

    # jov "It's a long shot, but I'm willing to try anything."
    jov "希望依然渺茫，但我什么都愿意试。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:767
translate chinese skystressrelief_4b721bb7:

    # mc "Unconventional territories? What are you getting into?"
    mc "不寻常的领域？你要做什么？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:768
translate chinese skystressrelief_e612037c_2:

    # m "..."
    m "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:770
translate chinese skystressrelief_a9c394af:

    # jov "Entry for April 9th, XXXX. Tonight, seeing [mc] struggle to sleep hit me hard."
    jov "这是XXXX年4月9日的记录。今晚，看到[mc!t]怎么也睡不着，让我心如刀割。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:771
translate chinese skystressrelief_3612ac8e:

    # jov "This isn't just fighting an illness anymore; it's going to be a fight for our future. [mc]'s future."
    jov "这已经不止是在抗争病魔了；这是为了我们的未来，为了[mc!t]的未来而战。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:772
translate chinese skystressrelief_a81c3e16:

    # jov "I'm ready to do anything, even deal with devils, if it means giving him a chance."
    jov "只要能救他，我什么都可以做，哪怕是跟魔鬼做交易。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:773
translate chinese skystressrelief_dfbfa956:

    # jov "Tomorrow, I'll meet up with Bonheur, who's got connections. He says he has something big. It's risky, but what choice do I have?"
    jov "明天，我会去和博纳尔见面，他有一些人脉。他说他有非常有效的办法。风险很大，但我还有什么办法呢？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:774
translate chinese skystressrelief_ee70e454:

    # jov "I wish I could talk to Klara about it, but I can't. She'd stop me. But I can't just watch [mc] suffer."
    jov "我真希望我能和克拉拉聊聊这事，但是不行。她会阻止我的。可是我不能眼看着[mc!t]受苦。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:776
translate chinese skystressrelief_90aab321:

    # jov "Entry for April 10th, XXXX. Bonheur's offer is hanging over me, full of promise and risk."
    jov "这是XXXX年4月10日的记录。博纳尔的提议充满希望，又十分危险，我心里非常纠结。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:777
translate chinese skystressrelief_09862dc9:

    # jov "He talks about a \"universal cure\", something that could fix everything. But there's a catch."
    jov "他说他有“万能药”，包治百病。但我要答应他的一个条件。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:778
translate chinese skystressrelief_69f41301:

    # jov "We've run out of options. We're admitting [mc] to the hospital."
    jov "我们没得选了。我们要把[mc!t]送到医院去了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:779
translate chinese skystressrelief_e7703b59:

    # jov "If only these doctors were the least bit competent, but they're proving useless day after day."
    jov "要是这些医生能帮上忙就好了，可是我只觉得他们一天更比一天没用。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:780
translate chinese skystressrelief_36d1d34c:

    # jov "Looking into [mc]'s eyes, I know I have to be ready for whatever comes next."
    jov "看着[mc!t]的眼睛，我心里明白，我要为接下来的事情做好准备。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:784
translate chinese skystressrelief_44266eba:

    # jov "This is Jovian. Entry for April 12th, XXXX. It's [mc]'s second day in the hospital."
    jov "我是乔维安。这是XXXX年4月12日的记录。今天是[mc!t]住院的第二天。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:787
translate chinese skystressrelief_ec854389:

    # jov "The doctors... they've confirmed it. [mc], my little boy, just three years old, he's got a terminal brain tumor."
    jov "医生们……已经确认了。[mc!t]，可怜的孩子，才三岁，就得了晚期的脑肿瘤。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:788
translate chinese skystressrelief_b8bbbd67:

    # jov "I couldn't... I couldn't just sit there and do nothing. So, I sought out Bonheur, a trusted friend, a brilliant mind, once known as a leading scientist."
    jov "我没法……我没法什么也不做。所以，我去找了博纳尔，一个我信得过的朋友，他很聪明，以前是很出名的科学家。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:791
translate chinese skystressrelief_ea6e60aa:

    # jov "I pleaded with him, desperate for any cure, anything that could save [mc] from his cruel fate."
    jov "我跟他求了情，让他想想办法，只要能救[mc!t]，怎么样都可以。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:794
translate chinese skystressrelief_d5d8d933:

    # jov "And Bonheur... had something. A miracle drug, he called it. Claimed it could cure any illness."
    jov "而博纳尔……真的有办法。他有一种奇迹之药。说是包治百病。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:795
translate chinese skystressrelief_544fb8f9:

    # jov "But the cost... is being in debt to him, possibly for the rest of my life."
    jov "但是代价……大概就是我的余生都要亏欠他。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:796
translate chinese skystressrelief_70dec081:

    # jov "But what is debt compared to [mc]'s life? I didn't hesitate, not for a second. I accepted it, all for [mc], to save him."
    jov "可是人情债跟[mc!t]的命比起来算什么？我一秒钟都没有犹豫。我接受了，一切都是为了救[mc!t]。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:799
translate chinese skystressrelief_462952bf:

    # jov "This... this right here... is called the {i}\"Chimera Genesis Serum\"{/i}."
    jov "这个东西……这个瓶子里面……装的就是{i}“嵌合体创生血清”{/i}。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:800
translate chinese skystressrelief_4ee06837:

    # jov "It seems this serum is... the future of warfare between the Glabia and Sha Crea territories."
    jov "似乎这个血清……将来会被用在格拉比亚和沙克雷亚的战争里。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:801
translate chinese skystressrelief_7c59fa65:

    # jov "In their longstanding conflict, Glabia plans to use it as a covert weapon."
    jov "冲突已经持续了很久，格拉比亚把这东西当做是反败为胜的武器。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:804
translate chinese skystressrelief_0d165a57:

    # jov "There, it's known by a rather cryptic name:"
    jov "在那里，这东西有一个让人摸不到头脑的名字："

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:805
translate chinese skystressrelief_1ea067cd:

    # jov "... The {i}\"Numbers Serum\"{/i}." with Dissolve(2.0)
    jov "……{i}“编号血清”{/i}。" with Dissolve(2.0)

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:808
translate chinese skystressrelief_2da110d7:

    # m "All the others were always created in pairs, like One and Two. My friends, Five and Six, then Seven and Eight."
    m "其他人，比如一号和二号，都是被成对创造出来的。我的朋友，五号和六号，七号和八号，都是一样。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:809
translate chinese skystressrelief_b312a451:

    # m "It always made me wonder... why was I the only one created alone? Why just me?"
    m "我一直在想……为什么我是唯一一个被单独创造出来的？为什么只有我？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:810
translate chinese skystressrelief_9c4d9bfa:

    # m "[mc]...you're...how..."
    m "[mc!t]……你……怎么会……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:811
translate chinese skystressrelief_1b9428f0:

    # mc "I was too young to remember, and given my weak memory, I've got no single clue... I guess we're about to find out."
    mc "我当时太小了，什么也记不住，而且我的记忆力又差，对此一无所知……接着看应该就会明白了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:813
translate chinese skystressrelief_81e69b41:

    # jov "The hospital's too quiet at night, eerie almost."
    jov "医院里晚上非常安静，安静到诡异了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:814
translate chinese skystressrelief_038a97e0:

    # jov "It's just me here, listening to the faint beeps of the machines, and [mc]'s breathing too lightly for comfort."
    jov "这里只有我一个人，听着机器轻微的运作声，还有[mc!t]微微的呼吸声，聊以抚慰。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:815
translate chinese skystressrelief_281f63ce:

    # jov "Here I am, holding what they call a miracle in a vial. My hands are shaking as I prep the syringe."
    jov "我现在手里的小瓶里装的东西，被其他人称作“奇迹”。我在准备注射器的时候，手一直在发抖。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:816
translate chinese skystressrelief_26c52dac:

    # jov "Never thought I'd find myself in a hero's shoes, especially like this."
    jov "从来没想过我能成为英雄，更别说还是这个样子了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:817
translate chinese skystressrelief_3401b8ed:

    # jov "I keep looking over my shoulder, making sure we're still alone. This has to stay under wraps; the doctors can't find out."
    jov "我不断地东张西望，确保没有其他人在。这事一定要保密；绝对不能让医生知道。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:818
translate chinese skystressrelief_869096b1:

    # jov "I must do this, I must do this, I must do this... It's going to be okay..."
    jov "我必须这么做，我必须这么做，我必须这么做……一定会没事的……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:819
translate chinese skystressrelief_fa9409e7:

    # jov "*taking a deep breath* I need to stay calm..."
    jov "*深呼吸* 要冷静才行……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:820
translate chinese skystressrelief_7558ca00:

    # jov "Now, injecting the serum..."
    jov "现在，开始注射血清……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:822
translate chinese skystressrelief_248f6838:

    # jov "..."
    jov "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:823
translate chinese skystressrelief_7f71d759:

    # jov "...."
    jov "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:824
translate chinese skystressrelief_bd2c78ea:

    # jov "Time check: it's eleven at night, [mc] is still unresponsive. I guess this is a waiting game."
    jov "现在是晚上十一点。[mc!t]依然没有反应。看来只能继续等。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:825
translate chinese skystressrelief_969879cb:

    # jov "I'm hoping for that miracle or bracing for the fallout of my choice."
    jov "我希望奇迹发生，不然就只能承担我的选择带来的后果。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:826
translate chinese skystressrelief_7e4fd310:

    # jov "Sinking back into my chair, I'll keep my eyes on [mc] as the night stretches on. No matter what happens next, I stand by my decision."
    jov "外面的夜越来越浓，我瘫在椅子上，紧紧盯着[mc!t]。不管接下来发生什么，我都会为我的决定负责。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:827
translate chinese skystressrelief_40951379:

    # jov "For better... or worse..."
    jov "不管是好……是坏……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:829
translate chinese skystressrelief_204483dd:

    # jov "It's only been a few days since that night, and then, out of nowhere, [mc] woke up."
    jov "那晚之后才过了几天，[mc!t]突然就醒了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:830
translate chinese skystressrelief_58a8f798:

    # jov "Just like that, as if he was never sick in the first place. It was a complete 180."
    jov "轻描淡写，如同他根本就没病过一样。180度大转弯。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:831
translate chinese skystressrelief_74e46cd8:

    # jov "One minute we're steeling ourselves for the worst, and the next, he's sitting up in bed, wondering what's for breakfast like it was any normal day."
    jov "我们上一秒还在做心理准备，准备迎接最坏的结果，但下一秒他就从床上坐了起来，问早饭要吃什么，好像今天就是普通的一天一样。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:832
translate chinese skystressrelief_ba53a847:

    # jov "The doctors were stumped. They're throwing around the word \"miracle\" like it's going out of style. They don't have the faintest clue about what I did..."
    jov "医生们全都懵了。跟疯了一样不断地说着“奇迹”这个词。他们压根不知道我做了什么……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:833
translate chinese skystressrelief_f38a24d5:

    # jov "They wanted to run some tests on [mc], but I refused and had him discharged immediately."
    jov "他们还想再给[mc!t]做些检查，但我拒绝了，立刻给他办了出院手续。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:834
translate chinese skystressrelief_13ce4f79:

    # jov "There's no way I would let those incompetents discover this ground breaker."
    jov "我绝对不可能让这群废物知道如此重要的事。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:835
translate chinese skystressrelief_d378e29b:

    # jov "... Watching [mc] now, all energy and smiles, you'd never know how close we were to saying goodbye."
    jov "……看着[mc!t]现在的样子，充满活力地笑着，怎么也不可能想到我们离失去他只有一步之遥。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:836
translate chinese skystressrelief_9a5d197b:

    # jov "It feels like we've been given a second shot, though I'm still trying to wrap my head around the price."
    jov "我们得到了第二次机会，不过我还是忍不住会去想为了这一切而付出的代价。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:837
translate chinese skystressrelief_cccc2bf1:

    # jov "But right now, seeing him running around, all that worry and uncertainty just melts away."
    jov "可是现在，看到他跑来跑去的样子，所有的担忧和不安全都消失了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:838
translate chinese skystressrelief_fda1a99e:

    # jov "I'm under no illusions about this serum, or what I agreed to with Bonheur. There's gonna be fallout, no doubt about it."
    jov "我非常明白那个血清是什么东西，非常明白我和博纳尔做了什么交易。毫无疑问，事情远远没有结束。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:839
translate chinese skystressrelief_da009526:

    # jov "But for the moment, I'm just soaking in the gratitude. All grateful for [mc]'s laughter echoing through the house, for his bright eyes shining back at me."
    jov "但是眼下，我心里只有感恩。感恩家里又响起了[mc!t]的笑声，他闪闪发光的眼睛又能看着我了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:840
translate chinese skystressrelief_012560c7:

    # jov "I didn't record this as some sort of confession. It's proof of how far a [landlord]'s willing to go for his [tenant]."
    jov "我留下这些记录不是为了坦白认罪。这是[landlord!t]为了[tenant!t]甘愿付出一切的证明。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:841
translate chinese skystressrelief_abd2c39b:

    # jov "Someday, I might find the guts to lay all this out for [mc], and explain the whole story. For now, I'm gonna sit back and watch this play out."
    jov "或许有一天，我会有勇气把这些视频拿给[mc!t]看，向他说出一切。但是现在，我还是静静地观察事态会如何发展吧。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:842
translate chinese skystressrelief_c67c792e:

    # jov "Although... I feel like I need come clean with Klara about everything. But seeing her smile... maybe it's better if I just keep my mouth shut."
    jov "不过……我觉得我得把事情都告诉克拉拉。可是看到她的笑容……我又觉得可能还是保持沉默更好。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:843
translate chinese skystressrelief_4cb35732:

    # jov "And lastly, before I shut this whole thing down, I'm going to be honest. This wasn't just some vlog anymore. It turned into a whole documentary of secrets"
    jov "最后，在我完全关掉这东西之前，我要说句实话。这已经不止是VLOG了。早就变成了一大堆秘密的纪录片。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:844
translate chinese skystressrelief_915719fd:

    # jov "So yeah, I've decided to stop it here, to keep this \"documentary\" under wraps."
    jov "所以，我决定到此为止了，这个“纪录片”就拍到这里吧。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:845
translate chinese skystressrelief_1309fd92:

    # jov "I just want to take this second chance and make it work with them. [mc], Sky, Klara... they're all my beacon of hope."
    jov "我只想抓住这第二次机会，和他们一起好好生活。[mc!t]，斯凯，克拉拉……他们都是我的希望。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:846
translate chinese skystressrelief_643f1b9f:

    # jov "Goodbye..."
    jov "再见了……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:849
translate chinese skystressrelief_6bde2581:

    # mc "*takes a deep breath*..."
    mc "*深呼吸* ……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:850
translate chinese skystressrelief_b24f08f4:

    # mc "... What have you done to me?"
    mc "……你们对我做了什么？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:851
translate chinese skystressrelief_7e262da6:

    # k "I... don't know what to say. [mc], I'm so sorry, I..."
    k "我……不知道该说什么。[mc!t]，真的对不起，我……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:852
translate chinese skystressrelief_6cf59192:

    # mc "No, it's not on you. You heard what he said..."
    mc "不，不怪你。你也听到他说的话了……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:853
translate chinese skystressrelief_f707f76c:

    # k "Oh my god...!"
    k "我的天……！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:854
translate chinese skystressrelief_0a74bde0:

    # mc "I'm thankful to be alive because of him. But why didn't anyone tell me about my illness? It's something I should know, isn't it?"
    mc "因为他，我才活了下来，为此我感谢他。可为什么没人跟我说过我得病的事？这难道不是我应该知道的事吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:855
translate chinese skystressrelief_72bdc1c5:

    # k "You always want to know everything, and I was scared I couldn't answer your questions."
    k "你总是想知道一切，我害怕我没法回答你的问题。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:856
translate chinese skystressrelief_7fb271fb:

    # k "I knew Jovian had some shady connections from his past job, but I never knew exactly what he was up to. He kept things to himself in those last days..."
    k "我知道乔维安因为他之前的工作积累了一些不正经的人脉，但是我从来都不清楚他具体干了些什么。最后那段日子里，他总是把一切都瞒着别人……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:857
translate chinese skystressrelief_783a5061:

    # k "Seeing you get better truly felt like a miracle, one I was scared to question."
    k "你能康复真的是个奇迹，甚至到了让我害怕提出问题的地步。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:858
translate chinese skystressrelief_0496a3ed:

    # k "Your getting better was the only good thing at that time, and I was terrified that asking too many questions would ruin that."
    k "那段时间，你的病治好了是唯一的好事，我害怕问太多问题会让一切都化为乌有。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:859
translate chinese skystressrelief_5ed24624:

    # k "I thought not knowing was worth it if it meant you were healthy and we were happy."
    k "我想着只要你能健康，能开心，那我就算不搞清楚也值了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:860
translate chinese skystressrelief_ef11165a:

    # k "But you're right. You deserved to know. I just didn't have the answers."
    k "但是你说得对。你理应知道。我只是没有答案。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:861
translate chinese skystressrelief_6dc0a863:

    # k "And maybe I was too scared to look for them, scared of what it might mean for us. I'm really sorry."
    k "而且我可能也太害怕答案背后隐藏着的东西，不敢去寻找答案。真的很抱歉。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:862
translate chinese skystressrelief_100718c9:

    # k "I wish I could give you the closure you're looking for. All I can say is, he did it all because he loved you."
    k "我也希望我能如你所愿，让你释怀。我能说的只有……他做这些都是因为他爱你。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:863
translate chinese skystressrelief_2b35b6fe_4:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:864
translate chinese skystressrelief_544bb780:

    # e "So... what exactly is going on here? I still can't wrap my head around all this."
    e "所以……到底是怎么回事？我还是没有太搞明白。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:865
translate chinese skystressrelief_5371163e:

    # mc "Or, the real question... what does that make us? Looking at you, I don't feel so different from anyone else."
    mc "真正的问题是……我们两个是什么情况？我觉得我和普通人没有什么区别，和你完全不一样。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:866
translate chinese skystressrelief_7c19e29f:

    # m "I don't know all the details about the serum. But it might explain why we feel connected."
    m "血清的事，我也不是全都清楚。但说不定这就可以解释为什么我们会感觉被连在一起了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:867
translate chinese skystressrelief_68570e97:

    # m "They called us the \"Numbers\". There were two groups of us."
    m "他们是用“编号者”称呼我们的。我们一共有两拨人。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:868
translate chinese skystressrelief_f3005fc9:

    # m "We, the first ten subjects, were the \"Early Stages\". Then came the \"Mass Productions\"..."
    m "我们，最早的十个实验体，是“早期型”。之后的则是“量产型”……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:869
translate chinese skystressrelief_28a66d48:

    # m "I don't know the reasons, but the first ten were supposed to be in pairs. I ended up being made alone."
    m "我并不知道原因，但最早的十个理应都是成对的。可我却孤身一人。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:870
translate chinese skystressrelief_2b607e1c:

    # m "That's all I understand. The only one who really knows about the serum is its creator."
    m "我就只知道这么多。真正懂血清的只有它的制造者。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:871
translate chinese skystressrelief_b42debc9:

    # mc "Which means Bonheur..."
    mc "也就是博纳尔……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:872
translate chinese skystressrelief_2b35b6fe_5:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:873
translate chinese skystressrelief_a53d486d:

    # k "[mc], what are you thinking? You surely can't be considering..."
    k "[mc!t]，你在想什么？该不会是……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:874
translate chinese skystressrelief_933245f5:

    # mc "It's nothing. I'm just thinking about what [landlord] did, and how our destinies got intertwined. Seems like we're being played with."
    mc "没什么。我只是在想[landlord!t]做的事，还有我们的命运是怎么纠缠在一起的。看来我们都被玩弄在股掌之间。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:876
translate chinese skystressrelief_05a3a683:

    # mc "So, where is he now?"
    mc "他现在在哪？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:877
translate chinese skystressrelief_fac5f93c:

    # ew "The answer is in the next folder."
    ew "答案就在下一个文件夹里。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:878
translate chinese skystressrelief_4245a7d2:

    # k "[mc], maybe we should-"
    k "[mc!t]，要不我们还是——"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:879
translate chinese skystressrelief_78143fee:

    # mc "We've waited long enough. It's time to finish this, right?"
    mc "已经等了够久了。是时候结束了，对吧？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:880
translate chinese skystressrelief_82091822_1:

    # k "..."
    k "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:881
translate chinese skystressrelief_a302aea6:

    # k "Yes..."
    k "是的……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:884
translate chinese skystressrelief_e1c383de:

    # jov "*takes a deep breath*"
    jov "*深呼吸*"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:885
translate chinese skystressrelief_ffedb550:

    # jov "It's been several years, and I never thought I'd turn this thing up once more..."
    jov "已经好几年了，我从来没想过我居然还会再打开摄像机……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:886
translate chinese skystressrelief_fa0579d9:

    # jov "So much has changed, especially myself... I started to work for Bonheur."
    jov "很多东西都变了，我自己更是变了……我开始给博纳尔干活了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:887
translate chinese skystressrelief_11ca254f:

    # jov "Once, I counted time in milestones: [mc]'s first steps, Sky's first word. Now, it's measured in jobs completed."
    jov "以前，我是用里程碑来记载时间的流逝的：[mc!t]会走路了，斯凯会说话了。现在，变成了完成的工作的数量。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:888
translate chinese skystressrelief_dc31bb07:

    # jov "The serum kept [mc] alive, yes, but what did it cost?"
    jov "那个血清是保住了[mc!t]的命，但代价是什么？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:889
translate chinese skystressrelief_555dd3ee:

    # jov "Klara doesn't ask anything. But I see it in her eyes... there's a hint of suspicion."
    jov "克拉拉什么都没问。但是我能从她的眼神里看出来……她有所怀疑。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:890
translate chinese skystressrelief_59c0c9e0:

    # jov "\"It's honest work\", I lied, and my voice sounded as hollow as I feel. I can't even speak like myself anymore..."
    jov "我骗她说，“是正经的工作”。我的声音就和我的内心一样空洞。我甚至都没法好好说话了……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:892
translate chinese skystressrelief_6e4c93cb:

    # jov "Completed my first... questionable job for Bonheur. The details... better left unsaid."
    jov "给博纳尔……干完了第一件脏活。细节……还是不说了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:893
translate chinese skystressrelief_8210de7f:

    # jov "Each task takes a piece of me, but the thought of [mc] and Sky, healthy and laughing, keeps me going."
    jov "每项任务都让我心烦意乱，但一想到[mc!t]和斯凯能快乐地健康成长，我就能继续干下去。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:894
translate chinese skystressrelief_25d8b9ff:

    # jov "Although... my hands are shaking. Not from fear, but from... disgust. What have I become?"
    jov "尽管……我的手一直在抖。不是因为害怕，而是因为……恶心。我变成了什么样子？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:895
translate chinese skystressrelief_47a5840c:

    # jov "Klara's having trouble looking me in the eyes. Is it pity, worry, or does she know?"
    jov "克拉拉开始不愿意直视我的眼睛了。是出于同情，担心，还是她知道了？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:896
translate chinese skystressrelief_b5e9b710:

    # jov "Can she sense the change in me, the stench of it clinging to my skin?"
    jov "她能感受到我的变化吗？能闻见我身上满溢的恶臭吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:897
translate chinese skystressrelief_9e8e5bd8:

    # jov "Sky wants to play. Wants to build a castle, she says. As if my world isn't crumbling to sand around me. How can her eyes still shine so brightly?"
    jov "斯凯想玩。说是想建一座城堡。可我的世界早就像沙子一样崩塌了。她的眼睛怎么还能如此明亮？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:898
translate chinese skystressrelief_56f0a816:

    # jov "[mc] smiles at me. I smile back, but inside I scream. Do I have it in me to finally tell him?"
    jov "[mc!t]对我笑了。我也对他笑了，可我心里却在尖叫。我有胆量把一切都告诉他吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:899
translate chinese skystressrelief_4cf81ed8:

    # jov "No, I don't have the strength to..."
    jov "不，我实在做不到……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:901
translate chinese skystressrelief_0346f7a0:

    # jov "Klara finally notices the changes, the late nights, the silence. It was clearly worry that was in her eyes."
    jov "克拉拉终于意识到了变化，意识到我常常夜不归宿，意识到家里越来越多的沉默。她的眼睛里显然充满了担忧。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:902
translate chinese skystressrelief_d0cc216b:

    # jov "She hasn't asked outright... yet. But the questions hang heavy in the silence between us."
    jov "她暂时……还没有直接问我什么。可是我们之间沉重的沉默里早就充斥着疑问了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:903
translate chinese skystressrelief_47c528fa:

    # jov "\"Where do you go?\", \"Why are you always so tired?\". If only she knew."
    jov "“你去哪了？”，“你怎么总是那么累？”……她根本想象不到这些问题的答案。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:904
translate chinese skystressrelief_c4ed98f8:

    # jov "Mealtimes are the worst. Their laughter feels so far away. Klara watches me push food around my plate."
    jov "吃饭的时候是最难熬的。他们的笑声感觉那么遥远。克拉拉一直看着我把盘子里的饭菜推来推去。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:905
translate chinese skystressrelief_712ce20c:

    # jov "Even Sky hugs me tighter these days. The guilt is starting to suffocate me."
    jov "就连斯凯在这些天里也抱我抱得更紧了。罪恶感几乎要把我活活吞掉。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:906
translate chinese skystressrelief_565ee304:

    # jov "\"Are you okay?\", Sky would typically ask, her little brow furrows. I'd just force a smile. \"Just peachy, sweetheart.\"."
    jov "“你没事吧？”，斯凯经常这么问，问的时候皱着小小的眉头。我只能强忍着挤出一个微笑。“我非常好，宝贝。”"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:907
translate chinese skystressrelief_3e018486:

    # jov "Liar. Monster. That's what I am."
    jov "骗子。怪物。这就是现在的我。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:909
translate chinese skystressrelief_2279444f:

    # jov "The more I do for Bonheur, the further I drift from the man I was. The line between right and wrong blurs."
    jov "我给博纳尔做的事越多，就离曾经的自己越远。对和错之间的界限早已模糊不清。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:910
translate chinese skystressrelief_46791a2e:

    # jov "My hands, once held the kids, now... I can't bear to look at them."
    jov "我的双手，曾经是用来抱住孩子们的，现在……我却连看都不忍看。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:911
translate chinese skystressrelief_bd02958f:

    # jov "Klara's plan was a lifeline tossed to me, and I let it slip through my fingers."
    jov "克拉拉之前的计划是我的一线生机，可我却没有把握住。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:912
translate chinese skystressrelief_b8213919:

    # jov "\"We can work together from now on, Jovian. We'll leave, and start fresh for the kids.\"... She believed in me, when I'd stopped believing in myself."
    jov "“我们之后可以一起努力，乔维安。我们离开吧，为了孩子们，重新开始。”……她相信我，可我已经不相信我自己了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:913
translate chinese skystressrelief_8fbe234b:

    # jov "Why did I tell them to go first?"
    jov "我为什么会让他们先走？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:914
translate chinese skystressrelief_018470d8:

    # jov "Fear? Pride? Or some twisted part of me knew I'd never be able to follow?"
    jov "是害怕？是自尊心？还是我心中扭曲的那部分早就明白，我没法跟他们一起走？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:916
translate chinese skystressrelief_3327c02b:

    # jov "The plane took off without me. And soon, photos arrived... [mc] on a beach, laughing."
    jov "飞机起飞了。我没有在上面。很快，照片就来了……[mc!t]在沙滩上，笑得很开心。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:917
translate chinese skystressrelief_eeb0f32a:

    # jov "Sky making sandcastles, her eyes filled with wonder."
    jov "斯凯用沙子堆了城堡，眼里满是惊奇。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:918
translate chinese skystressrelief_db780091:

    # jov "Klara smiles in the pictures, but her eyes are distant."
    jov "照片里的克拉拉也在笑，可她的眼睛却看向远方。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:919
translate chinese skystressrelief_640ed5ee:

    # jov "It was a good decision to be left behind. My hands aren't fit to touch them anymore."
    jov "把我留下，是正确的决定。我的手已经没有资格触碰他们了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:920
translate chinese skystressrelief_9dac2100:

    # jov "Bonheur's tasks twist tighter, like a noose around my neck. Yet... what choice do I have?"
    jov "博纳尔的任务越来越紧迫，就像套在我脖子上的绞索。可是……我还有别的选择吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:922
translate chinese skystressrelief_ee635073:

    # jov "Bonheur's latest demand is unthinkable... Eliminate Hera's husband and son?"
    jov "博纳尔的最后一个要求简直不可理喻……杀掉赫拉的丈夫和儿子？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:923
translate chinese skystressrelief_1f2999ea:

    # jov "How did it come to this? The very thought threatens to tear me apart."
    jov "怎么会变成这样？光是想想，我整个人都几乎要撕裂开来。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:924
translate chinese skystressrelief_0e2fb301:

    # jov "My hands shake once again, and not from the usual fear. This is a different poison, seeping into my gut."
    jov "我的手又开始发抖，原因却不是往常的那种恐惧。这次是一种不一样的毒药，正渗透进我的骨髓。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:925
translate chinese skystressrelief_2f8e31fb:

    # jov "A monster, that's what Bonheur calls Hera. But who's the true monster here? The one fighting to survive, or the one with the power to crush her under his heel?"
    jov "博纳尔说赫拉是怪物。但谁才是真正的怪物？是挣扎求生的人，还是有能力把她踩碎在脚下的人？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:926
translate chinese skystressrelief_885d64b5:

    # jov "Is this the end of the line? The point where even I can't justify the price anymore?"
    jov "这就是终点了吗？让我再也无法粉饰这所谓的代价？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:928
translate chinese skystressrelief_b854a988:

    # jov "To refuse Bonheur is to sign a death warrant. To comply is to lose myself."
    jov "拒绝博纳尔，就是自掘坟墓。而服从他，我就再也不会是我自己了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:929
translate chinese skystressrelief_96c4d908:

    # jov "Yet again, I asked... What choice do I have? The serum's miracle... at what cost?"
    jov "可我再一次问我自己……我还有别的路可走吗？血清创造了奇迹……但代价是什么？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:930
translate chinese skystressrelief_c39bb81a:

    # jov "No, I can't let this go on any further. I've made my decision. There's a line I cannot cross, even for [mc]'s life."
    jov "不，不能再继续下去了。我已经做出了决定。这条底线，哪怕是为了[mc!t]的命，我也无法跨越。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:931
translate chinese skystressrelief_817b5097:

    # jov "Some prices are too high. I'm going to confront Bonheur and negotiate... or end this charade."
    jov "有的代价实在过于昂贵。我要去找博纳尔对质，跟他谈判……或者结束这场闹剧。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:933
translate chinese skystressrelief_3eb935e3:

    # jov "I'm cornered, with no way out. Bonheur's resorted to blackmail. If I defy him, he's threatened to target my loved ones, not me."
    jov "我走投无路了。没有任何办法。博纳尔选择威胁我。如果我不听话，他的目标不是我，而是我爱的人。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:934
translate chinese skystressrelief_46665a19:

    # jov "My defiance died the moment he held up that photo. Sky's smile, Klara's trusting eyes... my world reduced to a bargaining chip in Bonheur's cruel game."
    jov "他一把那张照片拿出来，我的反抗之心就完全消失不见了。斯凯的笑容，克拉拉充满信任的眼神……我的世界只不过是博纳尔残酷游戏中的筹码。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:935
translate chinese skystressrelief_5b9f3ca4:

    # jov "\"A soul for a soul\", is what he said. I'm left with no option but to comply."
    jov "他说，“以命换命”。我别无选择，只能服从。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:936
translate chinese skystressrelief_fc660f23:

    # jov "It's not just [mc]'s life on the line anymore. They are all bound to this twisted fate I've woven for them."
    jov "已经不是只有[mc!t]命悬一线了。他们全都落入了我给他们编好的命运之网里。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:937
translate chinese skystressrelief_7821e555:

    # jov "Every smile, every carefree moment, it's all an illusion I can no longer sustain."
    jov "每个微笑，每个轻松的瞬间，都只是我已无力维持下去的幻象。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:938
translate chinese skystressrelief_fde868b4:

    # jov "I have to do it, for the sake of keeping them safe."
    jov "为了护他们周全，我只能去做。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:940
translate chinese skystressrelief_e12083e8:

    # jov "I... I've done it... I took the lives of Hera's family..."
    jov "我……我动手了……我杀掉了赫拉的家人……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:941
translate chinese skystressrelief_f0ffacd2:

    # jov "Hera's son, just a newborn infant. I... I could hear its cries as I took its life."
    jov "赫拉的儿子，只是个刚出生的婴儿。我……我还能听见我动手的时候他的哭喊。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:942
translate chinese skystressrelief_a38efbbd:

    # jov "It's like it was pleading with me, to forgive it of sins it has never committed."
    jov "就好像在恳求我，让我原谅他根本没有犯下的罪行一样。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:943
translate chinese skystressrelief_8282f177:

    # jov "If there is still any good in the world, I hope I can be forgiven for what I've done."
    jov "如果这世上依然还有善良存在的话，我希望我的所作所为能得到原谅。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:944
translate chinese skystressrelief_e711d9bb:

    # jov "I need to run away. Hide away from the world Bonheur represents, from everything. But protecting Klara, [mc], and Sky... there was no other choice."
    jov "我要逃跑。远离博纳尔代表的世界，远离一切。但要保护克拉拉，[mc!t]，还有斯凯……我别无选择。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:945
translate chinese skystressrelief_34284665:

    # jov "This is my last entry..."
    jov "这是我最后的记录了……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:946
translate chinese skystressrelief_6d96b7f7:

    # jov "Klara, if you're watching this, know that I did everything for you, for [mc], for Sky. Please forgive me..."
    jov "克拉拉，如果你在看的话，你要知道，我做这些事都是为了你，为了[mc!t]，为了斯凯。求你原谅我……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:947
translate chinese skystressrelief_cc9ef9ac:

    # ew "The next clips are from several years after he moved back..."
    ew "接下来的几条是他回来之后几年拍的……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:948
translate chinese skystressrelief_6c94f6f7:

    # ew "The house had been listed for sale. He seemed so desperate, we just had to take him in..."
    ew "那时候这个房子已经挂牌出售了。他看着很绝望，我们只能收留他……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:949
translate chinese skystressrelief_88215283:

    # ew "He was okay for a few years. We loved him, treated him like our own son, but the change of pace didn't really help his situation..."
    ew "前几年他还没什么问题。我们爱他，把他当亲生儿子一样对待。但是这也没有真正地帮到他……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:950
translate chinese skystressrelief_6c054319:

    # k "*sobs* I can't... I'm sorry, I just can't watch this anymore...!"
    k "*抽泣* 我没法……对不起，我真的不能继续看了……！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:951
translate chinese skystressrelief_c61f678a:

    # mc "[landlady]..."
    mc "[landlady!t]……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:953
translate chinese skystressrelief_0e6c84c6:

    # jov "Forgive me..."
    jov "原谅我吧……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:954
translate chinese skystressrelief_9077ecd4:

    # jov "Years passed and I still keep saying the words, as if repetition will make them true!"
    jov "过了好几年，我还是在说这句话，好像多说几遍就能成真一样！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:955
translate chinese skystressrelief_772d3e2c:

    # jov "It won't bring back that child! It won't absolve me of my sin!"
    jov "再怎么说，那个孩子也回不来了！我的罪孽也不会消失！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:956
translate chinese skystressrelief_22f01aa8:

    # jov "They say time heals all wounds... Lies!"
    jov "他们说时间可以治愈一切伤口……胡扯！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:957
translate chinese skystressrelief_75ab7e22:

    # jov "Every night, the cries of that child echo! No escape, not even in sleep! They haunt my dreams, my waking hours!"
    jov "每个晚上，都能听见那孩子的哭声！怎么也逃不过，就连在睡梦里也不行！醒着也好，睡着也好，一概不行！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:959
translate chinese skystressrelief_fb5ba0c1:

    # jov "I...I'm not alone anymore. T-t-there's always someone watching... In the corner of the room, a flicker in the mirror... that child's f-face... accusing me..."
    jov "这里……这里不止我一个人。一-一-一直都有别人在盯着我看……就在房间的角落里，或者在镜子里一闪而过……是-是那个孩子的脸……在指控我……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:960
translate chinese skystressrelief_6a8e4c69:

    # jov "It's whispers startle me awake at night... Just the creaking of the old house, or... No, a voice... Tiny, a whimper turning into a wail..."
    jov "整晚的低语让我夜不能寐……是这老房子老化的声音，还是……不，是人声……先是轻微的呜咽，然后变成了哭嚎……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:961
translate chinese skystressrelief_15aab777:

    # jov "It's the child!"
    jov "是那个孩子！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:962
translate chinese skystressrelief_ab354fa7:

    # jov "I cover my ears, but it's inside my head now, won't stop, won't STOP! STOPPPP!"
    jov "我捂上了耳朵，却又跑到了我脑袋里，怎么也不停下，不停下！{b}不停下！！！！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:963
translate chinese skystressrelief_fbe343a1:

    # jov "I-I didn't m-m-mean to do it, I PROMISE!"
    jov "我-我不是故-故意的，我发誓！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:964
translate chinese skystressrelief_7a1c90d7:

    # jov "But does it hear me...?"
    jov "但是他能听见我吗……？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:965
translate chinese skystressrelief_0d2eb37a:

    # jov "Does it even need to?! It knows! It sees into the black pit where my soul used to be! There's no hiding from that stare, no running from what I am!"
    jov "他需要听我说话吗？！他心里明白！他能看穿原本承载着我的灵魂的黑洞！根本逃不过他的视线，逃不过我的本性！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:967
translate chinese skystressrelief_517870be:

    # jov "T-they'll find me! Bonheur knows I failed!"
    jov "他-他们会找到我的！博纳尔知道我失败了！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:968
translate chinese skystressrelief_26fc9336:

    # jov "No, it's her – Hera! Blood on her hands, yes! But it's my blood staining them red!"
    jov "不，是她——赫拉！她手上沾满了血，没错！但那都是我的血！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:969
translate chinese skystressrelief_d358ff99:

    # jov "T-t-the child screaming, begging...! Wait, it wasn't me who did that, it was... someone else. Wasn't it?"
    jov "那-那-那个孩子在尖叫，在乞求……！等等，不是我做的，是……是别人。对吧？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:970
translate chinese skystressrelief_5378a88e:

    # jov "No, no, no, no... Can't be me, it can't be me... I can't be the monster... That other one, the one Bonheur created."
    jov "不，不，不，不……不可能，不可能是我……我怎么可能是怪物……是另一个人，是博纳尔创造的那个人。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:971
translate chinese skystressrelief_46ea1153:

    # jov "He wears my face, uses my hands, but... he's not me!"
    jov "他跟我有一样的脸，能操控我的手，但是……他不是我！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:973
translate chinese skystressrelief_0a702d6e:

    # jov "Sky drew a picture today. Stick figures. A family... but one is smaller, lying down."
    jov "斯凯今天画了一幅画。是火柴人的画。画里是一家人……但其中一个更小，躺在地上。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:974
translate chinese skystressrelief_59a49fda:

    # jov "Did she see? Does she KNOW what I did?"
    jov "她看到了吗？她知道我做过的事了吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:975
translate chinese skystressrelief_65813501:

    # jov "Her eyes were so proud when she showed me... \"It's us!\"."
    jov "她给我看的时候，眼神里全是自豪……“这是我们！”。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:976
translate chinese skystressrelief_c12c272f:

    # jov "Does she sense the blood on my hands, even when I try so hard to hide it?"
    jov "哪怕我竭尽全力隐藏，她还是能感觉得到我手上的血吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:977
translate chinese skystressrelief_0139b890:

    # jov "The picture... it's still on the fridge. That tiny figure haunts me. A child's way of saying, \"I know what kind of monster you are.\"."
    jov "那幅画……还贴在冰箱上。那个小人让我心神不宁。这就是孩子说“我知道你是什么样的怪物”的方式吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:978
translate chinese skystressrelief_6f2bad88:

    # jov "H-huh...? What's this camera doing in front of me...?"
    jov "什-什么……？我面前怎么会有摄像机……？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:980
translate chinese skystressrelief_8f99f447:

    # jov "There... in the bathtub. Water turns red, I swear it does. A tiny hand reaching up, splashing, then gone..."
    jov "快看……看浴缸。水变红了，我发誓，我看见了。一只小手伸了出来，扑腾了几下，又消失了……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:981
translate chinese skystressrelief_066bb984:

    # jov "Not real... not real... but the water is cold even though the tap never ran... How's that possible...?"
    jov "不是真的……不是真的……但是水龙头明明没有开，水却是凉的……这怎么可能……？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:983
translate chinese skystressrelief_36330a9e:

    # jov "The pills... they quiet the cries for a while. Not enough. Need something sharper."
    jov "吃药……可以让哭喊声停下一会儿。还不够。需要更锋利的东西。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:984
translate chinese skystressrelief_690725de:

    # jov "The knives in the kitchen drawer... they shine. A quick cut, maybe that'll wash the stain away..."
    jov "厨房抽屉里的刀……很闪亮。来一刀，说不定就能洗掉血污了……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:986
translate chinese skystressrelief_1ce9d7df:

    # jov "Sky's laughter drifts from downstairs. [mc]'s shouting something about his game."
    jov "斯凯的笑声从楼下传过来了。[mc!t]在喊着游戏里的什么东西。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:987
translate chinese skystressrelief_2b474958:

    # jov "I can hear them, I can hear them all!"
    jov "我能听见，我都能听见！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:989
translate chinese skystressrelief_c02b5f84:

    # jov "C-cold steel against my temple... A coolness, a sign of relief..."
    jov "冰-冰冷的钢铁顶着我的太阳穴……冰冷，是解脱的象征……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:990
translate chinese skystressrelief_d22c3d2f:

    # jov "One finger on the trigger... Huh, it's lighter than it should be..."
    jov "一根手指放在扳机上……呵，没想到这么轻……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:991
translate chinese skystressrelief_98e6c674:

    # k "No... No, no, no!"
    k "不……不，不要，不要！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:992
translate chinese skystressrelief_67a990f9:

    # jov "This is wrong, all of it, but... there's no other way..."
    jov "这是错的，全都是错的，但是……没有其他办法了……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:993
translate chinese skystressrelief_ef9c7426:

    # jov "No, this is right, this is the only way out! I must find my way out!"
    jov "不，这是对的，这是唯一的出路！我必须找到出路！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:994
translate chinese skystressrelief_b867b67b:

    # jov "Just a breath held... and then..."
    jov "只要屏住呼吸……然后……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:996
translate chinese skystressrelief_bb392f9c:

    # k "Wait, Jov-!"
    k "等等，乔维——！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:998
translate chinese skystressrelief_c0852b9e:

    # k "*gasps*"
    k "*倒吸一口气*"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1000
translate chinese skystressrelief_d04425f5:

    # k "*crying*"
    k "*哭泣*"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1001
translate chinese skystressrelief_e612037c_3:

    # m "..."
    m "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1002
translate chinese skystressrelief_6566ab01:

    # m "... I may not be in the right place to say this, but he did what he believed was necessary."
    m "……这话由我来说可能不合适，但他做了他觉得该做的事情。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1003
translate chinese skystressrelief_d6766536:

    # m "It's heart-wrenching to witness the lengths he went to, I understand."
    m "我明白，看到他变成那样，让人很揪心。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1004
translate chinese skystressrelief_7fab639a:

    # m "But his actions, as difficult as they are to come to terms with, were done for [mc], for you, and for Sky."
    m "但是他的行动，尽管难以接受，都是为了[mc!t]，为了你，还有为了斯凯。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1005
translate chinese skystressrelief_8c922c67:

    # m "He aimed to protect, to offer a chance at a life that seemed to be fading."
    m "他是为了保护一条即将逝去的生命。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1006
translate chinese skystressrelief_5df2a550:

    # k "*sobs* I... I just didn't realize how deep his despair went, the weight he's been carrying all those years...!"
    k "*抽泣* 我……我只是没想到他会那么绝望，那些年里他一直默默承受了这么多……！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1007
translate chinese skystressrelief_c4868861:

    # k "We were supposed to share that burden...!"
    k "我们本应该一同承担的……！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1008
translate chinese skystressrelief_45468aba:

    # m "None of us truly understood, not until today. The decisions he made, the paths he chose were all for a future he deeply believed in."
    m "我们都是直到今天才真正理解他。他做出的决定，他选择的道路，都是为了他深信不疑的未来。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1009
translate chinese skystressrelief_6aa73d07:

    # m "He was prepared to take on all the burdens, to pay any price."
    m "他已准备好承担一切，准备好付出任何代价。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1010
translate chinese skystressrelief_d892e1a5:

    # m "On a personal note, I'm thankful. Without him, I would never have met [mc]. I wouldn't have felt the warmth of belonging that all of you have shown me."
    m "就我个人来说，我很感激。没有他的话，我就不会遇见[mc!t]。也不会感受到你们给予我的充满归属感的温暖。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1011
translate chinese skystressrelief_0e782e47:

    # m "And if it weren't for him, we wouldn't be here to witness his final moments, no matter how grim."
    m "而且如果不是他的话，我们也就不会在这里见证他最后的时刻了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1012
translate chinese skystressrelief_bb4a117d:

    # m "I've experienced loss myself..."
    m "我自己就经历过失去……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1013
translate chinese skystressrelief_d8187d91:

    # m "Every choice carried the weight of life or death, not just for me, but for those I was responsible for."
    m "每个决定都承载着或生或死的重量，而且不只是我一个人，还有我要对其负责的人。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1014
translate chinese skystressrelief_6def1165:

    # m "There were times, burdened by the consequences of those choices, that haunt me."
    m "我也曾经被那些选择带来的后果困扰过。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1015
translate chinese skystressrelief_153a6798:

    # m "Instances when I had to decide who could be saved and who couldn't. It's a burden that alters you, molds you."
    m "有很多次，我都需要决定谁能被救下来，谁不能。这种负担会改变你，塑造你。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1016
translate chinese skystressrelief_9ee6e960:

    # m "Understanding his choices now... I relate to them more than I'd like. He waged his own battles, using every resource at his disposal, for your futures."
    m "我现在理解了他的选择……他在心里权衡了一切，用尽手头一切资源，想给你们更好的未来。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1017
translate chinese skystressrelief_cfc8ee70:

    # m "In the military, we talk a lot about sacrifice and duty. Jovian lived those values, not on a battlefield far away, but in the silent struggles he faced for [mc]."
    m "在军队里，我们经常谈牺牲，谈使命。乔维安就做到了这两点，不是在远方的战场上，而是在为了拯救[mc!t]的无声斗争里。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1018
translate chinese skystressrelief_31411edd:

    # m "Your pain is a testament to the love you all shared. And it's natural to feel adrift in it, to mourn the sacrifices made."
    m "你的痛苦证明了你们之间的爱。被痛苦吞噬，为牺牲哀悼，这都是自然的事。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1019
translate chinese skystressrelief_0cee3685:

    # m "It doesn't ease the pain, but it's important to come to terms with it."
    m "这并不会减轻痛苦，但重要的是要学会接受。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1020
translate chinese skystressrelief_acc43fb4:

    # m "Now, let me ask you..."
    m "现在，我问你……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1021
translate chinese skystressrelief_f95c7a86:

    # m "In the end, what does all your sorrow achieve? The tears, your cries?"
    m "到头来，你的悲伤，你的泪水，你的哭喊，能做到什么呢？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1022
translate chinese skystressrelief_efb6821d:

    # m "Can any of it bring him back?"
    m "能让他回来吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1023
translate chinese skystressrelief_82091822_2:

    # k "..."
    k "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1024
translate chinese skystressrelief_e80f1822:

    # k "No..."
    k "不能……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1025
translate chinese skystressrelief_fa02ee05:

    # m "Exactly. So, stand up, not for us, not for others, but for yourself. I'm certain he wouldn't have wanted to see you like this."
    m "没错。所以，站起来吧，不是为了我们，不是为了别人，而是为了你自己。我敢说他也不想看到你这个样子。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1027
translate chinese skystressrelief_c0995df6:

    # k "Thank you."
    k "谢谢你。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1028
translate chinese skystressrelief_ac3afacd:

    # m "Mhm."
    m "嗯。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1029
translate chinese skystressrelief_3c1d1031:

    # yt "I couldn't have articulated it better–actually, I doubt I'd find the right words to reach [landlady]."
    yt "我绝对没法说得比她更好——其实，我估计我都根本想不出合适的话对[landlady!t]说。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1030
translate chinese skystressrelief_71a9c21d:

    # yt "[landlady] doesn't easily trust others' words, so gaining her full trust takes time."
    yt "[landlady!t]不会轻易相信别人的话，要花很多时间才能完全获得她的信任。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1031
translate chinese skystressrelief_a4dea786:

    # yt "But... Moon managed to make her listen amidst her grief."
    yt "但是……月却让她尽管身处悲痛之中，依然听了她的话。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1032
translate chinese skystressrelief_5bff8193:

    # yt "This came from someone I thought barely understood life."
    yt "我还以为她根本不理解人生呢。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1033
translate chinese skystressrelief_e0985330:

    # yt "I can't fault Emma for saying Moon is unpredictable. Her wisdom is not readily visible; it lies deep within her core."
    yt "艾玛说月难以预测，我不能怪她。她的智慧并不能轻易看见；而是深藏在她的核心之中。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1035
translate chinese skystressrelief_643e3873:

    # yt "... What's this? My heart's racing, but not out of affection... From something else? Why does it call your name?"
    yt "……怎么回事？我的心跳得好快，但却不是出于爱意……是别的东西？为什么会喊着你的名字？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1036
translate chinese skystressrelief_62e133bc:

    # yt "Wait, how did I even know that...? What the hell is happening to me?"
    yt "等一下，我是怎么知道的……？我到底怎么了？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1037
translate chinese skystressrelief_a0add751:

    # e "[mc], are you alright?"
    e "[mc!t]，你没事吧？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1038
translate chinese skystressrelief_d66bbdfd:

    # mc "Yeah... I'm fine..."
    mc "嗯……没事……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1040
translate chinese skystressrelief_4c67c3d5:

    # k "... You know what I'm going to ask, right?"
    k "……你知道我接下来要问什么吧？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1041
translate chinese skystressrelief_c6e2ab1f:

    # ew "Come with me."
    ew "跟我来。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1048
translate chinese skystressrelief_c4e006ac:

    # ew "He chose this..."
    ew "他选择了这里……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1049
translate chinese skystressrelief_e043ffe1:

    # ew "Before he lost himself, he made us promise that whatever happens in this house stays in this house."
    ew "在他发疯之前，他让我们保证，在这个房子里发生的事就留在这里，不传出去。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1050
translate chinese skystressrelief_c361387e:

    # ew "He was a good man, and we came to love him like our own son."
    ew "他是个好人，我们也把他当亲儿子一样疼爱。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1051
translate chinese skystressrelief_9825f92a:

    # ew "We're prepared to accept any punishment from you or the law. But we'll never regret protecting him from the world."
    ew "不管你或者法律对我们有什么惩罚，我们都会接受。但我们永远不会后悔从这个世界手里保护了他。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1052
translate chinese skystressrelief_c89de161:

    # mc "... What's your plan about [landlord], [landlady]?"
    mc "……你对[landlord!t]有什么打算，[landlady!t]？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1053
translate chinese skystressrelief_82091822_3:

    # k "..."
    k "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1054
translate chinese skystressrelief_ef78284f:

    # k "I will not do anything..."
    k "我什么都不会做的……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1055
translate chinese skystressrelief_05500ff6:

    # mc "Huh?"
    mc "啊？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1056
translate chinese skystressrelief_6b7b7a2c:

    # k "He chose this path... and knowing him, he wouldn't have want me to interfere. I'll let him rest here in peace."
    k "他选择了这条路……我了解他，他不会愿意让我插手的。就让他在这里安息吧。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1057
translate chinese skystressrelief_2b35b6fe_6:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1058
translate chinese skystressrelief_9e0ee067:

    # k "Wherever you are, I hope you've found freedom from your suffering... Thank you for sacrificing yourself for us."
    k "不管你在哪里，我都希望你已不再被痛苦折磨……谢谢你为了我们牺牲自己。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1059
translate chinese skystressrelief_91ae0665:

    # yt "Her words are cold..."
    yt "她的话很冰冷……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1060
translate chinese skystressrelief_d061080b:

    # yt "She understands, but she's barely holding herself together..."
    yt "她能理解，但她几乎没法保持镇定……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1061
translate chinese skystressrelief_0df772b6:

    # yt "I... myself..."
    yt "而我……我自己……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1063
translate chinese skystressrelief_f9a69502:

    # yt "Thank you for giving me this second chance at life... I won't waste it."
    yt "谢谢你给我第二次生命……我不会浪费的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1066
translate chinese skystressrelief_2b35b6fe_7:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1067
translate chinese skystressrelief_063abb62:

    # mc "Aine?"
    mc "艾妮？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1068
translate chinese skystressrelief_3928a113:

    # "......."
    "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1069
translate chinese skystressrelief_cea28e34:

    # "..........."
    "…………"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1070
translate chinese skystressrelief_05500ff6_1:

    # mc "Huh?"
    mc "啊？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1071
translate chinese skystressrelief_d1ddaffa:

    # "........"
    "…………"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1072
translate chinese skystressrelief_b53e2dcf:

    # mc "Ah, yeah, well... we're heading home now. We've finished here..."
    mc "啊，对，嗯……我们准备回家了。事情已经办完了……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1073
translate chinese skystressrelief_07bdde05:

    # "....."
    "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1074
translate chinese skystressrelief_802b01e0:

    # mc "We'll discuss it when we're all back together. It's better to talk about it with everyone present..."
    mc "我们回去之后再一起讨论吧。最好趁每个人都在的时候再说……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1075
translate chinese skystressrelief_d1ddaffa_1:

    # "........"
    "…………"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1076
translate chinese skystressrelief_73047d2d:

    # mc "My voice? Oh, no, I'm fine. We'll be home in a few hours."
    mc "我的声音？哦，没事，我很好。我们过几个小时就到家了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1077
translate chinese skystressrelief_5f9b772e:

    # "...."
    "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1078
translate chinese skystressrelief_9f75cde8:

    # mc "Okay, we will."
    mc "好，没问题。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1079
translate chinese skystressrelief_c9593135:

    # k "Who was that?"
    k "谁的电话？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1080
translate chinese skystressrelief_22265c7d:

    # mc "Aine. She said our {i}friends{/i} are waiting and told me to hurry home."
    mc "艾妮。她说我们的{i}朋友们{/i}在等着，让我赶快回家。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1081
translate chinese skystressrelief_8e3549db:

    # k "I see..."
    k "好吧……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1082
translate chinese skystressrelief_e687be31:

    # mc "Should we go?"
    mc "要出发吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1083
translate chinese skystressrelief_91b6bb15:

    # k "There's nothing left for us here. Let's head back... let everything sink in..."
    k "我们在这里没别的事可以做了。回去吧……让一切都沉淀一下……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1084
translate chinese skystressrelief_00d627d6:

    # ew "You should have this."
    ew "拿上这个吧。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1085
translate chinese skystressrelief_c8e36781:

    # ew "He never said what to do with it, but since you're interested in photos, I believe he'd want {i}you{/i} to have it."
    ew "他从来没说过要怎么处置这东西，但既然你对摄影感兴趣，我想他应该会把这个交给{i}你{/i}。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1086
translate chinese skystressrelief_40bb7941:

    # mc "How did you know that?"
    mc "你怎么知道？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1087
translate chinese skystressrelief_c3fb587a:

    # ew "He talked about you a lot, and has mentioned your interest in photos."
    ew "他经常说你的事，提到过你对摄影感兴趣。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1088
translate chinese skystressrelief_2b35b6fe_8:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1089
translate chinese skystressrelief_06f870ef:

    # mc "I have a question."
    mc "我有一个问题。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1090
translate chinese skystressrelief_853ef7a6_1:

    # ew "Yes?"
    ew "什么？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1091
translate chinese skystressrelief_8737a08d:

    # mc "Why did your husband call us cursed?"
    mc "为什么你的丈夫说我们被诅咒了？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1092
translate chinese skystressrelief_4394da16:

    # ew "Thaddeus is superstitious. After Jovian's death, misfortune followed us, and he blamed you all. He said you were a curse on our lives."
    ew "撒迪厄斯很迷信。乔维安死后，我们家厄运不断，他就都怪罪到了你们头上。他说是你们给我们的生活施加了诅咒。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1093
translate chinese skystressrelief_15821207:

    # ew "While I don't share that belief, I can't say he was entirely mistaken."
    ew "虽然我不信这些，但我也不能说他的话完全不对。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1094
translate chinese skystressrelief_8d56b0ff:

    # ew "But that's behind us now. We're looking for peace of mind. We've lived long enough, seen too much."
    ew "但这些事都过去了。我们只想过平静的生活。我们已经活了够久，见了够多了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1095
translate chinese skystressrelief_8ab4ae3f:

    # ew "I just hope... there's a reason for all this..."
    ew "我只希望……这一切的背后是有理由的……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1096
translate chinese skystressrelief_b1f75e5e:

    # ew "Good luck with whatever you aim to achieve."
    ew "不管你的目标是什么……都祝你好运吧。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1097
translate chinese skystressrelief_2b35b6fe_9:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1098
translate chinese skystressrelief_64d14955:

    # ew "Let's get this done, Detective Meyer. We're ready to cooperate."
    ew "赶紧把事情办完吧，梅耶警探。我们会配合的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1099
translate chinese skystressrelief_118adec5:

    # e "Yes."
    e "好。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1100
translate chinese skystressrelief_e612037c_4:

    # m "..."
    m "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1107
translate chinese skystressrelief_91f05bf8:

    # m "{i}Little did I know..."
    m "{i}我根本没想到……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1109
translate chinese skystressrelief_7849d902:

    # j "How was it?"
    j "怎么样？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1110
translate chinese skystressrelief_12a27452:

    # m "Not a big deal, just a gang trying to mug an old man. I took care of it quickly."
    m "没什么大不了的，只是一群混混想抢劫一个老人。我很快就解决了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1111
translate chinese skystressrelief_e7eb75b9:

    # j "I see."
    j "好。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1112
translate chinese skystressrelief_b4fa3fc0:

    # j "..."
    j "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1113
translate chinese skystressrelief_f18aeae9:

    # m "... What?"
    m "……怎么？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1114
translate chinese skystressrelief_438b026a:

    # j "I'm not going sugarcoat it, Fang, but do you really find fulfillment living this way?"
    j "我就直说了吧，獠牙，你这样子真的会有满足感吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1115
translate chinese skystressrelief_eb2c3543:

    # m "You were the one who put me in this position. Why are you now questioning how I'm living now?"
    m "是你让我这样的。怎么现在又来质疑我的生活方式？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1116
translate chinese skystressrelief_c39252d2:

    # j "I know, but it's not my intention to trap you in this life. I'm not my sister."
    j "我知道，但我的本意不是把你困在这种生活里。我又不是我姐姐。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1117
translate chinese skystressrelief_36007e97:

    # j "You refused to join our cause despite accepting our deal, so this is a place I provided for you to find a purpose."
    j "你虽然接受了我们的交易，却拒绝加入我们，所以我让你来到这个地方，让你寻找目的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1118
translate chinese skystressrelief_f418cd23:

    # j "You might have been an exceptional soldier, but you are also human, Fang."
    j "你是个出类拔萃的士兵，但同时也是人，獠牙。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1119
translate chinese skystressrelief_633c0ee3:

    # j "Stop confining yourself to following orders. Don't you want to find your calling?"
    j "不要再只会接受命令了。你不想找到你的使命吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1120
translate chinese skystressrelief_8cb62253_1:

    # m "Yes."
    m "想。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1121
translate chinese skystressrelief_393a0996:

    # j "So, are you sure this is what you want?"
    j "那么，你确定这就是你想要的吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1122
translate chinese skystressrelief_4f6cdcf0:

    # m "No. I don't even know what I want..."
    m "不。我都不知道我想要什么……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1123
translate chinese skystressrelief_59ac64b6:

    # j "Out of all my charity cases, you're proving to be the most challenging."
    j "我做了这么多慈善，你是最难搞的一个。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1124
translate chinese skystressrelief_d93d4c9c:

    # m "... What do you suggest I do, then?"
    m "……那你说我该怎么办？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1125
translate chinese skystressrelief_13a88f53:

    # j "Leave this place and do something meaningful, not for us, not for others, but for yourself."
    j "离开这里，做些有意义的事情，不是为了我们，不是为了别人，而是为了你自己。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1126
translate chinese skystressrelief_e612037c_5:

    # m "..."
    m "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1127
translate chinese skystressrelief_f2bed53e:

    # m "And how am I supposed to find that \"something meaningful\"?"
    m "我怎么知道什么叫“有意义的事情”？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1128
translate chinese skystressrelief_22761ae5:

    # j "I think I know someone who might be able to help you—no, I have this feeling you might just help out each other."
    j "我想我认识一个说不定能帮你的人——不，我感觉你们能互相帮助。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1129
translate chinese skystressrelief_3176ac48:

    # j "Under our agency, try taking on the role as his aid, and see where that leads."
    j "你就以我们机构的名义，去帮他，看看最后是个什么结果。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1130
translate chinese skystressrelief_a89d8c7d:

    # m "If you're giving me orders again, how is that any different?"
    m "你这是又在给我下命令吗？那岂不是还跟以前一样？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1131
translate chinese skystressrelief_23b0c7bf:

    # j "It's not an order... this time, it's your choice."
    j "不是命令……这次是你自己的选择。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1132
translate chinese skystressrelief_1f83445a:

    # j "Like I said, I'm not here to control you. If it doesn't work out, you're always welcome to return."
    j "我说了，我不会控制你。如果最后没有结果的话，随时欢迎你回来。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1133
translate chinese skystressrelief_e612037c_6:

    # m "..."
    m "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1134
translate chinese skystressrelief_b1af81c6:

    # m "Who is it?"
    m "那人是谁？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1135
translate chinese skystressrelief_b2876abd:

    # j "His name is [mc]. But we'll need to wait for the right moment. I can't just hand you over to him out of the blue."
    j "他叫[mc!t]。不过得等到时机到来。我不能无缘无故地就把你交给他。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1136
translate chinese skystressrelief_f532eb1d:

    # j "Well... I'm sure it will sound like that no matter what I say."
    j "呃……不过不管我说什么，肯定听起来都像是那样就是了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1139
translate chinese skystressrelief_0dcb571f:

    # m "{i}Little did I realize fate was pulling us {b}back together{/b}..."
    m "{i}我根本没想到，命运在让我们{b}重聚{/b}……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1140
translate chinese skystressrelief_9c0a6823:

    # m "{i}Oddly enough, it wasn't a comforting sensation."
    m "{i}真是奇怪，这种感觉一点也不好。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1141
translate chinese skystressrelief_35931166:

    # m "{i}Yet, despite the ominous weight in my chest, seeing you brought an unexpected sense of relief, even without knowing your true identity."
    m "{i}可是，尽管我心里有种不祥的预感，看见你还是让我有种出乎意料的安心感，尽管我还不知道你的真实身份。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1142
translate chinese skystressrelief_41295507:

    # m "{i}Without hesitation..."
    m "{i}没有丝毫犹豫……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1143
translate chinese skystressrelief_abda9a93:

    # m "{i}... I embraced the role of being your bodyguard; it was a responsibility I found unexpectedly fulfilling."
    m "{i}……我就接受了担任你的保镖的工作；我没想到这个任务能让我如此地有满足感。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1144
translate chinese skystressrelief_20c6d8d1:

    # m "{i}What is this feeling...? Whenever I'm near you, this indescribable sense of happiness washes over me... What exactly are we to each other?"
    m "{i}这到底是什么感觉……？只要我在你身边，这种无法描述的幸福感就会充斥我的全身……我们之间到底是什么关系？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1145
translate chinese skystressrelief_64acf5ab:

    # m "{i}You're unlike anyone I've ever met. Your eyes often carries a hint of pity."
    m "{i}你和我见过的任何人都不一样。你的眼里总是有一丝怜悯。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1146
translate chinese skystressrelief_b10c7f30:

    # m "{i}I don't desire it, yet I find comfort knowing you're here to watch over me, just as I'm determined to protect you..."
    m "{i}我并不想要怜悯，可我只要知道你在注视着我，就觉得安心，就如同我下定了决心要保护你一样……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1147
translate chinese skystressrelief_f944b6d0:

    # m "{i}... My Lord..."
    m "{i}……我的王……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1148
translate chinese skystressrelief_7139b882:

    # m "{i}My... Lord...? Who am I referring to-"
    m "{i}我的……王……？我在说什么——"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1151
translate chinese skystressrelief_6c0efa87:

    # mc "Moon..."
    mc "月……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1152
translate chinese skystressrelief_ccdb7ba1:

    # mc "We're home."
    mc "我们到家了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1153
translate chinese skystressrelief_fc850cf2:

    # m "... Sorry, I was just resting my eyes."
    m "……抱歉。就是休息一下眼睛。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1155
translate chinese skystressrelief_7cf29ac9:

    # mc "It's you guys again."
    mc "又是你们。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1156
translate chinese skystressrelief_98472fd0:

    # mc "You look different from before. What's up with that?"
    mc "你的样子变了啊。什么情况？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1157
translate chinese skystressrelief_245c6898:

    # un "A certain guy doesn't like my usual look, that's all."
    un "有个人不喜欢我平常的打扮，仅此而已。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1158
translate chinese skystressrelief_05500ff6_2:

    # mc "Huh?"
    mc "啊？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1159
translate chinese skystressrelief_c6d7a272:

    # mc "Wait, what's your name? I don't think you've mentioned it."
    mc "等一下，你叫什么来着？你好像没有提过吧。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1160
translate chinese skystressrelief_653cae1b:

    # la "My real name would be an inconvenience, so let's just go with \"Lance\"."
    la "我的真名不方便透露，你就叫我“长矛”吧。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1161
translate chinese skystressrelief_0ae3cc5b:

    # m "What are you all doing here?"
    m "你们来干嘛？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1162
translate chinese skystressrelief_1e011a23:

    # la "We came to talk with your... friend."
    la "来和你的朋友……谈谈。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1163
translate chinese skystressrelief_3e78d3b3:

    # m "He's more than just a friend."
    m "他不只是朋友。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1164
translate chinese skystressrelief_21e71639:

    # la "I see, my mistake."
    la "这样啊，抱歉。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1165
translate chinese skystressrelief_6dbd9885:

    # la "Nevertheless, we may know something he doesn't, and we thought we could share it with him."
    la "总之，我们可能知道一些他不知道的事情，所以想和他分享一下。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1166
translate chinese skystressrelief_7457bcaf:

    # la "You might find it interesting too, Fang."
    la "你可能也会感兴趣的，獠牙。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1167
translate chinese skystressrelief_e612037c_7:

    # m "..."
    m "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1168
translate chinese skystressrelief_09fc6b5d:

    # j "I believe you found something?"
    j "你们应该有所收获吧？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1169
translate chinese skystressrelief_06d86acc:

    # mc "This..."
    mc "这个……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1170
translate chinese skystressrelief_98a815a1:

    # j "Interesting..."
    j "有意思……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1172
translate chinese skystressrelief_963f3e73:

    # s "[mc], [landlady]! You're back-"
    s "[mc!t]，[landlady!t]！你们回来——"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1180
translate chinese skystressrelief_df3c9f68:

    # la "Is this all of you?"
    la "你们所有人都到齐了吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1181
translate chinese skystressrelief_18c13a9b:

    # mc "Emma has to take care of the Winters."
    mc "艾玛留在温特斯家处理事情了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1182
translate chinese skystressrelief_d8a6c605:

    # mc "[landlady] is trying to explain everything to Sky upstairs. Honestly, it's better for her not to see it at all."
    mc "[landlady!t]正在楼上跟斯凯解释。说实话，还是什么都不要让她看见为好。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1183
translate chinese skystressrelief_f0cfa0a4:

    # mc "Freya and Shu... I have no idea where those two went."
    mc "芙蕾雅和修……我完全不知道他们俩去哪了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1184
translate chinese skystressrelief_a1651c49:

    # a "Shu told me that Freya is coming with her–I mean him."
    a "修跟我说芙蕾雅跟他在一块。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1185
translate chinese skystressrelief_beca9c1c:

    # a "God, I'm still so confused about that guy."
    a "天啊，我到现在还是没搞明白那人到底是男是女。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1186
translate chinese skystressrelief_09b6e0e7:

    # a "But, yeah... He mentioned he's looking for a place or something. He didn't elaborate further about it."
    a "但是总之……他说他正在找一个地方还是什么的。他没说得太清楚。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1187
translate chinese skystressrelief_fe27df53:

    # la "I see. Then, if everyone is here, we should start."
    la "我明白了。那，如果大家都在的话，我们就开始吧。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1188
translate chinese skystressrelief_8b5e620a:

    # mc "Wait!"
    mc "等等！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1189
translate chinese skystressrelief_84c2f08e:

    # j "[mc]?"
    j "[mc!t]？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1190
translate chinese skystressrelief_9bb8e6aa:

    # mc "I think it's better if only you guys should watch it. The rest can only listen."
    mc "最好还是只让你们几个看吧。其他人只用听着就好了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1191
translate chinese skystressrelief_3f0e6175:

    # j "... We understand."
    j "……我明白了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1198
translate chinese skystressrelief_3928a113_1:

    # "......."
    "…………"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1199
translate chinese skystressrelief_e3b8adf9:

    # g "Did he... just..."
    g "难道……他……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1200
translate chinese skystressrelief_69c25b65:

    # mc "Yeah..."
    mc "嗯……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1201
translate chinese skystressrelief_a8c68ed7:

    # a "Oh... my god..."
    a "我的……天啊……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1202
translate chinese skystressrelief_42837ae9:

    # la "I'm terribly sorry for your loss, [mc]."
    la "节哀顺变，[mc!t]。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1203
translate chinese skystressrelief_bcc6e2c5:

    # mc "He did what he had to..."
    mc "他做了他必须做的事……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1204
translate chinese skystressrelief_d3230abc:

    # la "No... What others may say doesn't matter. In our eyes, your [landlord] is a true hero."
    la "不……其他人怎么想不重要。在我们眼里，你[landlord!t]是个真正的英雄。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1205
translate chinese skystressrelief_9efbbfaa:

    # la "We'll pay him a visit as soon as we can. Give him our full respects."
    la "我们会尽快去看他的。向他表达我们的敬意。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1206
translate chinese skystressrelief_bb0eeaf4:

    # mc "Thank you."
    mc "谢谢你。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1207
translate chinese skystressrelief_38f68957:

    # la "Now then, as for the rest of that..."
    la "那么，至于剩下的部分……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1208
translate chinese skystressrelief_5d27d399:

    # la "You were right."
    la "你说得对。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1209
translate chinese skystressrelief_f38cc462:

    # j "Yes, just as I thought..."
    j "是的，正如我所料……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1210
translate chinese skystressrelief_b5a9cb9c:

    # mc "Huh? Right about what?"
    mc "啊？什么说得对？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1211
translate chinese skystressrelief_13688233:

    # j "You, [mc], have the last serum we were looking for."
    j "你，[mc!t]，身上有我们在寻找的最后一支血清。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1212
translate chinese skystressrelief_0b5686da:

    # mc "So you guys know about this?"
    mc "所以你们全都知道？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1213
translate chinese skystressrelief_9d7d26bb:

    # la "I did say we have information that you don't. We only needed confirmation. And with that, there's no doubt about it."
    la "我的确说过我们手上有你不知道的情报。我们只是需要确认。而现在，情况已经确凿无疑了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1214
translate chinese skystressrelief_aadb5a0a:

    # j "For the past two years, we were scouring every corner of the globe to find it. Who would've thought it was just right under our noses."
    j "过去两年来，我们找遍了全球。谁能想到就在我们眼皮子底下。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1215
translate chinese skystressrelief_d7b9d22b:

    # a "Is it the thing... that was injected into [mc]?"
    a "就是……注射给[mc!t]的那个东西吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1216
translate chinese skystressrelief_d5698683:

    # la "That's right, Miss Agnor. We will explain what we know in a moment. But these serums are far too dangerous for anyone to possess."
    la "没错，阿格诺小姐。我们稍后就会把我们知道的东西都说出来。但是，这些血清太危险了，不能交给任何人。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1217
translate chinese skystressrelief_26190ba9:

    # la "For a long time, we've been searching for every last one of them, including those that... have used them."
    la "多年以来，我们一直都在追寻这些血清的下落，以及……用了血清的人。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1218
translate chinese skystressrelief_c39a25d8:

    # la "That's how we found Fang, or Moon, as you would call her now."
    la "獠牙就是我们在途中找到的——不过现在你们叫她月了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1219
translate chinese skystressrelief_2c6ac407:

    # la "And the last possessor... is you, [mc]."
    la "而最后一个人……就是你，[mc!t]。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1220
translate chinese skystressrelief_7a85de7c:

    # mc "Just... how dangerous are these things?"
    mc "这些东西……到底有多危险？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1221
translate chinese skystressrelief_ff0c2a2f:

    # la "Fang has been with you for some time, so I'm guessing you know her capabilities by now."
    la "你认识獠牙的时间也不短了，应该已经清楚她的能力有多强。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1222
translate chinese skystressrelief_3aa27277:

    # la "Imagine dozens of her–No, we're talking about hundreds."
    la "想象一下有几十个像她这样的人——不，应该说有几百个。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1223
translate chinese skystressrelief_da8f2508:

    # la "If we'd let these people roam free without supervision, just think of what they can do."
    la "如果不对他们进行管理，让他们肆意妄为，后果不堪设想。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1224
translate chinese skystressrelief_50f56464:

    # la "I'm talking about those who turned to criminals, those who joined wicked causes to exploit what they possess."
    la "事实上他们之中已经出现了成为罪犯，靠着能力胡作非为的人。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1225
translate chinese skystressrelief_876151c3:

    # mc "So you kill them?"
    mc "所以你会把他们杀掉？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1226
translate chinese skystressrelief_d92c147e:

    # la "These serums eventually corrupt the possessor. However, that's not always the case."
    la "这些血清会慢慢腐化持有者的。然而，也有例外。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1227
translate chinese skystressrelief_c65593e8:

    # la "Observing Fang for several years, we can safely say that the Early Stages don't suffer such a fate."
    la "在观察了獠牙几年之后，我们可以确认，早期型不会出现这种情况。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1228
translate chinese skystressrelief_361aeaa4:

    # la "But those Mass Produced... are the problem. They are made to be disposable, and if they can no longer be saved, we have no choice but to eliminate them."
    la "但那些量产型……才是问题。他们在设计之初就是要被废弃掉的，如果他们没救了的话，我们别无选择，只能除掉他们。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1229
translate chinese skystressrelief_a7bcf340_1:

    # mc "I see..."
    mc "我明白了……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1230
translate chinese skystressrelief_9fb63be2:

    # mc "Moon and I are from the Early Stages, is that right?"
    mc "我和月都是早期型的，没错吧？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1231
translate chinese skystressrelief_4549f51d:

    # la "That is correct."
    la "没错。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1232
translate chinese skystressrelief_5c6a1b6c:

    # mc "Then... how come I don't feel that different from any normal person?"
    mc "可是……为什么我和普通人没有区别？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1233
translate chinese skystressrelief_61905cc4:

    # la "This is only a theory, but we may know why."
    la "我们有个猜想，或许可以解释。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1234
translate chinese skystressrelief_8734cc31:

    # la "Shall I? It's better if he explains it himself."
    la "我觉得还是让他来解释更好，可以吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1235
translate chinese skystressrelief_54cb2745:

    # mc "He?"
    mc "他？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1236
translate chinese skystressrelief_18d6d4c4:

    # j "Feel free. Just don't go wild."
    j "可以。别发疯就行。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1237
translate chinese skystressrelief_aee42b0e:

    # la "{size=-10}Switch with me. You only have a few minutes..."
    la "{size=-10}跟我交换吧。你只有几分钟的时间……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1239
translate chinese skystressrelief_53c35602:

    # cl "Heheee!"
    cl "嘿嘿嘿！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1240
translate chinese skystressrelief_593d05ba:

    # cl "Oh, oops... She slipped out. My bad."
    cl "噢……抱歉，不小心让她跑出来了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1241
translate chinese skystressrelief_bf44f70e:

    # j "*sighs*"
    j "*叹气*"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1242
translate chinese skystressrelief_59bc5376:

    # g "What the hell is going on here? Should we be worried?"
    g "到底是他妈的什么情况啊？我们该担心吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1243
translate chinese skystressrelief_14b622c4:

    # ala "Be at ease, young one. Allow me to introduce myself properly."
    ala "别着急，年轻人。请允许我正式做一下自我介绍。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1244
translate chinese skystressrelief_dcc65520:

    # ala "Hnng!"
    ala "哼嗯！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1245
translate chinese skystressrelief_4013d707:

    # ala "Hnnnng!"
    ala "哼啊啊啊！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1246
translate chinese skystressrelief_95452391:

    # ala "Ahhhh...!"
    ala "啊啊啊……！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1247
translate chinese skystressrelief_b93afd7a:

    # j "You done?"
    j "完事了？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1248
translate chinese skystressrelief_a3467d9a:

    # ala "Indeed, I am."
    ala "是的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1249
translate chinese skystressrelief_48c00f24:

    # mc "What... what just happened?"
    mc "到底……发生什么了？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1250
translate chinese skystressrelief_1165028d:

    # ala "I am Lucien, Lance's alter ego."
    ala "我是卢希恩，长矛的另一个人格。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1251
translate chinese skystressrelief_3ca34a4d:

    # ala "And the foolish one residing within her is my twin sister, Aveline."
    ala "而在她体内的蠢货是我的双胞胎姐姐，艾芙琳。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1253
translate chinese skystressrelief_3bd96539:

    # mc "Wait, wait, wait! Huh?! I'm so fucking confused!"
    mc "等等，等等，等等！啊？！我他妈听不懂啊！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1254
translate chinese skystressrelief_e35545b3:

    # ala "Permit me to elucidate from the beginning."
    ala "请允许我从头开始说明。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1255
translate chinese skystressrelief_db4ffa7a:

    # ala "Most individuals who are aware of the Numbers' origin only know of two groups or batches that were created."
    ala "大多数了解编号者的来源的人，都只知道他们被制作了两个批次。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1256
translate chinese skystressrelief_fea343db:

    # ala "However, that is not entirely accurate."
    ala "然而，事实上，并非如此。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1257
translate chinese skystressrelief_c80b0df8:

    # ala "Before you, there was us... the \"Experimental Test Subjects\". Or, to put it simply, the failed iteration of the serum."
    ala "在你们之前，还有我们……所谓的“原型试作体”。简单来说，就是失败品。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1258
translate chinese skystressrelief_e7b3aa0a:

    # ala "We were referred to as the \"Zeroes\"."
    ala "我们被称作“零型”。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1259
translate chinese skystressrelief_c0bdbe6b:

    # ala "I shall not delve deeper into the specifics of our creation, but that is the fundamental concept."
    ala "重要的概念已经解释完毕，我就不深入介绍血清制作的细节了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1260
translate chinese skystressrelief_e4d6c01b:

    # ala "The principle behind the serum is the combination of DNA from two individuals; the living and the exhumed."
    ala "这血清的作用，简单来说，就是让两个人——活体和死体——的DNA结合在一起。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1261
translate chinese skystressrelief_d82980ae:

    # ala "The living, of course, refers to you, the Test Subjects. And the exhumed are us, the ones bestowing upon you your strength and capabilities."
    ala "活体当然指的是你们，实验体；而死体就是我们，赐予你们力量的人。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1262
translate chinese skystressrelief_c4f1a11d:

    # a "E-exhumed...? Does that mean..."
    a "死-死体……？也就是说……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1263
translate chinese skystressrelief_a34ba86c:

    # ala "Indeed. Aveline and I are deceased mercenaries from a bygone era. The creator managed to locate our remains and utilized them for their experimentation."
    ala "没错。我和艾芙琳都是来自过去的雇佣兵，早已死去。血清的制造者找到了我们的尸体，用来做实验。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1264
translate chinese skystressrelief_d36277ce:

    # ala "And no, this is not derived from some fantastical tale; it is a reality. Made possible by what you people refer to as Science."
    ala "这绝不是虚假的故事；而是实实在在的现实。是靠你们嘴里的“科学”实现的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1265
translate chinese skystressrelief_38fba0aa:

    # cl "To think that someone would be capable of reviving the dead..."
    cl "居然有人能做到起死回生……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1266
translate chinese skystressrelief_b9e1125b:

    # g "So that means... [mc] and Moon are also... you know, dead people?"
    g "那也就是说……[mc!t]和月也都是……呃，死人？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1267
translate chinese skystressrelief_f4b86bd5:

    # ala "Do not misunderstand, young one. I am only referring to us, the Zeroes."
    ala "不要误会，年轻人。我刚刚指的是我们，零型。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1268
translate chinese skystressrelief_5378c413:

    # ala "The Numbers are... not entirely identical to us."
    ala "编号者们……和我们并不完全相同。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1269
translate chinese skystressrelief_7eba54b7:

    # ala "The Zeroes retain the consciousness of both the living and the exhumed, creating an unstable mental state in the Test Subjects. Hence, we were deemed \"Failed\"."
    ala "零型的体内会同时有活体和死体的意识，也就使得实验体的精神状态不稳定。因此，我们被看做是失败品。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1270
translate chinese skystressrelief_cc3d417f:

    # ala "Utilizing the same concept, the successful subjects actually amalgamate both DNAs and manage to exist as a single entity, if that makes sense."
    ala "从这个概念出发，不难推断出，成功的实验体就是既能成功结合DNA，又不会分裂成两个人。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1271
translate chinese skystressrelief_8ed1530a:

    # ala "Unlike the Zeroes, the Numbers do not trigger any alter ego and retain only the consciousness of the Test Subjects while still maintaining the capabilities of the exhumed."
    ala "那也就是编号者——跟零型不同，你们没有第二人格，只有活体的意识，但也有死体的能力。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1272
translate chinese skystressrelief_ae05b856:

    # mc "Then what about me?"
    mc "那我呢？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1273
translate chinese skystressrelief_856543ab:

    # ala "You, on the other hand, are quite an enigma..."
    ala "你……身上则充满了谜团……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1274
translate chinese skystressrelief_3fbc26b3:

    # ala "However, I postulate that it is because you did not undergo what they referred to as the Incubation stage, which only applies to the Early Stages."
    ala "不过，我的推断是，你的情况是因为你并没有经过所有早期型都要经受的所谓“孵化期”。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1275
translate chinese skystressrelief_9ffed3b8:

    # mc "Incu...bation stage?"
    mc "孵化……期？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1276
translate chinese skystressrelief_d09e66b0:

    # m "It's a process designed to awaken the serum within the Early Stages. This specific process was removed when Mass Production started."
    m "是用来唤醒早期型体内的血清的。这个阶段在量产型开始制造之后就取消了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1277
translate chinese skystressrelief_098169b5:

    # ala "Precisely. Aside from combining DNAs, it is indeed true that the serum also possesses incredible healing capabilities."
    ala "正是。除了结合DNA之外，血清的确也有非常强的治愈能力。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1278
translate chinese skystressrelief_8cfee27e:

    # ala "I hypothesize that this healing process prepares you for the Incubation stage. However, none of us knows how the Incubation stage is conducted."
    ala "我猜测，这个治愈能力就是用来给你们度过孵化期做准备的。不过，我们全都不知道孵化期的具体过程。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1279
translate chinese skystressrelief_4b27a0bc:

    # ala "It is a process that remains a mystery to us to this day."
    ala "这直到今天也还是一个谜。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1280
translate chinese skystressrelief_a7bcf340_2:

    # mc "I see..."
    mc "我懂了……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1281
translate chinese skystressrelief_5a633343:

    # ala "{size=-10}I have concluded my explanation..."
    ala "{size=-10}我的解释结束了……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1282
translate chinese skystressrelief_d9bc7694:

    # ala "{size=-10}No, grant me a moment..."
    ala "{size=-10}不，再给我一点时间……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1283
translate chinese skystressrelief_07cbe3c0:

    # ala "Is there something you wish to convey to me... Aveline?"
    ala "你有话要对我说吗……艾芙琳？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1284
translate chinese skystressrelief_5e77c0c0:

    # cl "..."
    cl "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1285
translate chinese skystressrelief_21ef1178:

    # cl "... She won't come out."
    cl "……她不会出来的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1286
translate chinese skystressrelief_10434f5f:

    # ala "Oh... well... It's not as if you've vanished entirely. Let us spar again in the near future."
    ala "噢……好吧……反正你也并没有完全消失。我们日后再相见吧。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1287
translate chinese skystressrelief_5e77c0c0_1:

    # cl "..."
    cl "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1288
translate chinese skystressrelief_11f767a5:

    # cl "Yes, brother... I would be more than inclined..."
    cl "好的，哥哥……我非常乐意……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1290
translate chinese skystressrelief_67e7f4ec:

    # ala "{size=-10}Let us switch back..."
    ala "{size=-10}交换吧……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1292
translate chinese skystressrelief_45bf50de:

    # la "*takes a deep breath*..."
    la "*深呼吸* ……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1293
translate chinese skystressrelief_796e2437:

    # a "I can't believe this... I'm having a hard time trying to process what I see..."
    a "我没法相信……我都理解不了刚刚发生的事……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1294
translate chinese skystressrelief_bc7bfbf7:

    # g "So it's possible for two consciousness to exist within one body? Well damn, that's... wild!"
    g "原来一个身体里还能有两个意识？我去，厉害啊……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1295
translate chinese skystressrelief_4e34975e:

    # la "As incredible and strong as that sounds, there are serious repercussions."
    la "听起来是很厉害，但这是有副作用的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1296
translate chinese skystressrelief_76e7e821:

    # la "It's tougher for us Zeroes, but everyone with the serum faces problems."
    la "所有注射了血清的人都会有这个问题，在我们零型身上就更严重了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1297
translate chinese skystressrelief_07e3024b:

    # la "And it's not just any simple repercussions. It affects your vital organs, weakening them."
    la "而且还不是普通的副作用。血清会让体内的重要器官慢慢衰竭。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1298
translate chinese skystressrelief_4ef1616e:

    # la "Since the exhumed are meant to be stronger than normal people, it's like using a double-A battery in a car."
    la "因为死体都是要比普通人更强的，让他们寄宿在普通人体内，就像是用超市里买的电池给汽车供电一样。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1299
translate chinese skystressrelief_b50beaf2:

    # la "But if you know how to take care of your body, you can easily manage the side effects."
    la "但只要你懂得怎么保养身体，还是能轻松应付这些副作用的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1300
translate chinese skystressrelief_72c8db4b:

    # la "Although, there's one thing that happens to all of us..."
    la "不过，却还是有一个问题，我们所有人都无法避免……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1301
translate chinese skystressrelief_1bc6bb78:

    # m "Our eyes."
    m "眼睛。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1302
translate chinese skystressrelief_37775ae5:

    # la "Exactly. Eventually, it harms our eyes, causing us to cry blood. And there are no counter measures for it."
    la "没错。副作用最终会影响到我们的眼睛，让我们流血泪。没有治愈的手段。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1303
translate chinese skystressrelief_a865c5db:

    # la "It might not harm our health directly, but it's... quite painful."
    la "虽然不会直接伤害到我们，但是……依然很痛苦。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1304
translate chinese skystressrelief_2b35b6fe_10:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1305
translate chinese skystressrelief_977d5ed5:

    # la "I know this is a lot to take in, but it's better for us to lay it all out on you now. You have another question, right?"
    la "我知道这么多事情很难消化，但对我们来说，还是一下子全告诉你们更好。你还有别的问题，对吧？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1306
translate chinese skystressrelief_1931190c:

    # mc "Yeah, it's about us."
    mc "没错，是关于我们的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1307
translate chinese skystressrelief_a5e42f38:

    # m "Commander?"
    m "指挥官？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1308
translate chinese skystressrelief_0c4f8179:

    # mc "Lucien mentioned something about the exhumed..."
    mc "卢希恩说到了死体……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1309
translate chinese skystressrelief_9d4e886d:

    # mc "Moon and I... who the hell do we have inside us?"
    mc "在我和月的身体里的人……到底是谁？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1310
translate chinese skystressrelief_2db9808f:

    # la "Do you really want to know?"
    la "你真的想知道吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1311
translate chinese skystressrelief_4535d781:

    # la "Ah, silly question. Of course, you deserve to know."
    la "啊，蠢问题。你当然理应知道。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1312
translate chinese skystressrelief_3cf0cf15:

    # la "Claire?"
    la "克莱尔？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1313
translate chinese skystressrelief_9f6318e4:

    # cl "On it."
    cl "明白。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1314
translate chinese skystressrelief_fa3db940:

    # cl "Checking on our data from your past expeditions..."
    cl "根据我们手里的资料来看……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1315
translate chinese skystressrelief_c2d0e2ca:

    # cl "Moon is linked with #4, and [mc] is connected to #3..."
    cl "月是四号，而[mc!t]是三号……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1316
translate chinese skystressrelief_5e77c0c0_2:

    # cl "..."
    cl "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1317
translate chinese skystressrelief_04627bae:

    # cl "This is... interesting..."
    cl "这……有意思……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1318
translate chinese skystressrelief_a82b6719:

    # cl "These two are... Do you know anything about Esharato?"
    cl "这两个人是……你们听说过埃夏拉托吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1319
translate chinese skystressrelief_66440a12:

    # j "Oh, wow... Out of all the possibilities..."
    j "呦呵……居然偏偏是那里……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1320
translate chinese skystressrelief_5c992d7b:

    # mc "What's that about?"
    mc "什么意思？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1321
translate chinese skystressrelief_75c7e589:

    # cl "Let me tell you the story..."
    cl "我给你讲个故事吧……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1323
translate chinese skystressrelief_4c9107e4:

    # cl "In the ancient times of Esharato, there existed an empire where the sun never dared to set without first kissing the golden spires of its capital, Zentoki."
    cl "在遥远的古代，有个名叫埃夏拉托的帝国。在那里，阳光势必要先亲吻帝国首都钦托基的黄金尖塔，之后才会照耀其他地方。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1324
translate chinese skystressrelief_0e052a9b:

    # cl "At the heart of this majestic empire ruled Emperor Kaito, a sovereign of unparalleled wisdom and valor, whose reign brought about an era of prosperity and peace."
    cl "而这伟大王国的统治者与核心就是国王海人。他的智慧与勇气无人能比，他的统治也使得王国进入了繁荣与和平的时代。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1325
translate chinese skystressrelief_cffb7b7e:

    # cl "By his side, not as a mere servant but as his most trusted confidant, was Lady Sora..."
    cl "在他的身边服侍他的，就是空姬。她并非是一个普通的仆人，而是他最信任的知己……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1326
translate chinese skystressrelief_9706d5ec:

    # cl "A woman whose beauty was matched only by her intelligence and fierce loyalty to the emperor and the empire."
    cl "她不仅有倾国倾城的美貌，她的智慧以及对王国和国王绝不动摇的忠诚也让人连连赞叹。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1328
translate chinese skystressrelief_67d03aed:

    # cl "Their story began in the quiet corridors of the imperial palace, where whispers of their affections first took flight."
    cl "他们的故事开始于王宫里安静的走廊上——那里第一次传出了他们爱的低语。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1329
translate chinese skystressrelief_93299074:

    # cl "It was an uncommon bond, transcending the rigid hierarchies of royalty and service."
    cl "这样的爱非同寻常，超越了王与臣子之间森严的尊卑差距。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1330
translate chinese skystressrelief_7abb0bc4:

    # cl "Emperor Kaito, a widower whose heart had been closed to love, found in Sora a kindred spirit, a woman whose presence illuminated the darkest corners of his world."
    cl "国王海人已经失去过一位王后，本已封心锁爱，却把空当做是灵魂伴侣，是一位能照亮他内心最黑暗的角落的女人。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1331
translate chinese skystressrelief_2f7cddf4:

    # cl "Sora, who had served at the palace since her youth, found in the emperor not just a ruler but a man of deep compassion and understanding."
    cl "而空自幼便在宫中服侍，在她眼里，国王不仅只是一国之君，更是一个富有同情心、善解人意的男人。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1332
translate chinese skystressrelief_d3667c8c:

    # cl "Their love, though forbidden by tradition and the expectations of the court, bloomed in secret, nurtured by stolen moments and silent glances."
    cl "他们的爱情尽管不被传统所允许，不被朝廷所期望，却在私下里生根发芽，被一次次秘密的聚会和沉默的对视所滋养着。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1334
translate chinese skystressrelief_d418e78f:

    # cl "In time, their love could no longer be concealed, and Kaito, with the courage that had defined his reign, declared his intent to marry Sora."
    cl "终于，他们的爱再也无法隐藏，海人拿出他统治国家时的勇气，宣布要和空结婚。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1335
translate chinese skystressrelief_73a51f48:

    # cl "The empire, accustomed to his unorthodox ways, celebrated the union, for the happiness of their beloved emperor ensured the prosperity of Esharato."
    cl "国家早已习惯他离经叛道的做法，为国王的大婚举行了盛大的庆典，庆祝他们心中给国家带来繁荣的敬爱的国王找到了幸福。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1336
translate chinese skystressrelief_183f4094:

    # cl "The wedding was a spectacle of joy and grandeur, a testament to a love that defied norms and expectations."
    cl "婚礼十分热闹，充满了欢乐，更加证明了这违背了传统与期望的爱情。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1338
translate chinese skystressrelief_57dfb46b:

    # cl "However, their happiness was not to last..."
    cl "然而，他们的幸福却没有持续太久……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1339
translate chinese skystressrelief_f8f4635e:

    # cl "A neighboring kingdom, envious of Esharato's prosperity and peace, launched a surprise attack. The empire, caught off guard, faced unprecedented peril."
    cl "一个邻近的王国嫉妒末原国的繁荣与和平，发动了奇袭。王国对此毫无准备，面临着前所未有的危机。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1340
translate chinese skystressrelief_0ec03748:

    # cl "Kaito, ever the protector of his people and his love, led the charge to defend the empire."
    cl "海人身为他的子民与爱人的守护者，亲自上阵守卫国家。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1341
translate chinese skystressrelief_7276e7a2:

    # cl "In the heat of battle, as the emperor fought valiantly, a deadly arrow aimed at Sora was intercepted by Kaito."
    cl "战斗进入了白热化，国王正英勇地奋战之时，竟替空挡下了一支致命的箭矢。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1342
translate chinese skystressrelief_4e3f2615:

    # cl "The emperor fell, mortally wounded, his last breaths whispering eternal love for Sora and his empire."
    cl "国王倒在地上，身受重伤，在死前低语着他对空和末原国永恒不灭的爱。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1344
translate chinese skystressrelief_d1e677bd:

    # cl "The loss of Emperor Kaito plunged the empire into mourning, but none grieved more deeply than Sora."
    cl "国王海人的死让整个国家都陷入了沉痛的悲哀之中，但没有人的悲伤能比空更深。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1345
translate chinese skystressrelief_4308cb7d:

    # cl "The world they had dreamed of building together, a world of enduring peace and love, crumbled before her eyes."
    cl "他们梦想着要一起建立的充满爱与和平的时间，就这么在她眼前崩塌。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1346
translate chinese skystressrelief_fdd3b15d:

    # cl "In her heart, she believed that her existence without Kaito was a life devoid of purpose, a flame without its warmth."
    cl "在她心中，她认为没有海人，她的生命就没有意义，是没有温度的火焰。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1347
translate chinese skystressrelief_913c6474:

    # cl "With a heart shattered by grief, Sora chose to follow her beloved into death, committing seppuku in the imperial garden where Kaito had first declared his love for her."
    cl "空的内心被悲伤压垮，于是她来到了海人第一次向她倾诉爱意的花园，切腹自尽，随爱人而去了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1348
translate chinese skystressrelief_a597b1a6:

    # cl "It was her final act of love and loyalty, a testament to their undying bond."
    cl "这是她最后的忠爱之举，再次印证了他们之间不灭的连结。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1350
translate chinese skystressrelief_aaa30477:

    # cl "The tale of Emperor Kaito and Lady Sora became a legend, a true reminder of the power of love and the sacrifices it entails."
    cl "国王海人和空姬的故事从此成为了传奇，提醒着后人们爱情的力量，以及爱背后的牺牲。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1351
translate chinese skystressrelief_fa7d739f:

    # cl "Their story, echoing through the ages, inspired generations, teaching that true love knows no bounds, not even in the face of death itself."
    cl "他们的故事被传颂了千年，启发了一代代人，让他们知道真正的爱没有界限，即使是在死亡面前。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1352
translate chinese skystressrelief_5fd16d8d:

    # cl "And so, in the heart of Esharato, amidst the whispering winds and beneath the eternal sky, the love of Kaito and Sora endures, a beacon of light in a world of shadows."
    cl "因此，在末原国的心脏地带，在低语的微风中，在永恒的天空下，海人和空之间的爱一直持续着，给充满阴影的世界带来了一束光。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1354
translate chinese skystressrelief_158b2619:

    # a "Whoa...! What a beautiful story..."
    a "哇……！好美的故事……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1355
translate chinese skystressrelief_ce474d69:

    # g "Yeah..."
    g "是啊……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1356
translate chinese skystressrelief_8d04389a:

    # g "Wait, so that means...!"
    g "等一下，也就是说……！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1357
translate chinese skystressrelief_6a817549:

    # cl "Mhm. Emperor Kaito's DNA was used for serum #3, and Lady Sora's for #4."
    cl "嗯。海人的DNA被用来制作了三号血清，空姬则是四号。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1358
translate chinese skystressrelief_8c783922:

    # m "So, technically speaking..."
    m "所以，严格来说……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1359
translate chinese skystressrelief_3ab60115:

    # m "He's my husband?" (multiple=2)
    m "他是我丈夫？" (multiple=2)

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1360
translate chinese skystressrelief_1f9b5c64:

    # mc "She's my wife?" (multiple=2)
    mc "她是我老婆？" (multiple=2)

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1361
translate chinese skystressrelief_7317b50f:

    # m "..." (multiple=2)
    m "……" (multiple=2)

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1362
translate chinese skystressrelief_fb0b2ccf:

    # mc "..." (multiple=2)
    mc "……" (multiple=2)

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1363
translate chinese skystressrelief_8f34132c:

    # a "NO WAY!!!!"
    a "{b}不会吧！！！！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1364
translate chinese skystressrelief_12fcb0d7:

    # g "REALLY??!!"
    g "{b}真的吗？？！！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1366
translate chinese skystressrelief_ad6b7333:

    # mc "Hey, don't freeze up. It's getting weird here."
    mc "哎，别傻愣着啊。气氛有点奇怪了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1368
translate chinese skystressrelief_becc70f5:

    # a "*whimpers*"
    a "*抽泣*"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1369
translate chinese skystressrelief_63dbda96:

    # g "Heh...!"
    g "嘿……！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1370
translate chinese skystressrelief_84cca08e:

    # mc "So... is that why we've felt this weird connection?"
    mc "所以……这就是我们之间这种奇怪的连接的原因？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1371
translate chinese skystressrelief_ae6603b0:

    # m "It...it has to be. There's no other reason."
    m "一定……一定是这样的。不会有其他原因。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1372
translate chinese skystressrelief_e4e5860f:

    # la "Correct. The essences within you two are reaching out to each other."
    la "没错。你们体内的灵魂在互相渴望。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1373
translate chinese skystressrelief_457ad99a:

    # la "It may not be the same, but Lucien and Aveline has a certain connection between them too. I'm sure that goes for the rest of the Early Stages as well."
    la "虽然情况可能不太一样，但是卢希恩和艾芙琳之间也有一种联系。我想其他所有早期型肯定也都是这样。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1374
translate chinese skystressrelief_5cc68438:

    # mc "So... what do we do now? This is a lot to process..."
    mc "那……我们现在该干嘛？一下子发生了太多……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1375
translate chinese skystressrelief_31a4f689:

    # g "You fuck? Like a real husband and wife does?"
    g "上床做爱？就像真正的夫妻那样？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1376
translate chinese skystressrelief_bb28bba5:

    # a "Hey!"
    a "喂！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1377
translate chinese skystressrelief_ed0cdf42:

    # g "What?! I'm just saying!"
    g "干嘛？！我就随便说说！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1378
translate chinese skystressrelief_38da36eb:

    # la "It's your choice. Maybe talk it over. But... take some time to think for now."
    la "这是你们的自由。或许应该聊聊。不过……现在就先花时间仔细想想吧。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1379
translate chinese skystressrelief_c398eb64:

    # la "You've been through a lot today, it's a good opportunity to take a time off."
    la "你们今天经历了很多，是时候休息一下了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1380
translate chinese skystressrelief_c9f0d179:

    # mc "Yeah, we'll do that."
    mc "嗯，就这么办。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1381
translate chinese skystressrelief_d2f5e104:

    # la "Alright, we'll leave you to it. Contact Jess if you need anything."
    la "好了，我们就不打扰了。如果有事，就联系婕斯。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1382
translate chinese skystressrelief_77274478:

    # mc "Guess I'm footing the bill, but yeah... thanks for coming."
    mc "接下来估计到我付钱的时候了，不过，嗯……谢谢你们来。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1383
translate chinese skystressrelief_d680f7f0:

    # la "You charged him for Nicole and Yuna's service? Seriously..."
    la "喊妮可和由奈来一趟，你居然还收他的钱？认真的吗……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1384
translate chinese skystressrelief_8dcd34b8:

    # j "What are you talking about? You're the one who started our agency in the first place."
    j "你说什么呢？这个机构明明是你建立的啊。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1385
translate chinese skystressrelief_b6851bc8:

    # cl "Okay, okay. I'm not going to be your middle man, so let's just get out."
    cl "行了，行了。我不想当你们的中间人，所以我们赶紧出去吧。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1386
translate chinese skystressrelief_b81c4fda:

    # cl "Please excuse us."
    cl "再见了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1387
translate chinese skystressrelief_dfd0e56e:

    # mc "Take care."
    mc "再见。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1388
translate chinese skystressrelief_7f64041b:

    # mc "Didn't know Jess could be like that sometimes..."
    mc "没想到婕斯还有这一面……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1395
translate chinese skystressrelief_2b35b6fe_11:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1396
translate chinese skystressrelief_e612037c_8:

    # m "..."
    m "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1397
translate chinese skystressrelief_f5bbea40:

    # mc "Well... this is awkward..."
    mc "呃……有点尴尬……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1398
translate chinese skystressrelief_7211f7f6:

    # m "Hm? Why? I don't feel that awkward."
    m "嗯？为什么？我没觉得尴尬。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1399
translate chinese skystressrelief_f7160f4e:

    # mc "Says the one who was blushing like a tomato a moment ago."
    mc "你刚刚脸还红得跟番茄一样呢。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1400
translate chinese skystressrelief_29a4f6ab:

    # m "!!!"
    m "！！！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1401
translate chinese skystressrelief_fef20f98:

    # mc "See what I mean? Do you always freeze up like that when you're flustered?"
    mc "你看，又来了。你是一害羞就会愣着不动吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1402
translate chinese skystressrelief_4d6dd464:

    # m "I'm not sure. I just don't know how to react or what to make of what I feel."
    m "我不知道。我只是不知道该做什么反应，也不知道怎么说清楚我内心的想法。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1403
translate chinese skystressrelief_24b25b0f:

    # mc "*sighs*"
    mc "*叹气*"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1404
translate chinese skystressrelief_ee187746:

    # m "My heart is racing, but... it feels really nice. Is this what love is supposed to feel like?"
    m "我的心跳得好快，可是……这种感觉很好。这就是爱的感觉吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1407
translate chinese skystressrelief_6fb69700:

    # mc "I can't say for sure."
    mc "我也没法确定。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1408
translate chinese skystressrelief_19c1e4e2:

    # m "I see..."
    m "这样啊……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1410
translate chinese skystressrelief_5ef70042:

    # mc "I think so."
    mc "是啊。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1411
translate chinese skystressrelief_8d89cda7:

    # mc "But what do you really feel towards me?"
    mc "但是你对我究竟有什么感觉？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1412
translate chinese skystressrelief_5953e0ac:

    # m "I'm not sure... but I know I want to stay by your side."
    m "我不确定……但是我很清楚，我想待在你身边。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1416
translate chinese skystressrelief_3f1387a0:

    # mc "It's odd you have such a deep understanding of concepts but haven't experienced them yourself. Why is that?"
    mc "你对不少概念理解挺深，自己却没亲身体验过，还挺奇怪的。为什么会这样？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1417
translate chinese skystressrelief_dcef0d41:

    # m "I learned them through watching others. Over time, I accepted those observations as truths."
    m "那都是我通过观察其他人学来的。我慢慢就把那些观察当做事实接受了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1418
translate chinese skystressrelief_31beda84:

    # mc "I see... It's still strange to me."
    mc "这样啊……我还是觉得很奇怪。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1419
translate chinese skystressrelief_e5f0ae20:

    # m "Uh... Commander?"
    m "呃……指挥官？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1420
translate chinese skystressrelief_7c927b78:

    # mc "Yes?"
    mc "嗯？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1421
translate chinese skystressrelief_a7299b66:

    # m "Are you really my husband?"
    m "你真是我的丈夫吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1422
translate chinese skystressrelief_6e88ffe1:

    # mc "If the history records and the details about the serum are correct, then technically, yes..."
    mc "如果那个故事还有血清的作用都没错的话，那严格来说，没错……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1423
translate chinese skystressrelief_a1f3250d:

    # m "And I'm your wife?"
    m "我是你的妻子？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1424
translate chinese skystressrelief_a87a337b:

    # mc "Yep."
    mc "对。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1425
translate chinese skystressrelief_44c6ede1:

    # m "Then what do we do now? I have no idea what to do about this."
    m "那我们该怎么办？我不知道这到底代表着什么。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1426
translate chinese skystressrelief_c9033417:

    # mc "We can't just ignore the fact, and I wouldn't want to."
    mc "我们不能直接忽略这一点，我也不想那样。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1427
translate chinese skystressrelief_95c1b35d:

    # mc "It's a confusing situation, but it's something very special to us."
    mc "这情况挺让人摸不着头脑的，但对我们来说也是很特别的事。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1428
translate chinese skystressrelief_1b57b018:

    # mc "Do you want to forget about it, though?"
    mc "不过，你想直接无视掉吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1429
translate chinese skystressrelief_eb70c7f2:

    # m "*shaking her head* No, I don't wanna!"
    m "*摇头* 不，不想！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1430
translate chinese skystressrelief_f9b19453:

    # yt "*laughs* She sounded so childlike just now. Another rare thing for her to do. I'll add it to my list."
    yt "*大笑* 她刚刚的声音就跟小孩子一样。又是一件几乎不会看到她做的事。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1431
translate chinese skystressrelief_e333c0de:

    # mc "Then we'll have to accept it. Maybe not right away, but gradually, and I don't want to force you into this, either."
    mc "那我们就只能接受。不用立马接受，慢慢来，我也不会强迫你的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1432
translate chinese skystressrelief_d88c02a2:

    # m "I suppose that's all we can do."
    m "看来只能这样了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1433
translate chinese skystressrelief_8161319d:

    # mc "I still can't believe something like this is possible."
    mc "我还是不敢相信世上居然还会有这种事。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1434
translate chinese skystressrelief_1e5730ff:

    # mc "With our current technology, it shouldn't be. But here we are."
    mc "以现在的科技水平，应该不可能做到才对。结果却真的发生了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1435
translate chinese skystressrelief_be065c1b:

    # mc "Why was this kept a secret? It could save millions of lives."
    mc "为什么要保密呢？这东西能救无数人的命。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1436
translate chinese skystressrelief_1984c58c:

    # mc "But then again, knowing the risks, maybe it's better it stays hidden."
    mc "不过呢，考虑到背后的风险，可能还是保密更好。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1437
translate chinese skystressrelief_06bc9233:

    # m "Yes, there are many factors to consider. It's safer in the right hands. That's what Jess and her crew fought for."
    m "是的，有很多因素要考虑。血清要落在对的人手里才更安全。这也是婕斯和她的伙伴们的目标。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1438
translate chinese skystressrelief_9eee535d:

    # mc "Oh man... this is still a lot to take in. Giving it a rest was a good idea..."
    mc "唉……实在太难接受了。的确应该休息一下……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1439
translate chinese skystressrelief_e612037c_9:

    # m "..."
    m "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1440
translate chinese skystressrelief_e1aef487:

    # m "I need to tell you something."
    m "我有事要告诉你。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1441
translate chinese skystressrelief_191559e1:

    # mc "What's up?"
    mc "怎么了？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1442
translate chinese skystressrelief_237351aa:

    # m "Aside from us, there's one more serum user still alive."
    m "除了我们之外，还有其他的血清使用者活着。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1443
translate chinese skystressrelief_da14a39e:

    # mc "Really? Who?"
    mc "真的吗？谁？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1444
translate chinese skystressrelief_9621e5ba:

    # m "Subject Number Two."
    m "二号实验体。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1446
translate chinese skystressrelief_78d10570:

    # mc "Wait, are they..."
    mc "等一下，那不是……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1447
translate chinese skystressrelief_686a86ce:

    # m "The one who killed my friends when we tried to escape from the military."
    m "就是在我们想从军队里逃跑的时候，杀了我的朋友的人。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1449
translate chinese skystressrelief_f7f0d2d3:

    # m "She killed my friends during our escape attempt from the military."
    m "她在我们想从军队里逃跑的时候，杀了我的朋友。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1451
translate chinese skystressrelief_18fda4eb:

    # mc "So she's still out there?"
    mc "她还活着？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1452
translate chinese skystressrelief_d36c2f36:

    # m "Mhm..."
    m "嗯……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1453
translate chinese skystressrelief_2e182d41:

    # m "Her real name is {i}Aoife{/i}."
    m "她的真名叫{i}艾法{/i}。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1454
translate chinese skystressrelief_6ec507b4:

    # mc "E-Eefa?"
    mc "艾-艾法？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1455
translate chinese skystressrelief_e445314c:

    # m "Ee...fuh... Eefuh. It spells A, O, I, F, E. But that's how you pronounce it."
    m "艾……法……艾法。写法是A,O,I,F,E。读法就是艾法。（译注：Aoife是个很罕见的爱尔兰名字，所以主角和月才会有这段对话。）"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1456
translate chinese skystressrelief_84f16542:

    # mc "Okay..."
    mc "好吧……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1457
translate chinese skystressrelief_c64e64f6:

    # m "Her, being alive was raised to Jess and her crew's attention, but they've never been able to find her."
    m "婕斯他们已经知道她还活着，但一直找不到她。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1458
translate chinese skystressrelief_ecebd9bb:

    # m "If only I could..."
    m "要是我能找到她就好了……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1459
translate chinese skystressrelief_e612037c_10:

    # m "..."
    m "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1460
translate chinese skystressrelief_15054587:

    # mc "What will you do when you find her?"
    mc "找到她以后，你打算怎么办？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1461
translate chinese skystressrelief_3c8e055f:

    # m "I..."
    m "我……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1462
translate chinese skystressrelief_a2ec69bb:

    # mc "You seem conflicted. Why?"
    mc "你好像很矛盾。怎么了？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1463
translate chinese skystressrelief_04f7545c:

    # m "... Back then, the soldiers split into two groups over their beliefs."
    m "……那时候，士兵们分成了两个派系。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1464
translate chinese skystressrelief_e965e6fc:

    # m "The Loyalists supported the military's power. Many joined them, including One and Two."
    m "其中一个是忠诚派，支持军队的统治。有很多人加入，包括一号和二号。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1465
translate chinese skystressrelief_6f53e9ce:

    # m "Six, Eight, and I were part of the Activists, trying to initiate change from within."
    m "六号，八号和我是反对派的，想从内部做出改变。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1466
translate chinese skystressrelief_7c67f379:

    # m "Because we saw ourselves as prisoners, not soldiers, fighting someone else's war."
    m "因为我们觉得自己是囚犯，而不是士兵，我们是在被迫替别人卖命。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1467
translate chinese skystressrelief_01a88d0b:

    # m "But as the Loyalists had military backing, our numbers decreased day after day. Soon, only a few of us remained."
    m "但是忠诚派背后有军队撑腰，我们的人数越来越少。最后只剩下没几个人了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1468
translate chinese skystressrelief_b18fd41b:

    # m "One day, we were tasked with eliminating the Loyalists' leader, Subject Number Two."
    m "有一天，我们被派去干掉忠诚派的领袖，也就是二号实验体。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1469
translate chinese skystressrelief_c799f717:

    # mc "And you failed."
    mc "然后你们失败了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1470
translate chinese skystressrelief_08855e37:

    # m "Not completely..."
    m "并没有完全失败……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1471
translate chinese skystressrelief_9d756b17:

    # m "We planted a bomb in a Loyalist hideout, informed by a spy where One and Two were often found."
    m "我们在忠诚派的基地里装了炸弹，因为有一个间谍报告说一号和二号经常会去那里。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1472
translate chinese skystressrelief_50985e77:

    # m "Two survived the blast."
    m "二号没有被炸死。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1473
translate chinese skystressrelief_d9b92f68:

    # mc "And One?"
    mc "那一号呢？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1474
translate chinese skystressrelief_66669a2d:

    # m "He died trying to save Two from the fire caused by the explosion."
    m "爆炸引发了大火，他在救二号的途中死了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1475
translate chinese skystressrelief_0772fe90:

    # mc "So that's why she's after you."
    mc "所以她才追杀你们。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1476
translate chinese skystressrelief_ac3afacd_1:

    # m "Mhm."
    m "嗯。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1477
translate chinese skystressrelief_04f8dade:

    # yt "It's not a battle for justice, but a cycle of revenge with no clear right side... I see..."
    yt "原来如此……这并非正义之战，而是难以辨别谁对谁错的仇恨循环……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1481
translate chinese skystressrelief_41d22067:

    # mc "Listen, Moon, I know you're hurting over this, but going after Aoife won't solve anything."
    mc "听我说，月，我知道你很受伤，但是去找艾法也什么都解决不了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1482
translate chinese skystressrelief_e78f1563:

    # mc "Even if you get your revenge, it won't bring your friends back or undo the past. You get that, right?"
    mc "哪怕你最后成功复仇了，你的朋友也不会回来，过去也不会改变。你懂的吧？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1483
translate chinese skystressrelief_d0add6a8:

    # m "Yes..."
    m "是的……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1484
translate chinese skystressrelief_46ef2dfb:

    # mc "Moving forward means letting go of that bitterness."
    mc "向前看就意味着放下这种苦涩。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1485
translate chinese skystressrelief_220a989e:

    # mc "Hanging onto that anger will just eat away at you. It's not going to bring you any peace."
    mc "一直保持愤怒只会慢慢吞噬掉你。不会给你带来半点安宁。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1486
translate chinese skystressrelief_05c12fa6:

    # mc "And how long are you going to endure that?"
    mc "你打算一直这样子下去吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1487
translate chinese skystressrelief_566cc904:

    # m "I... I'm not sure I can let it go, Commander. Their deaths isn't something I can just forget."
    m "我……我没法就这么算了，指挥官。她们的死没法就这么算了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1488
translate chinese skystressrelief_926f3362:

    # mc "I'm not saying you have to forgive her. But if there's a chance to stop the fighting, don't let it go."
    mc "我不是说让你原谅她。可是如果有机会结束战斗的话，就不要错过。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1489
translate chinese skystressrelief_6fa08fc5:

    # mc "You have me now, Moon. Just think about that."
    mc "你现在有我了，月。仔细想想吧。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1492
translate chinese skystressrelief_e6aa993f:

    # mc "I promised I wouldn't dictate your choices, right?"
    mc "我保证过我不会替你做决定，对吧？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1493
translate chinese skystressrelief_54e81aab:

    # mc "And I'm not about to start now, pretending I've got all the answers. This decision is yours to make."
    mc "而且我也不会假装我什么都知道。这个决定是你要做的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1494
translate chinese skystressrelief_0e45bf94:

    # mc "Just know that whatever you decide, I'm with you."
    mc "你只要记住，不管你怎么想，我都和你在一起。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1495
translate chinese skystressrelief_67188104:

    # mc "Whether you go after Aoife or choose to let go and move forward, there's no wrong choice here. Focus on what {i}you{/i} need to do."
    mc "不管你是要去找艾法，还是选择向前迈进，都不是错误的选择。专注于{b}你{/b}该做什么就好。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1496
translate chinese skystressrelief_5d5dc6e8:

    # mc "You have me now, Moon. That's all that matters."
    mc "你现在有我了，月。这才是最重要的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1498
translate chinese skystressrelief_e612037c_11:

    # m "..."
    m "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1502
translate chinese skystressrelief_9f93290d:

    # bo "Hm?"
    bo "嗯？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1503
translate chinese skystressrelief_5e35ab9b:

    # fr "I've gathered enough resources, father. Everything is in place; we're ready to make our move."
    fr "我已经准备妥当了，父亲。万事俱备；随时可以行动。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1504
translate chinese skystressrelief_17d930d3:

    # bo "And these {i}resources{/i} include her?"
    bo "你的准备里也包括她？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1505
translate chinese skystressrelief_ed2399c8:

    # fr "Yes, I heeded your warning about {i}that{/i} soldier."
    fr "是的，我听从了你有关{i}那个{/i}士兵的警告。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1506
translate chinese skystressrelief_a96049d9:

    # fr "If everything we know about her is accurate, we need a stronger soldier to counter her."
    fr "如果我们对她的了解是准确的，那就需要一个更强的士兵来对付她。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1507
translate chinese skystressrelief_24e51295:

    # bo "..."
    bo "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1508
translate chinese skystressrelief_b16ce267:

    # bo "Subject Number Two, reborn from a marksman renowned in history, set against a Legend-class like Sora? Curious..."
    bo "二号实验体，寄宿着历史上知名的神枪手，对抗索拉这样的传奇人物啊……有趣。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1509
translate chinese skystressrelief_7c7ccbb8:

    # bo "*chuckles* Fascinating."
    bo "*笑* 非常好。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1510
translate chinese skystressrelief_23808b25:

    # bo "End her life. Now that she has discovered her Odd, she ceases to intrigue me."
    bo "杀了她。既然她现在找到了她的奇数，我对她也就没兴趣了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1511
translate chinese skystressrelief_3864a381:

    # ao "..."
    ao "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1512
translate chinese skystressrelief_05781f8a:

    # fr "Speak up. Father is commanding you."
    fr "说话啊。父亲有令。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1513
translate chinese skystressrelief_5c0454a2:

    # bo "She will obey, but speaking is not her forte."
    bo "她会听命令的，只是说话不算是她的强项。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1514
translate chinese skystressrelief_63806ae7:

    # bo "You have my full backing. I am eager to witness the fruits of your strategy. Do entertain me, Francis."
    bo "我会全力支持你。我迫切地想看看你的策略最后会有什么成果。不要让我失望，弗朗西斯。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1515
translate chinese skystressrelief_f435c995:

    # fr "We've got everything we need. Plus, I have my own reasons for targeting him first. He's finished."
    fr "我们已准备好了一切。而且，我也有个人的理由先从他开刀。他死定了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1516
translate chinese skystressrelief_79acacd4:

    # bo "Personal vendettas can sharpen one's determination or cloud one's judgment. Tread carefully with the strand you unwind, Francis."
