    # a "..."
    a "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2491
translate chinese skystressrelief_4da6fe0c:

    # a "... I was told she reformed the mafia as a charity. I had no idea things were that... dire."
    a "……我听说她把黑手党改组成了慈善组织。没想到情况会……那么糟糕。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2492
translate chinese skystressrelief_43070ce1:

    # j "Yes, your mother had good intentions, she had no desire for power."
    j "是的，你妈妈是一片好意，她丝毫不贪图权力。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2493
translate chinese skystressrelief_44de4e1a:

    # j "She saw potential in such a corrupt group and aimed to transform it into a force for good. To give back to those who served her."
    j "她发现了腐败至极的组织里遗留的潜力，想把它变成一支向善的力量。为了回报那些服侍过她的人。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2494
translate chinese skystressrelief_a10f915e:

    # j "She made progress, but with the mafia's influence halved, her dream became unattainable."
    j "她并非毫无进展，但随着黑手党的影响力不断消退，她的梦想也变得遥不可及。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2495
translate chinese skystressrelief_79873693:

    # a "Why didn't you guys help her then? You and your crew have the capability to take on her challenges."
    a "那你们为什么不帮她？你们的人有足够的能力帮她解决问题。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2496
translate chinese skystressrelief_516a91b3:

    # j "I once harbored a vendetta against the group."
    j "我以前跟组织有不共戴天之仇。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2497
translate chinese skystressrelief_f98d978b:

    # j "And now, working under the government's oversight, a mafia... remains a mafia."
    j "现在，我在政府的监管下工作，而黑手党……再怎么说也还是个黑手党。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2498
translate chinese skystressrelief_1a65f0f2:

    # j "No matter how you dress it up, it is still a shady organization that operates beyond the government's gaze."
    j "不管怎么粉饰，依然还是个超脱政府管辖的地下组织。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2499
translate chinese skystressrelief_67fdb8f1:

    # a "Then why are you helping us, given your stance?"
    a "那以你的立场，为什么还要帮我们？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2500
translate chinese skystressrelief_c3a72fd3:

    # j "Let's just say... it serves a mutual interest."
    j "可以说……这对我们双方都有好处。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2501
translate chinese skystressrelief_bc60b52a:

    # j "We get to address unfinished business, and you gain more chance to secure the peace you wanted."
    j "既可以让我们把遗留的工作做完，也能让你们更快迎来你们想要的平静生活。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2502
translate chinese skystressrelief_0c0ebb37:

    # j "Besides, I couldn't simply disregard Georgia's last wishes."
    j "再说了，我也没法随便就放弃乔治亚的遗愿。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2503
translate chinese skystressrelief_1250291f:

    # j "Aside from my crew, you're the only people I have left... I've lost too many already..."
    j "除开我们一伙人之外，我就只剩下你一个人了……我已经失去了太多人……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2504
translate chinese skystressrelief_e56c4da0:

    # j "That being said, I can only offer a limited personal support. I can't officially work on your behalf."
    j "话虽这么说，我也只能提供一些有限的私人帮助。我没法在明面上给你干活。"

