translate chinese skystressrelief_183aa778:

    # j "But with Bonheur now under our thumb, the remainder of the mafia should naturally realign with you."
    j "不过现在博纳尔已经倒了，黑手党里剩下的人应该自然而然就会听你指挥。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2506
translate chinese skystressrelief_f10de234:

    # j "Like what Hera told you, what you choose to do with that power is entirely up to you."
    j "就像赫拉跟你说的那样，你要怎么使用这权力完全取决于你。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2507
translate chinese skystressrelief_bb8e4b4e_5:

    # a "..."
    a "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2508
translate chinese skystressrelief_a489dae2:

    # a "I understand, but..."
    a "我明白，但是……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2509
translate chinese skystressrelief_48610762:

    # a "That decision will not come from me, but from him, now that he's tied to my blood."
    a "我和他已经有了婚约，那么这个决定就该由他来做。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2510
translate chinese skystressrelief_1d2a4835:

    # j "That's right."
    j "没错。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2511
translate chinese skystressrelief_a38f7d41:

    # a "I know it was his and Emma's idea. I believe it's the right course of action..."
    a "我知道这是他和艾玛的主意。我觉得这样做是对的……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2512
translate chinese skystressrelief_345c7950:

    # a "I thought it would only be a game of cat and mouse, I never expected things to become this heavy... But he did..."
    a "我一开始只以为这就只是个猫捉老鼠的游戏，我从来没想过事情会变得这么沉重……但是他想到了……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2513
translate chinese skystressrelief_a28945b8:

    # a "Now that this all happened, I realize he anticipated this all along."
    a "在一切都发生之后，我才意识到他从一开始就预料到了这些。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2516
translate chinese skystressrelief_ced261ca:

    # mc "If my intuition is right, I'm sure what we did at Hera's safe house alerted whoever is pulling the strings behind her back."
    mc "如果我的直觉没错的话，我们在赫拉的安全屋的所作所为肯定引起了在她背后的那个人的警觉。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2517
translate chinese skystressrelief_2faeb5ca:

    # mc "If so, they'll move sooner than we think. We must be prepared if that happens."
    mc "如果真是这样，他们的行动肯定会比我们想得还要快。我们必须做好准备。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2520
translate chinese skystressrelief_0191d577:

    # mc "I still don't know what they want or their true goal, but I won't let that affect our lives."
    mc "我依然不知道他们想要什么，真正的目标是什么，但我不会让他们影响到我们的生活。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2521
translate chinese skystressrelief_f73d3157:

    # mc "We have people with the right skillsets to do this. I need you to trust me and let me be your brains."
    mc "我们这边的人都身怀绝技，肯定可以做到。我需要你们相信我，让我成为你们的大脑。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2523
translate chinese skystressrelief_f199d165:

    # a "... I thought you said we were all in this together, [mc]..."
    a "……你明明说我们要一起面对的，[mc!t]……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2524
translate chinese skystressrelief_69f1bd8c:

    # k "After watching Jovian's documentary, I had a feeling he might pull something like this..."
    k "在看过乔维安的记录之后，我就隐约感到他会做出这种事来……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2525
translate chinese skystressrelief_2d06cfea:

    # k "I knew that silence was telling something..."
    k "我就知道那时候的沉默别有深意……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2526
translate chinese skystressrelief_99d9179c:

    # k "What he did wasn't all for naught, but it was a suicide mission..."
    k "他的努力没有白费，可那完全就是个自杀式的计划……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2527
translate chinese skystressrelief_a67fbf48:

    # j "Well... we can call it braveness, stubbornness, or even foolishness, but can we really blame him for his desires?"
    j "嗯……我们可以说他勇敢，固执，甚至愚蠢，但是总不能怪他有自己的私心吧？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2528
translate chinese skystressrelief_7d4f029f:

    # j "Thanks to him, those simple dreams you had are now within reach."
    j "多亏了他，你们过去那些简单的梦想现在马上就能实现了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2529
translate chinese skystressrelief_51e92752:

    # k "They may be simple dreams... but at what cost? I nearly lost him too..."
    k "的确是简单的梦想……可代价呢？我差点连他也失去了……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2530
translate chinese skystressrelief_e3b6861c:

    # j "Everything comes with a price, Klara. That's part of what we've learned."
    j "凡事都有代价，克拉拉。我们早就明白这一点了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2531
translate chinese skystressrelief_07354a6f:

    # k "I know... I've been with the Dietrich Clan long enough to understand that..."
    k "是啊……我在德特里希氏族里待了那么久，我很清楚……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2532
translate chinese skystressrelief_bb8e4b4e_6:

    # a "..."
    a "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2533
translate chinese skystressrelief_70146e31:

    # a "How's he doing?"
    a "他的情况怎么样？"

