translate chinese skystressrelief_727e976c:

    # j "The good news is he's starting to recover, especially impressive considering it's only been a day since he was injured."
    j "好消息是他已经开始恢复了。考虑到他昨天才受伤，恢复的速度可以说是非常快。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2537
translate chinese skystressrelief_ceb4755f:

    # k "Is that because of..."
    k "难道是因为……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2538
translate chinese skystressrelief_120389df:

    # jj "Yes, the serum. It's the same with Fang, Lance, and Claire. They always heal a bit faster than normal people."
    jj "对，是血清。跟獠牙，长矛还有克莱尔的情况是一样的。他们恢复的速度就是比常人快。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2539
translate chinese skystressrelief_42ee6768:

    # a "And the bad news?"
    a "那坏消息呢？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2540
translate chinese skystressrelief_570b0f12:

    # j "His wounds and burns will heal, but the damage is irreversible. And I'm not just talking about external injuries."
    j "伤口会愈合，但是造成的伤害却没法恢复。这不仅仅指的是外伤。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2541
translate chinese skystressrelief_1f302df1:

    # j "Some of his internal organs have suffered significant damage due to his sudden... awakening."
    j "由于他突然觉醒……一些内脏受到了严重损伤。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2542
translate chinese skystressrelief_61c9b683:

    # j "Thanks to Bonheur's intel, we now understand how the serum is activated."
    j "多亏了博纳尔的情报，我们现在清楚血清是怎么被激活的了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2543
translate chinese skystressrelief_d1bfaca9:

    # j "The Incubation stage involves applying mild, consistent pain to the body, gradually activating the serum."
    j "所谓的孵化期就是给实验体的身体持续施加程度中等的疼痛，逐渐激活血清。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2544
translate chinese skystressrelief_c284bfdb:

    # j "But... we were a bit too late. [mc] really is an anomaly among serum users."
    j "可惜……我们知道得太晚了。[mc!t]属实是所有血清使用者里最异常的一个。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2545
translate chinese skystressrelief_7b17f582:

    # k "How... How is all this possible? The serum, it's wonders, it's risks... How can such a thing even exist?"
    k "这……这怎么可能呢？这个血清，这么厉害，又有这么大的风险……这种东西怎么会存在？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2546
translate chinese skystressrelief_467caee0:

    # j "I used to ask the same question."
    j "我以前也有同样的疑问。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2547
translate chinese skystressrelief_03da4c5c:

    # j "With today's technology, it {i}could{/i} be possible to create something like it, especially since a certain gaming company is now making neural implants for their upcoming game."
    j "以当下的科技，要做出与之类似的东西也并不是没有可能，毕竟都有个游戏公司在研究神经植入体了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2548
translate chinese skystressrelief_5919c59e:

    # j "But the serum predates our current tech by decades, when technology was far less advanced."
    j "但是那个血清几十年前就已经存在了，那时候的技术远没有现在发达。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2549
translate chinese skystressrelief_47b91df3:

    # j "Yet, we've seen it work. We know it exists."
    j "可是，它却的确存在着。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2550
translate chinese skystressrelief_3d40f55d:

    # j "Going back to [mc]'s case... He's healing, but all we can do is wait and hope for the best."
    j "说回[mc!t]的情况……他正在恢复，但我们能做的只有乖乖等着，希望没有意外出现。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2551
translate chinese skystressrelief_bb8e4b4e_7:

    # a "..."
    a "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2552
translate chinese skystressrelief_9346ffec:

    # a "How about Moon?"
    a "月呢？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2553
translate chinese skystressrelief_9c9f5c62:

    # j "Ah, you shouldn't worry about her. She is built to last."
    j "啊，不用担心她。她结实得很。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2554
translate chinese skystressrelief_b4d2c72f:

    # j "She may be tired, but she'll be fine."
    j "可能会有点累，但没有大碍。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2555
translate chinese skystressrelief_65c996b4:

    # j "There's something I need to ask of all of you, though."
    j "不过我有事要拜托你们。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2556
translate chinese skystressrelief_b326bde3:

    # k "What's that?"
    k "什么事？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2557
translate chinese skystressrelief_1748b9ab:

    # j "Now that we all know who they are, if possible, let's allow them to keep their pasts to themselves.."
    j "虽然我们都知道他们的真实身份了，不过还是尽量不要在他们面前提起吧。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2558
translate chinese skystressrelief_4a1d9447:

    # j "I don't know how they will process that fact, so let's not preempt their reactions."
    j "我不知道他们会怎么看这件事，所以还是小心为好。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2559
translate chinese skystressrelief_060083c5:

    # j "Whether they come to terms with it or not, it's a sensitive matter that only they can truly understand."
    j "不管他们能不能接受，这都是只有他们自己才能弄懂的很敏感的事情。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2560
translate chinese skystressrelief_98f3c084:

    # j "Just remember, despite what we've learned, [mc] remains [mc], and Moon is still Moon."
    j "记住，不管情况如何，[mc!t]依然是[mc!t]，月依然是月。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2561
translate chinese skystressrelief_508efe86:

    # k "That's true... I'll make sure the others know."
    k "说得对……我会转告给其他人的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2562
translate chinese skystressrelief_9a6fb353:

    # j "Thank you."
    j "谢谢。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2569
translate chinese skystressrelief_e2413718:

    # a "I can't believe you did that, [mc]. What were you thinking, going in there by yourself?"
    a "你居然会做那种事，[mc!t]。你到底是怎么想的，怎么会一个人跑过去？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2570
translate chinese skystressrelief_8eddb40f:

    # a "*sigh* Honestly, what am I going to do with you? I can't even get mad."
    a "*叹气* 说实话，我能拿你怎么办呢？我连生气都没法生。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2571
translate chinese skystressrelief_a5c3a70f:

    # a "You know this ring would be meaningless without you, right?"
    a "你也知道这枚戒指没有你的话就失去意义了吧……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2572
translate chinese skystressrelief_f0b7987b:

    # a "I have so much to tell you, [mc]. So you better wake up soon."
    a "我有好多话想对你说，[mc!t]。快点醒过来吧。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2573
translate chinese skystressrelief_50d8b8dd:

    # a "The others are hesitant to visit because they can't bear to see you like this, especially Sky. But I'll try to persuade them again."
    a "其他人都不忍心看到你这个样子，都在纠结要不要来看你。特别是斯凯。不过我会再去劝劝她们的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2574
translate chinese skystressrelief_c8315911:

    # a "... No, I'll make sure everyone comes to see you."
    a "……不，我会让所有人都来看你的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2575
translate chinese skystressrelief_dc831e9e:

    # a "But forget about that for now. Hasn't your hair... gotten a bit longer?"
    a "不过就先不管那些了。你的头发……是不是变长了？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2576
translate chinese skystressrelief_79f5f3f4:

    # a "That's odd..."
    a "奇怪……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2577
translate chinese skystressrelief_8ca53d69:

    # a "Not that it makes you any less handsome, anyway."
    a "不过你还是一样帅气就是了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2584
translate chinese skystressrelief_39ddd3a0:

    # shu "EEEEY! WAZZUP!"
    shu "起床啦！太阳晒屁股啦！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2585
translate chinese skystressrelief_be8c1cd3:

    # shu "The name's Shu, but you can call me the highlight of your day!"
    shu "小爷名叫修，不过你也可以叫我宇宙无敌大帅哥！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2586
translate chinese skystressrelief_ba61b0a7:

    # shu "I'm the guy who walks into a room, and boom, it lights up—no spotlight needed, though I surely deserve one!"
    shu "我不管走到哪，那地方都会立马亮堂起来——根本不需要聚光灯，不过我倒的确只该站在聚光灯下面！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2587
translate chinese skystressrelief_c99542a7:

    # shu "When it comes to making an entrance, consider me a pro!"
    shu "要说到闪亮登场，那可没人比我更懂了！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2588
translate chinese skystressrelief_3d4c51fe:

    # shu "Style, charisma, and a dash of modesty, all wrapped up in one irresistible package!"
    shu "气质，魅力，再加上一丝谦虚，全都打包进我这美到爆表的躯体里！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2589
translate chinese skystressrelief_6d27f5d5:

    # shu "If you don't know me, WHY?"
    shu "你要是不认识我，那我倒要问问你是从哪个山沟里跑出来的了！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2590
translate chinese skystressrelief_1d791ffa:

    # shu "..."
    shu "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2591
translate chinese skystressrelief_1b700130:

    # shu "Oh... you're still dead, huh?"
    shu "……你还没活过来啊？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2592
translate chinese skystressrelief_0f34cb89:

    # shu "Anyway, got you some clothes I think you'll like."
    shu "总之呢，给你买了点衣服，你应该会喜欢。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2593
translate chinese skystressrelief_6088e9d3:

    # shu "Heard you're a badass now, so I picked out something edgy for when you're up and about."
    shu "听说你现在是个超级猛男了，所以我给你挑了点帅的，让你装逼的时候穿。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2594
translate chinese skystressrelief_59761419:

    # shu "... I've prepared alot for you, so try not to keep me waiting too long."
    shu "……我给你准备了很多东西，可别让我等太久啊。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2595
translate chinese skystressrelief_1dc6ff06:

    # shu "Catch you later, dude..."
    shu "之后再聊，兄弟……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2596
translate chinese skystressrelief_40af51ff:

    # shu "*wheeze* Actually, scratch that! I've still got a few hours here, so you're stuck with me and my rambling!!"
    shu "算了，撤回！我还有几个小时的时间，你就继续好好欣赏我的美貌吧！！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2605
translate chinese skystressrelief_29eb82a6:

    # g "Hey, I know you're worried about us. Rest easy; we're all fine."
    g "嘿，我知道你在担心我们。没事的；我们都很好。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2606
translate chinese skystressrelief_392e0767:

    # g "But [mc]..."
    g "但是，[mc!t]……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2607
translate chinese skystressrelief_4730eb4e:

    # g "You never forced us to be with you; it was our choice. Our lives were never yours to shoulder."
    g "你从来没有强迫过我们跟你在一起；那都是我们自己的选择。你根本不用背负我们的人生。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2608
translate chinese skystressrelief_3baaff07:

    # g "Still, thank you for trying to protect us."
    g "不过，还是谢谢你保护我们。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2609
translate chinese skystressrelief_86556e43:

    # g "It's over now; you did it. So, please, don't ever do anything like that again, okay?"
    g "现在都结束了；你成功了。所以，拜托你，以后不要再做那种事了，好吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2610
translate chinese skystressrelief_0e5c4755:

    # g "Emma's done with the Winter's case, so she'll be able to visit you tomorrow."
    g "艾玛已经解决完温特斯家的事了，所以她明天就能来看你了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2611
translate chinese skystressrelief_756e3c79:

    # g "And Aine's a little busy, so it's my turn to watch over you for the entire day."
    g "艾妮也挺忙的，所以今天轮到我照顾你。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2612
translate chinese skystressrelief_cf1bcb5a:

    # g "*laughs* No alcohol nor tobacco breaks, I promise."
    g "*大笑* 我保证，我不会偷偷溜走去抽烟喝酒的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2619
translate chinese skystressrelief_367b1461:

    # e "Sorry it took me a while to get here. I was taking care of the Winters."
    e "抱歉，我过了这么久才来。我之前在处理温特斯家的事。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2620
translate chinese skystressrelief_d3ca06b5:

    # e "But that's exactly what you would've told me, right?"
    e "不过这肯定也是你希望我做的，对吧？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2621
translate chinese skystressrelief_21742eae:

    # e "\"Prioritize what matters, Emma.\". That's always been your way, putting everyone else before yourself."
    e "“优先做重要的事，艾玛。”你一直都是这样，总是把别人看得比自己重要。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2622
translate chinese skystressrelief_4c63ef81:

    # e "Thank you, [mc]..."
    e "谢谢你，[mc!t]……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2623
translate chinese skystressrelief_ed58b291:

    # e "Thank you for every sacrifice, especially for all the times you've been there for me."
    e "谢谢你做出的牺牲，特别是你陪在我身边那么久。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2624
translate chinese skystressrelief_33f908c2:

    # e "You never needed to prove yourself as a hero, [mc]. In my eyes, you've always been one. Without you, I can't begin to imagine where I'd be right now."
    e "你从来都不需要证明自己是英雄，[mc!t]。在我眼里，你一直都是英雄。要是没有你，我都不知道现在的我会是什么样子。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2625
translate chinese skystressrelief_452b78fb:

    # e "Yes, our journey to get to where we are today was filled with tears, with both of us giving up so much."
    e "我们至今为止的经历的确充满了泪水，我们两个都失去了很多。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2626
translate chinese skystressrelief_9ac13024:

    # e "But done't forget that I'm by your side just as much as you've been by mine."
    e "但是不要忘记，我会一直陪着你，就像你一直陪着我一样。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2627
translate chinese skystressrelief_0e9bbc56:

    # e "I'll be waiting for you, [mc]."
    e "我会等着你的，[mc!t]。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2633
translate chinese skystressrelief_e1554201:

    # s "..."
    s "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2634
translate chinese skystressrelief_4a893b1b:

    # k "Sky, honey, come on now, you can do it."
    k "斯凯，亲爱的，加油，你可以的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2635
translate chinese skystressrelief_509eee68:

    # s "But... he looks so..."
    s "可是……他的样子太……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2636
translate chinese skystressrelief_c0a115a8:

    # k "Sky, he's not gone. He's fighting, stronger than ever."
    k "斯凯，他没有死。他正在战斗，非常坚强地战斗。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2637
translate chinese skystressrelief_e1554201_1:

    # s "..."
    s "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2638
translate chinese skystressrelief_d847c123:

    # s "*hics*"
    s "*抽泣*"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2639
translate chinese skystressrelief_1098f857:

    # s "I'm sorry, I just... can't look at him like this."
    s "对不起，我……我真的不敢看这样的他。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2640
translate chinese skystressrelief_e6716d1f:

    # s "We lost [landlord], now he's like this..."
    s "[landlord!t]已经不在了，他又成了这样……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2641
translate chinese skystressrelief_c2fb8e72:

    # s "I'm scared, [landlady]... What if he doesn't wake up?"
    s "我好害怕，[landlady!t]……万一他醒不过来怎么办？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2642
translate chinese skystressrelief_29480853:

    # k "Don't say that, Sky. He'll wake up, he has to. But right now, we've got to hold on to hope."
    k "别这么说，斯凯。他会醒的，一定会。我们现在绝对不能放弃希望。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2648
translate chinese skystressrelief_7039fac4:

    # n "[mc], I legged it over as soon as I heard about what happened."
    n "[mc!t]，我一听说发生了什么就立马赶过来了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2649
translate chinese skystressrelief_f6ad5004:

    # n "I still can't wrap my head around why you did that, but bloody hell, I admire your guts."
    n "我还是想不明白你为什么会那样，但是你小子真算是有种的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2650
translate chinese skystressrelief_aace68bb:

    # n "Once you've set your sights on somethin', no one's changin' yer mind, huh? That we both have in common."
    n "你一旦下定了决心，那谁也拦不住你，对吧？这一点我们两个是一样的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2651
translate chinese skystressrelief_2b35b6fe_24:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2652
translate chinese skystressrelief_cd7dfdc0:

    # n "... Honestly, I'm a bit lost for words here. It's rough seein' ya like this, but I'm stoked you're still with us."
    n "……说实话，我有点不知道该说什么。看你这个样子我很难受，但知道你没有生命危险之后我又很高兴。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2653
translate chinese skystressrelief_fe478cc4:

    # n "But I'll tell ya what... hearing the news nearly knocked the wind outta me."
    n "这么跟你说吧……我听说你的事之后连呼吸都有点困难了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2654
translate chinese skystressrelief_0fe8e66a:

    # n "We might not have hung out much, but turns out we're tighter than I thought we'd get."
    n "我们一起度过的时间不多，结果关系进展的速度远超我的想象。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2655
translate chinese skystressrelief_ae6d891f:

    # n "I mean, what are the odds that I'd get close with my old man's client's [tenant]?"
    n "谁能想到我会跟我老爸的客户的[tenant!t]玩到一起？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2657
translate chinese skystressrelief_5819c718:

    # n "... And what's the chance of that same bloke makin' me reckon I might be worthy of loving again?"
    n "……又有谁能想到那个人还能让我意识到我还是值得再被爱的？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2658
translate chinese skystressrelief_69d4c328:

    # n "What I'm trying to say is... when you pull through, I'll have a cold one waiting for ya."
    n "我想说的是……等你挺过去之后，我要跟你好好喝一杯。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2659
translate chinese skystressrelief_f5a87dc4:

    # n "'Cause if there's one thing I'm sure of, it's that you'll get past this. That's just who you are."
    n "因为我非常确定，你一定能挺过去的。你就是这种人。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2660
translate chinese skystressrelief_20eaaac0:

    # n "Just don't leave us waitin' for too long, alright?"
    n "别让我们等太久，好吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2667
translate chinese skystressrelief_a16b8fb2:

    # f "Well, well, well... Look who's trying to be a hero."
    f "瞧瞧……这床上躺着的不是我们的大英雄嘛。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2668
translate chinese skystressrelief_fd65cb42:

    # f "But seriously, [mc], that was one heck of a stunt you pulled."
    f "不过说真的，[mc!t]，你可真是整了个大的出来。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2669
translate chinese skystressrelief_a003d538:

    # f "I didn't know what to do when Francis grabbed you that night. All I knew was I needed to get help, and fast."
    f "弗朗西斯把你抓走的时候，我根本不知道该这么办。我只知道要赶快去找人帮忙。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2670
translate chinese skystressrelief_a766317c:

    # f "You had me scared the shit out of my mind, did you know that?"
    f "你可是把我吓坏了，你知不知道啊？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2671
translate chinese skystressrelief_d42400b0:

    # f "But... I'm relieved you're okay now."
    f "但是……既然你没事，我就放心了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2672
translate chinese skystressrelief_0cfb5b23:

    # f "You better get well soon. It's not fun working alone, you know...? I need my partner in crime back."
    f "你要快点好起来啊。一个人上班太无聊了……我需要我的工作搭子赶快回归。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2673
translate chinese skystressrelief_77bc10b4:

    # f "Oh, and guess what? I finally got Moon to come visit."
    f "噢，还有，没想到吧，我终于劝动月，让她来看你了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2674
translate chinese skystressrelief_e40aab04:

    # f "Yeah, she's fine, but she's been a bit hesitant about seeing you. Can't figure out why, though..."
    f "她情况很好，但就是不太想来看你。搞不明白是为什么……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2675
translate chinese skystressrelief_ade0e2a5:

    # f "Seeing her tears filled with blood like that, man, I was speechless. I've never seen anything like that."
    f "看她眼里流那么多血泪出来，天呐，我都说不出话来。我从来没见过这种事。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2682
translate chinese skystressrelief_e6f3e355:

    # m "That night I saw you, something strange happened. Memories began flashing in my head, and suddenly, I remembered everything."
    m "那天晚上我看到你之后，就发生了一件奇怪的事。记忆冲进了我的脑海，我突然就全都想起来了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2683
translate chinese skystressrelief_b3767c26:

    # m "Lady Sora's memories and emotions merged with mine, making it feel like I had lived her life, not just inherited her memories."
    m "空的记忆和感情跟我的融合在一起，让我觉得我不只是继承了她的记忆，而是真正经历过她的人生一样。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2684
translate chinese skystressrelief_974d14cb:

    # m "I experienced her heartache over losing Emperor Kaito firsthand. It makes me wonder... have you seen Kaito's memories, too?"
    m "我亲身体会到了她失去海人时的那股心痛。于是我就在想……你是不是也看到了海人的记忆呢？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2685
translate chinese skystressrelief_f1359962:

    # m "It's strange, isn't it? It feels like history is repeating itself, as if caught in a loop."
    m "这很奇怪吧？好像历史进入了循环，一再重演。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2686
translate chinese skystressrelief_c8502aeb:

    # m "But it also feels like Sora and Kaito are trying to bring us back together, to break that cycle and change our destiny."
    m "但我也感觉空和海人正在努力帮我们团聚，打破循环，改变命运。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2687
translate chinese skystressrelief_2b35b6fe_25:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2688
translate chinese skystressrelief_895ffd6b:

    # m "[mc], it's been nearly two weeks since I've been living without you."
    m "[mc!t]，没有你在身边，我一个人已经生活快两个星期了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2689
translate chinese skystressrelief_8e68c123:

    # m "Lying there, unconscious, I know you can't respond, but I have to tell you... I have to let out these feelings that aren't only Lady Sora's but mine as well.."
    m "你就这么静静地躺着，我知道你没法回答，但我必须告诉你……我必须发泄出这些感情，不仅是空的感情，也是我的感情……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2690
translate chinese skystressrelief_09ecb0ff:

    # m "In these memories, I feel Sora's love for Kaito, it's so deep that it transcends time itself. And standing by your side, I understand that love because I feel it too."
    m "我从那些记忆里感受到了空对海人的爱，那份感情真挚到超越了时间。现在，站在你身边，我理解了这份爱，因为我心里也有一样的感觉。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2691
translate chinese skystressrelief_aac99c29:

    # m "It's not only because of the memories or the feelings passed down to me. It's because of who you are, and the time we've spent together."
    m "不只是因为那些被传递给我的感情与记忆。是因为你就是你，是因为我们一起度过的时间。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2692
translate chinese skystressrelief_10480c04:

    # m "[mc], I love you..."
    m "[mc!t]，我爱你……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2693
translate chinese skystressrelief_61a1296e:

    # m "Even though you're not aware of it right now, I need you to know that my feelings are real, a blend of the past and present, something uniquely ours."
    m "尽管你现在还意识不到，我必须让你知道我的感情是真实的，是过去与现在的融合，是独特的，只属于我们两个的东西。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2694
translate chinese skystressrelief_07a19484:

    # m "I can't see what the future holds, nor can I dictate the course of history."
    m "我看不到未来将要发生的事，也没法决定历史运行的轨迹。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2695
translate chinese skystressrelief_ce868e24:

    # m "But one thing I'm certain of is my feelings for you. They're as strong as Sora's for Kaito, yet they're my own."
    m "但我能确定我对你的感情。就跟空对海人的爱一样强烈，但却是我自己内心的感受。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2696
translate chinese skystressrelief_84d26f87:

    # m "I promise, when you wake up, I'll be here to tell you all of this myself, to make our memories, and maybe, in our way, to continue their story."
    m "我保证，等你醒过来之后，我依然会在这里，亲口把这些话再对你说一遍，一起创造我们的回忆，说不定，还可以用我们自己的方式续写空和海人的故事。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2697
translate chinese skystressrelief_cb50b516:

    # m "So please, [mc], find your way back to me, that's all I'm asking. I'll be waiting, no matter how long it takes."
    m "所以，[mc!t]，回来找我吧，这是我唯一的要求。不管要过多久，我都会等着你。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2698
translate chinese skystressrelief_448212fa:

    # m "Because without you... I..."
    m "因为如果没有你的话……我……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2699
translate chinese skystressrelief_d9ec549b:

    # m "*sobs* I... I can't do it..."
    m "*抽泣* 我……我是活不下去的……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2702
translate chinese skystressrelief_a227991e:

    # mc "... I told you not to cry, didn't I?"
    mc "……我跟你说过不要哭的吧？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2704
translate chinese skystressrelief_0a2b1874:

    # mc "... Hey..."
    mc "……嗨……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2705
translate chinese skystressrelief_3b3a387f:

    # m "*hics*"
    m "*抽泣*"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2706
translate chinese skystressrelief_92bd8dae:

    # mc "Mmh...!"
    mc "嗯……！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2707
translate chinese skystressrelief_85f9b5aa:

    # mc "Experiencing it myself, I know how much it hurts... So, no more tears, okay?"
    mc "我亲身体验过，知道有多疼……所以不准再流泪了，好吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2708
translate chinese skystressrelief_0710b814:

    # m "Okay..."
    m "好……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2709
translate chinese skystressrelief_a6f3ec07:

    # m "Wait, did you... did you hear everything I said?"
    m "等等，你……你都听见了？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2710
translate chinese skystressrelief_b886ef12:

    # mc "Yeah... everything, from the second you walked in... I was waiting for you, Moon..."
    mc "是啊……从你走进门的那一刻开始……我一直在等你，月……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2711
translate chinese skystressrelief_fee68152:

    # m "!!!!"
    m "！！！！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2712
translate chinese skystressrelief_02e481ab:

    # mc "*chuckles* There you go again, freezing up... It really does make things a bit awkward, you know...?"
    mc "*笑* 又来了，呆在原地一动不动的……这样会让气氛很尴尬的……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2713
translate chinese skystressrelief_3a3b9a76:

    # mc "But it's not just you... I heard everyone's messages..."
    mc "不过不只是你一个人……大家的话我都听到了……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2714
translate chinese skystressrelief_685ec8d7:

    # mc "I was conscious but couldn't move or even open my eyes..."
    mc "我一直都清醒着，只是没法控制身体，连眼睛都睁不开……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2715
translate chinese skystressrelief_2e4b66bf:

    # mc "Felt like I was floating in darkness... It was a weird experience..."
    mc "感觉就像飘在一片黑暗里一样……特别奇怪……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2716
translate chinese skystressrelief_725e26c4:

    # mc "I... I need to thank everyone for looking out for me..."
    mc "我……我得谢谢大家来看我……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2717
translate chinese skystressrelief_7240b854:

    # m "That time will come. For now, you should rest."
    m "之后再说吧。现在好好休息。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2718
translate chinese skystressrelief_bdab6f5b:

    # mc "I've been asleep for more than a week already..."
    mc "我都睡了一个多星期了……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2719
translate chinese skystressrelief_ea7138ea:

    # m "It doesn't matter, [mc]. Our bodies still function like those of normal people."
    m "那也不行，[mc!t]。我们的身体的运作方式还是跟普通人一样。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2720
translate chinese skystressrelief_c51aab91:

    # m "Not only that, but you also activated your serum in an unconventional way, using up almost everything you've got."
    m "不仅如此，你的血清还是用非常规的方式激活的，给你的身体造成了非常大的损伤。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2721
translate chinese skystressrelief_98e653f0:

    # m "Trust me, as long as you can't move properly, you should stay lying down."
    m "只要你还没办法正常活动，就乖乖躺着吧。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2722
translate chinese skystressrelief_cc36b250:

    # mc "Now that I think about it... So that's how it gets activated..."
    mc "你这么一说……原来，是用那种方式激活的啊……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2723
translate chinese skystressrelief_610e0247:

    # m "Now that we have a proof, I'm sure about it."
    m "没错，我们现在有证据支持了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2724
translate chinese skystressrelief_730cba99:

    # mc "Everything felt... normal. Like nothing changed, yet I knew I could do things I couldn't do before..."
    mc "我感觉一切都很……正常。没有什么变化，可是我很清楚我能做到我以前做不到的事了……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2725
translate chinese skystressrelief_8a7574bf:

    # m "That's how it is for all of us. But once it's activated, something does change within us, [mc]. I hope you're prepared for that."
    m "我们全都是这样子的。不过只要一激活，就的确会有变化的，[mc!t]。我希望你做足了准备。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2726
translate chinese skystressrelief_65c57b82:

    # mc "Just like how I felt nothing after killing that guy..."
    mc "比如说，我明明杀了那个人，却什么感觉都没有……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2727
translate chinese skystressrelief_d0add6a8_1:

    # m "Yes..."
    m "没错……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2728
translate chinese skystressrelief_0a395c27:

    # mc "For some reason, I don't feel any remorse."
    mc "不知道为什么，我丝毫没感到自责。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2729
translate chinese skystressrelief_49395af2:

    # m "Welcome to my world, Commander. A cruel place where everything fades into insignificance, except for what we truly hold dear."
    m "欢迎来到我的世界，指挥官。除了我们真正珍视的事物以外，其他的一切都会慢慢变得无关紧要。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2730
translate chinese skystressrelief_401c801b:

    # mc "*sighs* That's... a cool way to baptize me, alright..."
    mc "*叹气* 可真是个热烈的欢迎啊……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2731
translate chinese skystressrelief_dd1c7b60:

    # m "Just remember, we aren't immortal. We age and eventually die. Don't let get to your head, and you'll be fine."
    m "只要记住，我们也不是不会死就行了。我们一样会变老，最终死掉。只要别太得意忘形就不会有问题的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2732
translate chinese skystressrelief_03ecb5c8:

    # mc "Yeah, I understand... I'll take Lance's and Jess' warning seriously."
    mc "嗯，我明白……我会认真对待长矛和婕斯的警告的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2733
translate chinese skystressrelief_06871a16:

    # mc "But... just like that... it's all over..."
    mc "不过……这样一来……一切就都结束了……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2734
translate chinese skystressrelief_032e90a1:

    # m "You almost died, [mc]. It wasn't a \"just like that\" situation."
    m "你差点就死了，[mc!t]。哪能用一句“这样一来”就带过。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2735
translate chinese skystressrelief_e4761a80:

    # mc "Well... you're right... I know it was reckless of me, so I owe everyone an apology..."
    mc "嗯……你说得对……我的确太鲁莽了，应该向大家道歉……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2736
translate chinese skystressrelief_033af99d:

    # m "I'm going to call Jess and inform everyone about you."
    m "我去给婕斯打个电话，跟大家说你醒了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2738
translate chinese skystressrelief_2d873029:

    # mc "Hey... we'll talk later, okay?"
    mc "我们……之后再聊，好吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2739
translate chinese skystressrelief_0138d3af:

    # m "Mhm, I expect us to."
    m "嗯，我等着你。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2741
translate chinese skystressrelief_cb4bb921:

    # mc "Moon?"
    mc "月？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2742
translate chinese skystressrelief_5e714dad:

    # m "Yes, Commander?"
    m "怎么了，指挥官？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2743
translate chinese skystressrelief_bb0eeaf4_1:

    # mc "Thank you."
    mc "谢谢你。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2744
translate chinese skystressrelief_2b0346f4:

    # m "It's my duty."
    m "这是我的职责。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2750
translate chinese skystressrelief_3cc981d5:

    # "A week later..."
    "一个星期之后……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2757
translate chinese skystressrelief_7e16c49a:

    # shu "Dude, you ready? Our new home sweet home is waiting!"
    shu "哥们，准备好了没？我们甜蜜的新家在等着呢！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2758
translate chinese skystressrelief_a964ba30:

    # mc "New? What happened while I was out?"
    mc "新家？我不在的时候发生什么了？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2759
translate chinese skystressrelief_37166a73:

    # k "It might not be necessary anymore, but for extra security and peace of mind, Jess offered us their old place."
    k "可能也没这个必要了，但为了安全起见，图个安心，婕斯把他们的旧房子让给我们住了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2760
translate chinese skystressrelief_60e2db3c:

    # k "I've been there before. It's actually in a nice neighborhood. In fact, some of them are still living there."
    k "我以前去过那里。那一带还挺不错的。其实他们有人现在也还住在那边。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2761
translate chinese skystressrelief_f66e6da4:

    # mc "Oh, really?"
    mc "哦，真的啊？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2762
translate chinese skystressrelief_34a8c763:

    # a "And by a wild coincidence, one of your old friends lives there too."
    a "而且巧得很，你的一个老朋友也住在那。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2763
translate chinese skystressrelief_d5031d59:

    # mc "An old friend, huh? Other than Shu, I did have quite a few friends in college. I wonder who it could be."
    mc "老朋友？我在大学里除了修之外的确也还有几个朋友。会是谁呢？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2764
translate chinese skystressrelief_c34b299c:

    # shu "Someone you know pretty well, dude."
    shu "是个你很熟的人，兄弟。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2765
translate chinese skystressrelief_5231019d:

    # mc "... Please don't tell me it's Bite Size."
    mc "……可别跟我说是小矮子啊。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2766
translate chinese skystressrelief_49265b17:

    # shu "Yep!"
    shu "没错！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2767
translate chinese skystressrelief_5a41cef5:

    # mc "Ah, shit... here we go again..."
    mc "啊，操……又来了……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2768
translate chinese skystressrelief_11ce49e4:

    # mc "It's been a long time. How did you two take it?"
    mc "已经过了好久了。你们两个没问题吧？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2769
translate chinese skystressrelief_0750d145:

    # shu "Nah, I'm good. It was actually nice to see her again."
    shu "嗯，我没事。能再见到她也算是好事。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2770
translate chinese skystressrelief_9b705455:

    # shu "So, come on! I'll drive us there!"
    shu "走吧走吧！我开车！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2776
translate chinese skystressrelief_e89d151a:

    # mc "Isn't this..."
    mc "这不是……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2777
translate chinese skystressrelief_fae0fa4d:

    # mc "... Almost exactly like our old neighborhood?"
    mc "……跟我们之前的住处几乎一模一样吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2778
translate chinese skystressrelief_237e78ad:

    # shu "Exactly!"
    shu "对啊！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2779
translate chinese skystressrelief_9c215ac9:

    # mc "So, are we just going to leave our old place behind?"
    mc "所以旧房子就这么丢掉不管了？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2780
translate chinese skystressrelief_038cc82b:

    # mc "We have so many memories in that house. This feels so sudden."
    mc "我们在那个房子里有好多回忆。这也太突然了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2781
translate chinese skystressrelief_b7d68472:

    # k "With Naomi's help, all our things have been moved here. But that doesn't mean we can't visit our old home, sweetheart."
    k "娜奥米帮忙把我们的东西全给搬过来了。不过我们随时都可以回以前的家，宝贝。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2782
translate chinese skystressrelief_7d4a02b1:

    # k "That place will always hold a special place in our hearts."
    k "那个地方永远都会在我们的心里。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2784
translate chinese skystressrelief_e53e8240:

    # s "*crying* [mc]!"
    s "*哭泣* [mc!t]！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2785
translate chinese skystressrelief_44578325:

    # mc "Sky..."
    mc "斯凯……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2786
translate chinese skystressrelief_e68fc733:

    # mc "There, there. I'm here now."
    mc "好啦，好啦，我回来了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2787
translate chinese skystressrelief_6ebd1ab3:

    # s "You had us all worried, stupid!"
    s "你让我们都担心死了，笨蛋！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2788
translate chinese skystressrelief_daab972e:

    # mc "I know, that's why I owe everyone an apology."
    mc "我知道，所以我要给大家道歉。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2789
translate chinese skystressrelief_f5405f34:

    # g "Yes, it was risky, and we could've lost you, but you did what you thought was best with what you had, [mc]."
    g "没错，是很危险，你也有可能死掉，但你做出了你认为最好的选择，[mc!t]。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2790
translate chinese skystressrelief_d36113a6:

    # g "You had my full trust. You don't owe me an apology at all."
    g "我完全信任你。你根本不需要跟我道歉。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2791
translate chinese skystressrelief_2ff30664:

    # e "I agree with Gwen. I'm just glad to have you back. That's all that matters."
    e "格温说得对。你能回来就好。这是唯一重要的事。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2792
translate chinese skystressrelief_d292dde3:

    # mc "Thanks, guys."
    mc "谢谢，各位。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2794
translate chinese skystressrelief_3324954e:

    # a "Though, if there's someone who really deserves an apology, it's her."
    a "不过，如果你真要道歉的话，就去跟她说吧。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2795
translate chinese skystressrelief_609da479:

    # a "Even if it was her duty, she was the one who risked her life to get you out of there, not us."
    a "尽管这算是她的职责，但冒着生命危险去救你出来的人是她，不是我们。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2796
translate chinese skystressrelief_02a4bcb4:

    # f "*whispers* So... did you confess?"
    f "*低语* 你……表白了吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2797
translate chinese skystressrelief_29a4f6ab_6:

    # m "!!!"
    m "！！！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2798
translate chinese skystressrelief_2f9f088e:

    # a "Frey, what did I tell you?"
    a "芙蕾，我怎么跟你说的？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2799
translate chinese skystressrelief_2354d2dc:

    # f "Bummer..."
    f "没劲……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2800
translate chinese skystressrelief_c9fd0c2e:

    # mc "Give us some time. I know we have a lot to sort out about the aftermath, but right now, she's my priority."
