# game/ch1ep4.rpy:22
translate chinese ch1ep4_8333afe9:

    # f "It's from mom!"
    f "我妈！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:29
translate chinese ch1ep4_26610e80:

    # f "I woke up just before you left, then I saw the gift... I thought it was only a dress, but then..."
    f "你们走的时候我正好醒了，就看见了那份礼物……我以为里面只有衣服，结果……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:35
translate chinese ch1ep4_50de9df8:

    # mc "We need to discuss this immediately. Let's gather everyone, now."
    mc "我们得立马开个会。把大家都喊来。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:36
translate chinese ch1ep4_affee748:

    # mc "Wake everybody up and have them meet in the living room."
    mc "快让所有人都起床，在客厅集合。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:48
translate chinese ch1ep4_cb617675:

    # mc "But first, let's bring this to everyone's attention."
    mc "不过先把这件事告诉大家吧。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:61
translate chinese ch1ep4_69a1d310:

    # mc "Sorry, I know it's late. I hope I'm not bothering you too much."
    mc "抱歉，我知道很晚了，希望没有太打扰你们。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:64
translate chinese ch1ep4_33209669:

    # g "Don't worry about it, [mc]. This is a pressing matter; sleep can come later."
    g "没关系的，[mc!t]。事态紧急，睡觉当然可以等等。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:92
translate chinese ch1ep4_12245070:

    # h "{i}Now, on a less formal note..."
    h "{i}接下来，就到语气不用那么正式的部分……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:93
translate chinese ch1ep4_4717cbe0:

    # h "{i}About Jovian... I have some information that could be useful, but unfortunately nothing earth-shattering."
    h "{i}乔维安这边……我有一些可能有用的情报，然而没有什么重大进展。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:94
translate chinese ch1ep4_92116a8f:

    # h "{i}I believe I had mentioned that I conducted a search in hopes of finding him. The last solid lead I had was the old Winters' place, out of town."
    h "{i}我应该提到过，我组织过对他的搜寻，其中找到的最后一条有价值的线索指向城外的老温特斯家。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:97
translate chinese ch1ep4_ae109ce7:

    # h "{i}Someone among you knows exactly where it is."
    h "{i}你们之中有人很清楚那个地方在哪。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:98
translate chinese ch1ep4_fc8be5a3:

    # h "{i}After that, nothing: Jovian might as well have disappeared off the face of the earth. If you're clueless about his vanishing, I understand from firsthand experience."
    h "{i}除此之外就没有其他的了。他简直就像从地球上消失了一样。如果你们完全不知道该怎么找他，我也理解，毕竟我亲身体会过。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:101
translate chinese ch1ep4_9f6945a7:

    # h "{i}My hands were and are still tied. I don't have the reach or power to dig deeper."
    h "{i}从过去开始，我能做的事就不多，现在依然如此。我没有足够的能力深入调查。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:102
translate chinese ch1ep4_e4defda2:

    # h "{i}Bonheur has taken a significant portion of the Mafia's power and resources. He has more pull than I do."
    h "{i}博纳尔已经抢走了黑手党内大部分的权力和资源。他说话比我更有分量。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:103
translate chinese ch1ep4_e1d6deee:

    # h "{i}What he's planning with that kind of power, I can't say. But him having control over part of the Mafia means trouble for me. For everyone entangled in this mess."
    h "{i}他想用这些权力做什么，我不知道。但让他掌控大半黑手党对我来说就是麻烦。对被牵扯进这桩破事的所有人来说都是一样。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:106
translate chinese ch1ep4_a99b9b30:

    # h "{i}Lastly, I'd like to request something big of you, Aine. I know it might be too much."
    h "{i}最后，我对你有个很大的请求，艾妮。我知道这事可能会很过分。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:107
translate chinese ch1ep4_7e5d4c02:

    # h "{i}I'm hoping you'll consider taking my place in the Mafia as soon as possible."
    h "{i}我希望你能考虑一下，尽快接替我在黑手党里的位置。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:108
translate chinese ch1ep4_2a1a3b10:

    # h "{i}Not to keep things the same, but to change them for the better."
    h "{i}不是为了保持原样，而是为了做出改变。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:109
translate chinese ch1ep4_7cb1de20:

    # h "{i}You may not know, but there are people in the group that are looking to build a brighter future. Those people need someone to hold them together."
    h "{i}你可能不知道，组织里还是有人盼望着光明的未来。那些人需要一个能把他们凝聚在一起的领袖。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:110
translate chinese ch1ep4_11b919cf:

    # h "{i}Use this to your advantage, or whatever you decide. It's all up to you two; I will not stop you."
    h "{i}就用这一点给你们创造优势。或者随你们两个的意，怎样都行。我不会碍你们的事。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:115
translate chinese ch1ep4_9a6ef312:

    # h "{i}Yes, I know what you have been planning. Jess is watching over you and I was informed before writing this letter."
    h "{i}我知道你们在计划什么。婕斯在盯着你们，她在我写这封信之前就已经全告诉我了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:116
translate chinese ch1ep4_4cb87c51:

    # h "{i}[mc] has shown he's strong enough for this. With the two of you, I believe you can make things better."
    h "{i}[mc!t]的表现已经证明他足够坚强。有你们两个在，我相信你们能让情况变得更好。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:117
translate chinese ch1ep4_aca36c76:

    # h "{i}I've been a thorn in your sides for too long. So, on [mc]'s advice, I'm stepping back. This way, you can move forward without me in the way."
    h "{i}我已经让你们烦心太久了。所以，应[mc!t]的建议，我不再插手。这样你们就能在没有我的情况下大步前进。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:119
translate chinese ch1ep4_1d733a48:

    # h "{i}Use what I've left behind to create something new. It's your stage now, not mine."
    h "{i}用我留下的东西开创全新的未来吧。现在是你们的回合了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:122
translate chinese ch1ep4_85986443:

    # h "{i}To my daughters, you mean everything to me. Despite all the messiness of these past few years, my love for you has never changed."
    h "{i}我的两个女儿，你们是我的一切。尽管这些年来发生过各种各样的事，我对你们的爱丝毫没有改变。"# TODO: Translation updated at 2024-06-01 19:22

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:143
translate chinese ch1ep4_a81ce81d:

    # m "{i}Why does it have to be always like this...?"
    m "{i}为什么总是会这样……？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:153
translate chinese ch1ep4_2c7ccc41:

    # un "{size=-15}Four!"
    un "{size=-15}四号！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:156
translate chinese ch1ep4_f1a3a49a:

    # un "{size=-9}Four! You alright there, buddy?!"
    un "{size=-9}四号！你没事吧？！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:161
translate chinese ch1ep4_c3407d10:

    # un "Are you alright?!"
    un "你没事吧？！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:173
translate chinese ch1ep4_2b692ff5:

    # si "Fuck, they really brought the calvary down on us this time. That RPG would've taken us out if it weren't for your reflexes, Five."
    si "操，他们真是倾巢出动了！要不是五号你反应快，那发RPG就把我们全轰上天了！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:178
translate chinese ch1ep4_2c64f0aa:

    # si "Eight! Targets, 3 o'clock! They're trying to flank us!"
    si "八号！三点钟方向有敌人！他们想包抄我们！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:185
translate chinese ch1ep4_756b32fa:

    # si "Five, bring yourself here! We need support, NOW!"
    si "五号，赶紧过来！我们需要支援！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:192
translate chinese ch1ep4_bfc03b52:

    # fi "Listen, we won't be able to hold them off forever. I need you to call for an evac first while we return fire. Give them our coordinates."
    fi "听着，我们不可能一直挡住他们的，你趁我们还能守住，快去请求撤离。把我们的坐标告诉他们。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:201
translate chinese ch1ep4_d453520d:

    # fi "Don't lose it again, will you? Our guns will never be able to replace it."
    fi "可别再给弄丢了啊。我们的枪可是替代不了它的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:202
translate chinese ch1ep4_d979afbb:

    # m "Sorry."
    m "谢谢。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:205
translate chinese ch1ep4_059090ff:

    # fi "*nods*"
    fi "*点头*"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:218
translate chinese ch1ep4_8209693f:

    # m "Command, this is Replace Element, callsign Four, how do you copy? Over."
    m "总部，这里是“数列”小队，我是四号，收到请回答，完毕。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:220
translate chinese ch1ep4_bd8e5c4c:

    # comms "Four, this is HQ, comms are five by five. Report status. Over."
    comms "四号，这里是总部，通讯良好。汇报情况，完毕。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:222
translate chinese ch1ep4_6583a5c5:

    # m "Encountering heavy enemy resistance, surprise assault compromizing our perimeter. Risk of encirclement imminent, over."
    m "遭遇敌人强烈抵抗，防线快被敌人的偷袭攻破。有被包围的风险，完毕。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:224
translate chinese ch1ep4_512671d7:

    # m "Requesting immediate extraction to avoid entrapment. Awaiting instructions. Over."
    m "请求立即撤离，避免被围攻。等待命令，完毕。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:226
translate chinese ch1ep4_bc72c99a:

    # comms "... Running request to command, hold the line. Over."
    comms "……正在报告上级，不要挂断。完毕。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:239
translate chinese ch1ep4_5af9c491:

    # comms "Four, this is HQ. Are you still there? Over."
    comms "四号，这里是总部。还能收到吗？完毕。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:243
translate chinese ch1ep4_574790d9:

    # m "Solid copy, still here. Was request for exfil granted? Over."
    m "非常清楚，我们还在。撤离请求批准了吗？完毕。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:245
translate chinese ch1ep4_dd756616:

    # comms "... Confirm completion of primary directives? Over."
    comms "……确认主要目标已完成了吗？完毕。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:247
translate chinese ch1ep4_0ca446bc:

    # m "Affirmative, HQ. HVT neutralized, sensitive materials destroyed. Over."
    m "确认，总部。高价值目标已消灭，敏感资料已销毁，完毕。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:249
translate chinese ch1ep4_21394f87:

    # comms "Excellent. Request for exfil granted, relay your current grid. Over."
    comms "很好。批准撤离，汇报当前坐标，完毕。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:261
translate chinese ch1ep4_9abbf9f3:

    # eg "Took you long enough. What did command say?"
    eg "终于回来了，总部怎么说？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:263
translate chinese ch1ep4_d0f5a4e6:

    # m "They asked us if we completed the mission, then agreed to extract us. Helo will be here in 5."
    m "先是问了任务完成了没有，然后同意让我们撤离了。直升机五分钟就到。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:264
translate chinese ch1ep4_78eb4d54:

    # si "Typical. If we hadn't, then they would have left us to rot. I'm sure of it."
    si "真经典。如果任务没完成，我们的尸体肯定就要烂在这个地方了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:269
translate chinese ch1ep4_96dd44ca:

    # fi "Does it really matter now, Six? What matters is that we did it and we are all getting out of here in 5 minutes. We just need to hold on a bit longer."
    fi "现在这些还重要吗，六号？重要的是我们完成了任务，5分钟之后就可以一起离开了。我们只要再坚持一小会儿就行。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:271
translate chinese ch1ep4_ef54fd74:

    # eg "You Odd Numbers are always so optimistic, so forgiving. If you weren't, Seven would still be here."
    eg "你们奇数真是一直这么乐观，这么大度。七号就是这么死的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:278
translate chinese ch1ep4_9a5ae2e0:

    # fi "Everyone, focus! We are all going home together, you hear me?"
    fi "大家都集中精神！我们一起回家，听见没有？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:279
translate chinese ch1ep4_a1da1e2e:

    # eg "Far easier said than done, man! But I ain't ready to die here! Let's do it!"
    eg "说得轻巧，哥们！不过我也不想死在这！干就完了！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:280
translate chinese ch1ep4_c3538176:

    # fi "That's more like it."
    fi "这才像话。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:285
translate chinese ch1ep4_d078f422:

    # fi "Four, while you were gone, some hostiles managed to sneak around on our right flank. They're probably going through the ruined buildings to surprise us."
    fi "四号，你晕过去的时候，有几个敌人偷偷绕到了我们的右翼。他们可能想穿过那边的废墟，给我们来个惊喜。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:288
translate chinese ch1ep4_6d8cdbd5:

    # si "Atta girl. Don't be late, though!"
    si "真是我的好姑娘，不过你可别迟到！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:298
translate chinese ch1ep4_740244f6:

    # sol1 "Gunshots are getting louder. We are getting close. Those insects won't even know what hit 'em."
    sol1 "枪声越来越响了。我们离得很近了。那些害虫待会肯定连怎么死的都不知道。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:301
translate chinese ch1ep4_60b4d7fa:

    # sol2 "I don't know man, I have a bad feeling about this. It's only four of them but they still managed to take out dozens of us."
    sol2 "不好说啊，兄弟。我有不好的预感。他们才四个人，却干掉了我们几十个人。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:307
translate chinese ch1ep4_daa90ddf:

    # sol1 "Exactly why we'll make sure those whores pay for what they did."
    sol1 "所以我们才要让那群臭婊子付出代价。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:310
translate chinese ch1ep4_360837a0:

    # sol2 "Hehe, dibs on the least blown-up one."
    sol2 "嘿嘿，完事之后，尸体最完整的小妞归我。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:311
translate chinese ch1ep4_6e76672e:

    # sol2 "What about you, Ray?"
    sol2 "你呢，雷？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:317
translate chinese ch1ep4_38b77a90:

    # sol1 "Shit! It's one of th-"
    sol1 "操！那不是——"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:352
translate chinese ch1ep4_c19c3cd9:

    # eg "Perfect timing. Give us a hand, Four!"
    eg "来得正好。快来帮忙，四号！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:363
translate chinese ch1ep4_4539c657:

    # si "Flash out!"
    si "闪光弹！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:411
translate chinese ch1ep4_acdcbb61:

    # pil "To Replace Element, this is Silverbird 1. We have arrived."
    pil "“数列”小队，这里是银鸟一号，我们到了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:412
translate chinese ch1ep4_f066f669:

    # pil "LZ is hot, I repeat LZ is hot. Get in immediately!"
    pil "降落区有敌人，重复，降落区有敌人。赶快过来！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:413
translate chinese ch1ep4_cfc1e04c:

    # pil "We're leaving in 1 mike. Out."
    pil "我们1分钟之后就走。完毕。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:425
translate chinese ch1ep4_fca4be85:

    # sol4 "FOR MOTHER SHA CREA!!!"
    sol4 "{b}为了祖国沙克雷亚！！！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:455
translate chinese ch1ep4_f44c1b1e:

    # si "NO!! FIVE!!"
    si "{b}不！！五号！！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:462
translate chinese ch1ep4_ae265fb7:

    # eg "SHIT! MORE SOLDIERS COMING!"
    eg "妈的！又来人了！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:463
translate chinese ch1ep4_44b66b3f:

    # eg "Four! Grab Five and get to the chopper already!"
    eg "四号！快带着五号上直升机！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:464
translate chinese ch1ep4_115bbbf8:

    # m "O-okay!"
    m "好-好的！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:467
translate chinese ch1ep4_a94f9141:

    # m "It's gonna be okay, Five! We're almost there, just... a little further!"
    m "不会有事的，五号！最后一段路了，稍微……再坚持一下！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:474
translate chinese ch1ep4_1414f43b:

    # eg "We're all here! Go, go, go!"
    eg "我们都上来了！快走，快走，快走！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:484
translate chinese ch1ep4_15b9c01a:

    # pil "All elements on board. Silverbird 1 departing. RTB."
    pil "所有队员已登机。银鸟一号起飞。返回基地。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:487
translate chinese ch1ep4_71098e7b:

    # si "Five, you hear that? Everything's gonna be okay-we're going home!"
    si "五号，你听到了吗？已经没事了，我们要回家了！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:497
translate chinese ch1ep4_cbac6ef7:

    # si "No, no, no! Don't you dare, Five! You can't leave us like that!"
    si "不，不，不！你不准死，五号！你不能就这样离开我们！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:498
translate chinese ch1ep4_229ae69d:

    # si "You can't leave me!"
    si "你不能离开我！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:501
translate chinese ch1ep4_c856e9e5:

    # si "Hng! Hng! Hng! Come on, Five!"
    si "*做心肺复苏* 挺住啊，五号！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:507
translate chinese ch1ep4_20c06637:

    # eg "*shaking her head*"
    eg "*摇头*"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:511
translate chinese ch1ep4_32734d02:

    # si "NO! He's gonna be okay, you'll see!"
    si "胡说！他没事的，你等着瞧吧！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:514
translate chinese ch1ep4_d0de2777:

    # eg "Six! He's dead! Your cries will not bring him back! It's over!"
    eg "六号！他死了！你再哭也不会活过来！死了！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:515
translate chinese ch1ep4_5546e308:

    # eg "We prepared ourselves for moments like this! You need to accept it! You need to accept it NOW!"
    eg "我们早就为这一刻做过准备！你必须接受！{b}现在{/b}就接受！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:518
translate chinese ch1ep4_85b1ce83:

    # si "*hics* He said... we would all go home together, Eight...! He said it...!"
    si "*抽泣* 他说过……我们会一起回家的，八号……！他说了……！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:521
translate chinese ch1ep4_945121b2:

    # eg "I know that, Six. But it was either you or him. He made his choice, so don't waste it."
    eg "我知道，六号。但是如果不是他死，就是你死。他做出了他的选择，不要辜负他。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:539
translate chinese ch1ep4_684db974:

    # un "{size=-10}Moon."
    un "{size=-10}月。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:546
translate chinese ch1ep4_463c27f0:

    # mc "Everything alright? You zoned out there for a bit."
    mc "你没事吧？你发呆发了好久。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:547
translate chinese ch1ep4_312f62ba:

    # m "Ah, yeah, I'm fine. Just lost in thought for a moment."
    m "啊，嗯，没事。就是在想别的事情。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:551
translate chinese ch1ep4_c96e1761:

    # a "Hold up, are you two coordinating this somehow?"
    a "等一下，你们两个难道一直有在互相通气吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:553
translate chinese ch1ep4_ee9e4754:

    # mc "Well, with the lack of direct communication, Hera's silence was a giveaway. It hinted she was concealing something crucial: something she couldn't share."
    mc "嗯，我们之间没有直接交流，所以赫拉的沉默就成了线索。这代表她在隐瞒很重要的事，一件她不能告诉别人的事。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:556
translate chinese ch1ep4_3b85734a:

    # mc "Raiding her safe house? If I wanted revenge, I would've had bigger aspirations than that."
    mc "去她的安全屋里闹一场算得上什么？我真想报仇的话，就不会只是那样了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:557
translate chinese ch1ep4_98e56ba1:

    # mc "I'm checking off this part of our plan. With her backed into a corner, I knew she'd eventually spill the beans."
    mc "我们的计划的这一部分就算完成了。只要把她逼到墙角，我就知道她总有一天会说实话。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:562
translate chinese ch1ep4_c8eae956:

    # a "Having her power cut doesn't make her totally powerless. She could have done so much more..."
    a "她的权力只是被削弱了，并非完全无能为力。她本可以做到更多事的……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:573
translate chinese ch1ep4_23bfb92b:

    # mc "More prepared than ever. Nothing but to push forward and track down my [landlord], for real this time."
    mc "完全准备好了。一定要大举前进，这次必须找到我[landlord!t]。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:579
translate chinese ch1ep4_c6ad62bc:

    # mc "Given your connections, you should reach out to Jess. Ask her to arrange someone to watch over everyone here. Do it now if you can."
    mc "正好你可以联系上婕斯。请让她安排人来照料留下来的人。要是可以的话现在就联系她。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:580
translate chinese ch1ep4_57c7d2de:

    # shu "You got it, boss! I'll be back in a bit."
    shu "明白，老大！我马上就回来。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:591
translate chinese ch1ep4_04a7705e:

    # e "Thankfully, this case has been open for a while already. If I have the information I need, I can have the warrant authorized by tomorrow."
    e "好消息是这个案子立案的时间不短了。只要有所有必要的信息，明天就能拿到搜查令。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:597
translate chinese ch1ep4_1d1aee31:

    # k "Needless to say, I'm the only one who knows where that place Hera mentioned is."
    k "更不用说，只有我一个人知道赫拉提到的那个地方在哪。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:600
translate chinese ch1ep4_2259ef15:

    # k "You asked me to lay low, but when it comes to Jovian, I can't sit idly. If he's out there, I want first dibs to acquaint my palm with his face."
    k "你说要让我保持低调，可是对于和乔维安有关的事，我没法袖手旁观。如果他真在那里，我要第一个给他一耳光。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:611
translate chinese ch1ep4_313c5580:

    # mc "Gwen, Aine, I'll leave you in charge of everything and everyone else for the time being."
    mc "格温，艾妮，其他的事和剩下的人就暂时全权交给你们负责了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:626
translate chinese ch1ep4_a2f85546:

    # mc "... Yeah, you're right. It's a lot to process for all of us."
    mc "……是啊，你说得对。我们都需要时间好好思考。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:655
translate chinese ch1ep4_8f20e46a:

    # mc "So many questions, and the answers are within my reach. I can't stop thinking."
    mc "我们有那么多问题，答案现在近在咫尺。我就是会忍不住去想。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:680
translate chinese ch1ep4_68ffff1f:

    # mc "I appreciate that, Sky. But it's really nothing to worry about."
    mc "谢谢你，斯凯，但是真的不用担心的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:720
translate chinese skystressrelief_27e3e50a:

    # s "[mc], I wouldn't have suggested it if I didn't want it too. Trust me, it would be mutually beneficial for both of us."
    s "[mc!t]，我如果不想的话就不会主动来找你了。这对我们两个都好，相信我。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:742
translate chinese skystressrelief_0000861a:

    # "You kiss her deeply: your way of apologizing for neglecting her for so long."
    "你深深地吻着她，这是你对忽视了她太久的补偿。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:751
translate chinese skystressrelief_b52e4e13:

    # "You trace your hands along her body, starting from the curves of her bosom and down her sides, before resting them on her plump butt."
    "你的手在她身上游走，从胸前的曲线开始，最后停在挺拔的臀部上。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:772
translate chinese skystressrelief_ae92f292:

    # "Maybe it shouldn't be the case, but hearing those words makes your dick even hungrier to \"relieve your stress\" with Sky."
    "听到这番话让你更加急不可耐地想让斯凯帮你“释放压力”，尽管可能并不该如此。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:792
translate chinese skystressrelief_0da3e6a2:

    # s "I didn't stutter, [mc]. All that working out should mean that it won't be too difficult for a big, strong man like you to hold little old me up, right?"
    s "你没听错，[mc!t]。你这么高大、强壮，还经常锻炼，应该能轻松地把小小的我抱起来吧？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:796
translate chinese skystressrelief_6b53c427:

    # s "And I read that this position lets you reach deeper, so I figured it was worth a try."
    s "我查到这个姿势能让你插得更深，就觉得值得一试。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:798
translate chinese skystressrelief_e4591d5a:

    # s "Hey, guys aren't the only ones who are curious about sex! Besides, I had to do something to relieve the stress that grading all those exams brought on..."
    s "喂，又不是只有男人对做爱好奇！再说了，改那么多卷子让我压力很大，我总得发泄一下……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:809
translate chinese skystressrelief_a4194f45:

    # mc "I want the stress relief."
    mc "我当然是想释放压力。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:884
translate chinese skystressrelief_203f457d:

    # "Sky puts her hand on your shoulder, bracing herself as she lowers her legs back onto the ground."
    "斯凯把手放在你的肩膀上，慢慢把腿放回地上。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:886
translate chinese skystressrelief_35bdcc5d:

    # "She grimaces slightly, still holding your shoulder as she tries to regain her balance."
    "她稍微做了个鬼脸，依旧扶着你的肩膀，尝试找到平衡。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:929
translate chinese skystressrelief_e7066c79:

    # yt "Yeah, no, abort! Abort!"
    yt "哎呦我的妈呀！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:934
translate chinese skystressrelief_47bc7013:

    # mc "[landlady]'s coming up the stairs! Get dressed, quick!"
    mc "[landlady!t]上楼了！快穿衣服！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:941
translate chinese skystressrelief_ea87a2f4:

    # k "Oh... I guess Sky went to comfort him. What was all that thudding I heard, then?"
    k "噢……看来是斯凯过来安慰他了。那我听到咚咚咚的声音又是怎么回事呢？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:950
translate chinese skystressrelief_3eea63c0:

    # yt "It's not just about Sky: I've been fucking every single woman in this house!"
    yt "不光是斯凯的事，我跟这个房子里的所有女人都上过床啊！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:955
translate chinese skystressrelief_adfd1823:

    # yt "Huh?! You deranged asshole, don't even think about it!"
    yt "啊？！你他妈的畜生，这种事你想都不要想！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:960
translate chinese skystressrelief_33ccf49e:

    # s "Oh... well, it's okay, I understand."
    s "噢……好吧，没事的，我理解。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:981
translate chinese skystressrelief_481183da:

    # y "... Are you sure?"
    y "……你确定吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:982
translate chinese skystressrelief_cfa3b98a:

    # nic "Well, yeah. Pantyhose with sneakers aren't my taste, but that looks good on you."
    nic "是啊。丝袜配帆布鞋不是我的菜，但你穿起来挺好看的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1005
translate chinese skystressrelief_2aa1f908:

    # mc "Got it, no problem at all. I was just a bit surprised is all."
    mc "好的，没问题。我就是有点惊讶。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1006
translate chinese skystressrelief_ac04d686:

    # mc "So, you're here to look after everyone while we're away?"
    mc "所以我们不在的时候，就是你们来照顾其他人吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1007
translate chinese skystressrelief_0f90ae09:

    # nic "Exactly, Jess sent us. I'm part of the Intelligence Department, and Yuna here is one of our best mercenaries."
    nic "没错，婕斯派我们来的。我是情报部门的人，而由奈是我们最强的佣兵之一。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1015
translate chinese skystressrelief_d22161f1:

    # yt "Treat them like just anybody else? How can I do that if I feel like they could slit my throat at any moment?"
    yt "把她们当做普通人对待？我觉得她们随时都可能割开我的喉咙，这怎么可能做得到啊？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1018
translate chinese skystressrelief_b08d3d66:

    # yt "I can ignore the one with the hatchet and short sword, but this silver-haired woman..."
    yt "要我无视那个带着斧子和短刀的女人，我能做到，但是这个银发女人……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1019
translate chinese skystressrelief_ce478454:

    # yt "For someone hiding her identity, that introduction was intentional... An intimidation display, or so they say."
    yt "她明明想隐藏身份，却在自我介绍时故意透露她的姓氏……显然是想给我个下马威。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1020
translate chinese skystressrelief_948edc5e:

    # yt "I know we've been looking at each other all this time, but her gaze has always been below mine..."
    yt "我们一直在对视，可她的视线却总是处于我的视线下方……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1021
translate chinese skystressrelief_ee2afae5:

    # yt "Do people around her notice this at all? Such intense pressure..."
    yt "她身边的人会注意到这些吗？如此巨大的压力……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1047
translate chinese skystressrelief_aa6a9d34:

    # nic "Oh?"
    nic "噢？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1071
translate chinese skystressrelief_f15a7826:

    # mc "They're going to keep an eye on things while we're gone."
    mc "我们出发之后，她们负责安保。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1097
translate chinese skystressrelief_b7481b70:

    # nic "Feel free to if that happens. But trust us, it won't come to that."
    nic "如果真是那样，欢迎你动手。但相信我们吧，绝对不可能的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1100
translate chinese skystressrelief_56360aea:

    # nic "If anything... who do you take us for, Ha-Jeong Lee?"
    nic "倒是你……你把我们当什么人了，李赫贞？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1101
translate chinese skystressrelief_ff8e4b04:

    # m "Your blood doesn't scare me, Fitzcharles. You're just a weak and sane version of Owl."
    m "你的血脉吓不到我，菲兹查尔斯。你只是个又弱又神智正常版本的枭而已。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1104
translate chinese skystressrelief_8409baea:

    # nic "Am I not that intimidating anymore? Have I lost my edge?"
    nic "我已经吓不到别人了吗？我的霸气已经消失了？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1105
translate chinese skystressrelief_1c7523bc:

    # y "... I don't know, I just got here."
    y "……我不知道，别问我。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1120
translate chinese skystressrelief_34b43908:

    # mc "So, what's with the outfit?"
    mc "你这身衣服是什么情况？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1127
translate chinese skystressrelief_5dd7f500:

    # mc "And what's been stopping you lately?"
    mc "那你平常怎么不这么穿呢？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1130
translate chinese skystressrelief_48c27bb1:

    # k "Aside from acting like my age, I feel like I should present myself in a certain way, as someone respectable in everyone's eyes."
    k "我年纪大了，总不能继续乱来。而且，我觉得我的形象有必要让每个人都能理解、尊重。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1149
translate chinese skystressrelief_9645f32b:

    # e "She's fine, but she knocked out ten minutes after we hit the road."
    e "没事，不过刚上路十分钟她就睡着了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1157
translate chinese skystressrelief_4c695f02:

    # e "No, it's not that. She's just unpredictable in ways that I can't understand."
    e "不，不是那样的。只是她的行动难以预测，我理解不了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1158
translate chinese skystressrelief_4be545c6:

    # e "Not only her actions, but especially with the way she talks and address matters."
    e "不只是她的行为，还有她说话、做事的方式。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1159
translate chinese skystressrelief_078b68c7:

    # e "It feels like she's incomplete as a person, but at the same time, she's whole, more than any other person I've met."
    e "我感觉她这个人并不完整，但同时，却又比我见过的任何人都更完整。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1160
translate chinese skystressrelief_78e36df6:

    # e "... I don't get it, I can't read her, and it bothers me."
    e "……我不明白，我读不懂她，这让我很心烦。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1169
translate chinese skystressrelief_588f21b8:

    # mc "Imagine you're walking on a straight path, eyes wide open. Then suddenly, you're walking with your eyes shut."
    mc "就好像你正走在一条笔直的路上，眼睛睁得很大。然后突然，你就变成闭着眼睛在走了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1171
translate chinese skystressrelief_16f5ba2b:

    # mc "Just go with it for a second. What would you do? How would you feel?"
    mc "你就先配合一下。这种情况下，你们会做什么？会有什么感觉？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1175
translate chinese skystressrelief_8f4fbf21:

    # mc "What if now, you can open your eyes?"
    mc "那假如现在，又可以把眼睛睁开了呢？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1177
translate chinese skystressrelief_e4f343ae:

    # mc "Exactly my point."
    mc "我说的就是这种感觉。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1178
translate chinese skystressrelief_16ccc7a6:

    # mc "You know you've been living your whole life, all well and all things considered. But then, a huge part of you opened up, something you didn't know existed."
    mc "你心里清楚你这一生都过得很好，一切都考虑周到了。但突然，你就感受到了一种前所未有的缺失感。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1179
translate chinese skystressrelief_e7c35251:

    # mc "That's the kind of unsettling feeling I get around her."
    mc "我在她身边的时候就是会有这种不安的感觉。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1185
translate chinese skystressrelief_246045ea:

    # k "Maybe it's not something to puzzle over, but to be grateful for. It might be exactly what you both need."
    k "或许这事不是需要破解的谜团，而是值得感恩的赐福也说不定。可能正好是你们两个需要的东西。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1197
translate chinese skystressrelief_b45890b8:

    # k "Jovian and I lived there briefly before we settled in Golden City. It's owned by the Winters, a married couple."
    k "我和乔维安在金城定居之前，在这里短暂地住过一段时间。房东是一对夫妻，温特斯夫妇。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1198
translate chinese skystressrelief_4ebecec4:

    # k "They'd better remember me. I've been there a couple of times, and got denied every single time."
    k "他们最好是还记得我。我以前去过那里好几次，每次都被拒之门外。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1199
translate chinese skystressrelief_870902fe:

    # k "Now, it makes sense they're hiding something from me."
    k "现在就说得通了，他们是有事瞒着我。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1202
translate chinese skystressrelief_843b5a43:

    # mc "Point us in the right direction, then."
    mc "那就给我们指路吧。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1203
translate chinese skystressrelief_4a039492:

    # k "It's still a few hours' drive from here. Are you sure you want to keep on the wheels?"
    k "离这里还有几个小时车程。你确定要继续开车吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1235
translate chinese skystressrelief_7c8bf141:

    # ew "*laughs* Oh, Klara? Y-yes, it has been a while!"
    ew "*大笑* 噢，克拉拉？是-是啊，的确是好久不见了！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1244
translate chinese skystressrelief_2e1f60b2:

    # e "I have a search warrant authorized by the court to search your house."
    e "我有法庭下发的搜查令，有权搜查你家。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1247
translate chinese skystressrelief_5bbaa483:

    # e "Here's the paperwork."
    e "这是文件。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1259
translate chinese skystressrelief_71f21969:

    # m "Shotgun. A military hand sign? How does she..."
    m "霰弹枪。这是军队里用的手势。她怎么会……？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1268
translate chinese skystressrelief_d6bb1fef:

    # mc "Em!"
    mc "小艾！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1300
translate chinese skystressrelief_b3747ffa:

    # e "You move, I shoot. Up to you."
    e "你敢动，我就开枪。你自己选吧。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1306
translate chinese skystressrelief_ffb58e03:

    # mc "W...well... that's one way to say \"welcome\"..."
    mc "呃……这……可真是热烈欢迎啊……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1313
translate chinese skystressrelief_e3eea777:

    # k "We came in peace, Eudora. But it seems that sentiment isn't mutual after what your husband did."
    k "我们本无意争斗，尤多拉。但看来你和你丈夫并不这么想啊。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1324
translate chinese skystressrelief_fba3d938:

    # tw "Don't tell them anything, Love! We promised him!" with hpunch
    tw "什么也不要说，亲爱的！我们向他保证过的！" with hpunch

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1354
translate chinese skystressrelief_96c98402:

    # ew "I understand your concerns, but my husband's actions were solely in our defense."
    ew "我理解你的担忧，但我丈夫只是想保护我们。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1355
translate chinese skystressrelief_1144bb4c:

    # mc "To defend you from what? He was the one who made things worse, not us."
    mc "保护？保护什么？是他让情况变糟了，又不是我们。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1370
translate chinese skystressrelief_4a622fc6:

    # e "Open this."
    e "给我打开。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1371
translate chinese skystressrelief_25b3853f:

    # ew "Good instincts, Detective. But you don't have to tell me."
    ew "猜得真准，警官。但你不用说我也会照做的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1379
translate chinese skystressrelief_5df04518:

    # mc "Yeah, something's seemed off since we got here. Glad it's not just me feeling it."
    mc "是啊，从我们来开始，就有东西不对劲。还好不是只有我一个人这么想。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1389
translate chinese skystressrelief_d9a08b6e:

    # k "[mc], would you please?"
    k "[mc!t]，能拜托你吗……？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1406
translate chinese skystressrelief_819d2633:

    # k "... You go ahead. I'll still be able to hear it from here."
    k "……你放就是了。我还是能听见的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1426
translate chinese skystressrelief_9911677c:

    # k "Ah, [mc]! Why do you keep trying to get out of your stroller?!"
    k "啊，[mc!t]！你怎么就是不愿意乖乖待在婴儿车里啊？！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1437
translate chinese skystressrelief_7cdc913d:

    # k "That was a few months after you came into our lives."
    k "那是你出生之后几个星期的事。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1438
translate chinese skystressrelief_85d09787:

    # k "Jovian finally got his camcorder and started recording. Well, at least he tried to."
    k "乔维安终于有了摄像机，开始录像了。至少是学着开始录了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1444
translate chinese skystressrelief_40900ed5:

    # jov "Wha-ohh, woops..."
    jov "啊啊，开始录了……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1454
translate chinese skystressrelief_6ec47d4d:

    # k "Sky needs you, and I need help in the kitchen, too!"
    k "斯凯需要你照顾，我在厨房里也需要人帮忙！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1470
translate chinese skystressrelief_187177b0:

    # jov "Their laughter, their games is full of love."
    jov "他们的笑声，他们的游戏，都充满了爱意。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1482
translate chinese skystressrelief_3b2eb653:

    # jov "This entry's hard... [mc]'s been feeling sick... a lot..."
    jov "今天的视频有点难受……[mc!t]病了……病得很重……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1489
translate chinese skystressrelief_144a0807:

    # jov "It's hard seeing him try to keep up with Sky but get tired so quickly..."
    jov "看到他努力想跟上斯凯，却很快就累了，我心里非常难受……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1501
translate chinese skystressrelief_c1af0eb8:

    # jov "Everything has been nonstop, but we're most worried about [mc]'s health."
    jov "事情一直忙个不停，但我们最担心的还是[mc!t]的身体。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1519
translate chinese skystressrelief_202ad40c:

    # jov "His energy is now constantly drained from fighting the disease."
    jov "他现在的力气全都拿来跟病魔战斗了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1520
translate chinese skystressrelief_58eafeeb:

    # jov "He has been such a brave little soldier, but you can clearly see the toll that his fight has taken on him."
    jov "他一直都是个勇敢的小战士，但一眼就能看出来，他的战斗给他带来了多大的负担。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1523
translate chinese skystressrelief_3d6362ad:

    # jov "On all of us, to be honest."
    jov "说实话，给我们每个人都带来了很大的负担。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1524
translate chinese skystressrelief_b153145e:

    # jov "Sky tries to help in her own sweet way, comforting [mc] by using her little hands to stroke her [roommate2]'s back."
    jov "斯凯一直都在用她可爱的方式帮忙，用她的小手摸她[roommate2!t]的背，安慰[mc!t]。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1538
translate chinese skystressrelief_4b1c28bd:

    # mc "{i}Unconventional territories{/i}...? What are you getting into?"
    mc "{i}不寻常的领域{/i}……？你要做什么？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1547
translate chinese skystressrelief_f17bc409:

    # jov "Entry for April 9th, XXXX. Seeing [mc] struggle to sleep tonight hit me hard."
    jov "这是XXXX年4月9日的记录。今晚，看到[mc!t]怎么也睡不着，我心如刀割。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1550
translate chinese skystressrelief_1ad9c8e2:

    # jov "This isn't just fighting an illness anymore; it's a fight for our future. For [mc]'s future."
    jov "这已经不止是在抗争病魔了；这是为了我们的未来，为了[mc!t]的未来而战。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1551
translate chinese skystressrelief_1630cafe:

    # jov "I'm ready to do anything, even make a deal with the devil himself, if it means giving him a chance."
    jov "只要能救他，我什么都可以做，哪怕是跟魔鬼做交易。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1552
translate chinese skystressrelief_53c41832:

    # jov "Tomorrow, I'll meet up with Bonheur and his connections. He says he has something big, something that will make all of [mc]'s ailments go away."
    jov "明天，我会去和博纳尔以及他的一些人脉见面。他说他有非常有效的办法，能治好[mc!t]身上所有的病。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1555
translate chinese skystressrelief_c348a782:

    # jov "It's risky, but what choice do I have?"
    jov "风险很大，但我还有什么办法呢？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1556
translate chinese skystressrelief_c6c62dd3:

    # jov "I wish I could talk to Klara about it, but I can't. She'd stop me."
    jov "我真希望我能和克拉拉聊聊这事，但是不行。她会阻止我的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1557
translate chinese skystressrelief_a427bc9a:

    # jov "But I can't just watch [mc] suffer. I can't..."
    jov "可是我不能眼看着[mc!t]受苦。我做不到……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1558
translate chinese skystressrelief_e358eebe:

    # jov "What kind of [landlord] would I be if I just let [mc] die this slow, painful d-"
    jov "我是他[landlord!t]，我怎么能让[mc!t]就这样又慢又痛苦地——"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1559
translate chinese skystressrelief_25171a55:

    # jov "No, I can't think like that. I can't..."
    jov "不行，我不能有这种想法。不行……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1564
translate chinese skystressrelief_2728f0c1:

    # jov "Entry for April 10th, XXXX. Bonheur's offer is hanging over me, full of promise yet riddled with risk."
    jov "这是XXXX年4月10日的记录。博纳尔的提议充满希望，可他对风险讳莫如深，我心里非常纠结。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1565
translate chinese skystressrelief_ce692211:

    # jov "He talks about a \"universal cure\": something that would fix everything. But there's a catch."
    jov "他说那是“万能药”，包治百病。但我要答应他的一个条件。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1568
translate chinese skystressrelief_3932db96:

    # jov "Be that as it may, we've run out of options. We've admitted [mc] to the hospital."
    jov "尽管如此，我们也已经没得选了。我们要把[mc!t]送到医院去了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1569
translate chinese skystressrelief_806a4b2f:

    # jov "If only these doctors were the least bit competent... but they're proving useless day after day."
    jov "要是这些医生能帮上忙就好了，可是我只觉得他们一天更比一天没用。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1604
translate chinese skystressrelief_e9b3eb0c:

    # mc "I was too young to remember, and given my weak memory, I haven't a single clue... I guess we're about to find out."
    mc "我当时太小了，什么也记不住，而且我的记忆力又差，我完全不清楚是什么状况……接着看应该就会明白了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1609
translate chinese skystressrelief_ac804b8f:

    # jov "The hospital's too quiet at night: eerie, almost."
    jov "医院里晚上非常安静，安静到诡异了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1632
translate chinese skystressrelief_7857fdf4:

    # jov "For better... or for worse..."
    jov "不管是好……是坏……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1637
translate chinese skystressrelief_31feb7ab:

    # jov "A few days after that night, [mc] woke up, seemingly out of nowhere."
    jov "那晚之后过了几天，[mc!t]毫无征兆地就醒了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1638
translate chinese skystressrelief_b8f65ae4:

    # jov "Just like that, it was as if he had never been sick in the first place. It was a complete 180."
    jov "轻描淡写，如同他根本就没病过一样。180度大转弯。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1644
translate chinese skystressrelief_b092069a:

    # jov "There's no way I would let those imbeciles discover this ground-breaker."
    jov "我绝对不可能让这群废物知道如此重要的事。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1650
translate chinese skystressrelief_0887b3b9:

    # jov "I'm under no illusions about this serum, or what I agreed to with Bonheur. There's gonna be a price to pay, no doubt about it."
    jov "我非常明白那个血清是什么东西，非常明白我和博纳尔做了什么交易。毫无疑问，我一定会付出相应的代价。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1651
translate chinese skystressrelief_9ef323c7:

    # jov "But for the moment, I'm just soaking in the gratitude."
    jov "但是眼下，我心里只有感恩。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1652
translate chinese skystressrelief_ca4650d2:

    # jov "Fully grateful for [mc]'s laughter echoing through the house, for his bright eyes smiling back at me."
    jov "感恩家里又响起了[mc!t]的笑声，感恩他闪闪发光的眼睛又能看着我了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1655
translate chinese skystressrelief_2bd8840f:

    # jov "I didn't record this as some sort of confession. It's just proof of how far a [landlord]'s willing to go for his [tenant]."
    jov "我留下这些记录不是为了坦白认罪。这只是一位[landlord!t]为了[tenant!t]甘愿付出一切的证明。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1656
translate chinese skystressrelief_16ed262a:

    # jov "Someday, I might find the guts to lay all this out for [mc] and explain the whole story."
    jov "或许有一天，我会有勇气把这些视频拿给[mc!t]看，向他说出一切。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1657
translate chinese skystressrelief_194e1984:

    # jov "But that's a worry for another day. For now, I'm gonna sit back and watch this play out."
    jov "但那就留到以后再说吧。现在，我还是静静地观察事态会如何发展吧。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1658
translate chinese skystressrelief_86ac8553:

    # jov "Although... I feel like I need to come clean to Klara about everything. But seeing her smile... maybe it's better if I just keep my mouth shut."
    jov "不过……我觉得我得把事情都告诉克拉拉。可是看到她的笑容……我又觉得可能还是保持沉默更好。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1659
translate chinese skystressrelief_ad56112a:

    # jov "And lastly, before I shut this whole thing down, I'm going to be honest. This is no longer just some vlog anymore. It turned into a whole documentary of secrets."
    jov "最后，在给事情完全画上句号之前，我要说句实话。这已经不止是VLOG了。早就变成了一大堆秘密的纪录片。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1661
translate chinese skystressrelief_ce3b3450:

    # jov "I just want to take this second chance and make it work with them. [mc], Sky, Klara... they're all my beacons of hope."
    jov "我只想抓住这第二次机会，和他们一起好好生活。[mc!t]，斯凯，克拉拉……他们都是我的希望。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1662
translate chinese skystressrelief_fb06fc2b:

    # jov "So long..."
    jov "再见了……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1681
translate chinese skystressrelief_6f5c87e4:

    # mc "I'm thankful to be alive because of him. But why didn't anyone tell me about my illness? It's something I should know, wouldn't you say?"
    mc "因为他，我才活了下来，为此我感谢他。可为什么没人跟我说过我得病的事？这难道不是我应该知道的事吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1684
translate chinese skystressrelief_330785f6:

    # k "You always wanted to know every little detail, and I was scared I wouldn't be able to answer your questions."
    k "你总是想知道所有细节，我害怕我没法回答你的问题。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1685
translate chinese skystressrelief_a99c1882:

    # k "I knew Jovian had some shady connections from his past job, but I never knew exactly what he was up to. He kept things to himself during those last days..."
    k "我知道乔维安因为他之前的工作积累了一些不正经的人脉，但是我从来都不清楚他具体干了些什么。最后那段日子里，他总是把一切都瞒着别人……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1686
translate chinese skystressrelief_7d129064:

    # k "Seeing you get better truly was a miracle: one I was scared to question."
    k "你能康复真的是个奇迹，甚至到了让我害怕提出问题的地步。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1687
translate chinese skystressrelief_e3b2ad5d:

    # k "You getting better was the only good thing we had at that time, and I was terrified that asking too many questions would ruin that."
    k "那段时间，你的病治好了是唯一的好事，我害怕问太多问题会让一切都化为乌有。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1691
translate chinese skystressrelief_682dbfc0:

    # k "I wish I could give you the closure you're looking for. All I can say is that Jovian did it all because he loved you."
    k "我也希望我能如你所愿，让你释怀。我能说的只有……他做这些都是因为他爱你。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1701
translate chinese skystressrelief_538cff93:

    # m "I don't know all the details about the serum, but I have an idea of why we feel connected."
    m "血清的事，我也不是全都清楚。但我大概明白为什么我们两个会感觉被连在一起了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1704
translate chinese skystressrelief_caec5e37:

    # m "I don't know the reasoning, but the first ten were supposed to be in pairs, but I ended up being made alone."
    m "我并不知道原因，但最早的十个理应都是成对的。可我却孤身一人。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1715
translate chinese skystressrelief_26d56770:

    # mc "It's nothing. I'm just thinking about what [landlord] did, and how our destinies became intertwined. Seems like we're being played with."
    mc "没什么。我只是在想[landlord!t]做的事，还有我们的命运是怎么纠缠在一起的。看来我们都被玩弄在股掌之间。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1744
translate chinese skystressrelief_4c27828e:

    # jov "It's been several years, and I never thought I'd turn this thing on again..."
    jov "已经好几年了，我从来没想过我居然还会再打开摄像机……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1745
translate chinese skystressrelief_f6a26fe4:

    # jov "So much has changed, especially me... I started to work for Bonheur."
    jov "很多东西都变了，我自己更是变了……我开始给博纳尔干活了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1764
translate chinese skystressrelief_43e1f87e:

    # jov "[mc] smiles at me. I smile back, but inside, I scream. Do I have it in me to finally tell him?"
    jov "[mc!t]对我笑了。我也对他笑了，可我心里却在尖叫。我有胆量把一切都告诉他吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1765
translate chinese skystressrelief_aa02a816:

    # jov "No, I don't have the strength..."
    jov "不，我实在做不到……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1770
translate chinese skystressrelief_9646ad78:

    # jov "Klara finally noticed the changes, the late nights, the silence. Worry clearly clouds her eyes, especially when she looks at me."
    jov "克拉拉终于意识到了变化，意识到我常常夜不归宿，意识到家里越来越多的沉默。她的眼睛里显然充满了担忧。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1775
translate chinese skystressrelief_ff7068e6:

    # jov "\"Are you okay?\", Sky typically asks, as her little brow furrows. I can only force a smile. \"Just peachy, sweetheart.\"."
    jov "“你没事吧？”，斯凯经常这么问，问的时候皱着小小的眉头。我只能强忍着挤出一个微笑。“我非常好，宝贝。”"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1782
translate chinese skystressrelief_7d60e1d6:

    # jov "My hands once held the kids. Now... I can't bear to look at them."
    jov "我的双手，曾经是用来抱住孩子们的，现在……我却连看都不忍看他们。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1784
translate chinese skystressrelief_7fbb371e:

    # jov "\"We can work together from now on, Jovian. We'll leave, then we can start fresh for the kids.\"... She believed in me, even when I'd stopped believing in myself."
    jov "“我们之后可以一起努力，乔维安。我们离开吧，为了孩子们，重新开始。”……她相信我，可我已经不相信我自己了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1785
translate chinese skystressrelief_c513ac9e:

    # jov "Why did I tell them to go first? Fear? Pride?"
    jov "我为什么会让他们先走？是因为恐惧？自尊？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1786
translate chinese skystressrelief_4d525038:

    # jov "Or did some twisted part of me know I'd never be able to follow?"
    jov "还是我心中扭曲的那部分早就明白，我没法跟他们一起走？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1792
translate chinese skystressrelief_1cae830f:

    # jov "The plane took off without me. And soon, the photos started arriving... [mc] on a beach, laughing."
    jov "飞机起飞了。我没有在上面。很快，照片就来了……[mc!t]在沙滩上，笑得很开心。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1795
translate chinese skystressrelief_892e94cc:

    # jov "It was a good decision to stay behind. My hands aren't fit to touch them anymore."
    jov "把我留下，是正确的决定。我的手已经没有资格触碰他们了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1796
translate chinese skystressrelief_6ac9b87f:

    # jov "Bonheur's tasks wring tighter, like a noose around my neck. Yet... what choice do I have?"
    jov "博纳尔的任务越来越紧迫，就像套在我脖子上的绞索。可是……我还有别的选择吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1803
translate chinese skystressrelief_e805a19b:

    # jov "My hands shake once again, and not from the usual fear. This is a different poison, seeping deep into my gut."
    jov "我的手又开始发抖，原因却不是往常的那种恐惧。这次是一种不一样的毒药，正渗透进我的骨髓。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1821
translate chinese skystressrelief_6fe55d71:

    # jov "I'm cornered, with no way out."
    jov "我走投无路了。没有任何办法。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1822
translate chinese skystressrelief_a582dfcb:

    # jov "Bonheur's resorted to blackmail. If I defy him, he's threatened to target my loved ones, not me."
    jov "博纳尔选择威胁我。如果我不听话，他的目标不是我，而是我爱的人。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1827
translate chinese skystressrelief_bea9bb6a:

    # jov "I must do it... for the sake of keeping them safe."
    jov "为了护他们周全……我只能去做。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1834
translate chinese skystressrelief_229e55ae:

    # jov "It's like it was pleading with me, to forgive it of the sins it has never committed."
    jov "就好像在恳求我，让我原谅他根本没有犯下的罪行一样。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1836
translate chinese skystressrelief_4cd0e427:

    # jov "I need to run away. Hide away from the world Bonheur represents, from everything. But to protect Klara, [mc], and Sky... there was no other choice."
    jov "我要逃跑。远离博纳尔代表的世界，远离一切。但要保护克拉拉，[mc!t]，还有斯凯……我别无选择。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1839
translate chinese skystressrelief_602f5b46:

    # jov "This may be my last entry..."
    jov "这可能是我最后的记录了……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1844
translate chinese skystressrelief_aaf390bc:

    # ew "The house had been listed for sale, but he seemed so desperate, we just had to take him in..."
    ew "那时候这个房子已经挂牌出售了。但是他看着很绝望，我们只能收留他……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1849
translate chinese skystressrelief_18871714:

    # yt "[landlady]..."
    yt "[landlady!t]……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1861
translate chinese skystressrelief_ccb3a5ca:

    # jov "They say time heals all wounds... LIES!"
    jov "他们说时间可以治愈一切伤口……胡扯！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1867
translate chinese skystressrelief_7a01aa92:

    # jov "I...I'm not alone anymore. T-t-there's always someone watching... In the corner of the room, a flicker in the mirror... that child's f-face... condemning me..."
    jov "这里……这里不止我一个人。一-一-一直都有别人在盯着我看……就在房间的角落里，或者在镜子里一闪而过……是-是那个孩子的脸……在宣告我有罪……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1868
translate chinese skystressrelief_77ee0359:

    # jov "Its whispers startle me awake at night... Just the creaking of the old house, or... No, a voice... Though tiny, the whimper turns into a wail..."
    jov "整晚的低语让我夜不能寐……是这老房子老化的声音，还是……不，是人声……先是轻微的呜咽，然后变成了哭嚎……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1871
translate chinese skystressrelief_3c99b93e:

    # jov "I cover my ears, but it's voice inside my head now. Won't stop."
    jov "我捂上了耳朵，却又跑到了我脑袋里。怎么也不会停。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1873
translate chinese skystressrelief_6c6b16ac:

    # jov "Won't STOP!"
    jov "不会停！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1876
translate chinese skystressrelief_25701b8a:

    # jov "STOPPPP!!"
    jov "{b}不会停！！！！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1880
translate chinese skystressrelief_e54024c7:

    # jov "Does it even need to?! It knows! It glares into the black pit where my soul used to be! There's no hiding from that stare, no running from what I am!"
    jov "他需要听我说话吗？！他心里明白！他能看穿原本是我的灵魂的那片黑暗！根本逃不过他的视线，逃不过我的本性！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1885
translate chinese skystressrelief_e592eece:

    # jov "T-they'll find me! Bonheur knows I've failed!"
    jov "他-他们会找到我的！博纳尔知道我失败了！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1889
translate chinese skystressrelief_94058701:

    # jov "It must be... it has to be him...!"
    jov "一定是他……必须是他才行啊……！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1898
translate chinese skystressrelief_a54319a8:

    # jov "Does she sense the blood on my hands, even when I've tried so hard to hide it?"
    jov "哪怕我竭尽全力隐藏，她还是能感觉得到我手上的血吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1910
translate chinese skystressrelief_3c9191c4:

    # jov "Not real... not real... but the water is cold even though the tap never runs... How's that possible...?"
    jov "不是真的……不是真的……但是水龙头明明没有开，水却是凉的……这怎么可能……？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1921
translate chinese skystressrelief_c34caa4b:

    # jov "Sky's laughter echoes from downstairs. [mc]'s shouting something about his game."
    jov "斯凯的笑声从楼下传过来了。[mc!t]在喊着游戏里的什么东西。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1934
translate chinese skystressrelief_d45ada92:

    # jov "Just a single breath..."
    jov "只要一口气……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1935
translate chinese skystressrelief_585dbeef:

    # jov "One final breath..."
    jov "最后一口气……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1937
translate chinese skystressrelief_55f37877:

    # k "NO!"
    k "不要！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1939
translate chinese skystressrelief_e5c644c7:

    # jov "In..."
    jov "吸气……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1940
translate chinese skystressrelief_b6bbd1a4:

    # jov "... Out..."
    jov "……呼气……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1941
translate chinese skystressrelief_d00342c7:

    # jov "And then..."
    jov "然后……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1959
translate chinese skystressrelief_41c99e79:

    # k "*wailing*"
    k "*哭嚎*"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1966
translate chinese skystressrelief_9ceb20ab:

    # m "He aimed to protect, to offer a second chance for a life that seemed to be fading."
    m "他是为了保护，为了给一条即将逝去的生命第二次机会。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1974
translate chinese skystressrelief_cd436d2d:

    # m "And if it weren't for him, we wouldn't have been here to witness his final moments, no matter how grim."
    m "而且如果不是他的话，我们也就不会在这里见证他最后的时刻了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1976
translate chinese skystressrelief_46a226a6:

    # m "Every choice carried the weight of life or death: not just for me, but for those whom I was responsible."
    m "每个决定都承载着或生或死的重量，而且不只是我一个人，还有由我负责的人。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1977
translate chinese skystressrelief_953597c2:

    # m "There are times, burdened by the consequences of those choices, that haunt me."
    m "我也曾经被那些选择带来的后果困扰过。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1994
translate chinese skystressrelief_4fb51c5b:

    # m "Exactly. So, stand up, not for us, not for others, but for yourself. I'm certain the Jovian you loved, and who loved you, wouldn't have wanted to see you like this."
    m "没错。所以，站起来吧，不是为了我们，不是为了别人，而是为了你自己。我敢说你爱的乔维安，爱你的乔维安，也不想看到你这个样子。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2004
translate chinese skystressrelief_f3b0229a:

    # yt "I couldn't have articulated it better–actually, I doubt I'd have found the right words to reach [landlady]."
    yt "我绝对没法说得比她更好——其实，我估计我都根本想不出合适的话对[landlady!t]说。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2005
translate chinese skystressrelief_55f49672:

    # yt "[landlady] doesn't easily trust others' words, so gaining her full confidence takes time."
    yt "[landlady!t]不会轻易相信别人的话，要花很多时间才能完全获得她的信任。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2007
translate chinese skystressrelief_3250aa72:

    # yt "This came from someone who I thought barely understood life."
    yt "我还以为她根本不理解人生呢。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2035
translate chinese skystressrelief_74b9738d:

    # m "Dear Lord..."
    m "亲爱的主啊……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2036
translate chinese skystressrelief_bd7c800d:

    # m "As I kneel in reverence before this hallowed ground, I humbly ask you to grant eternal solace to the soul of my confidant's cherished [landlord]."
    m "我虔诚地跪拜在圣地上，乞求您能将永恒的安宁赐给我的挚爱的[landlord!t]的灵魂。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2037
translate chinese skystressrelief_5cfc3f99:

    # m "Though our paths never crossed, I know he was a pillar of strength, and a wellspring of love for those who were blessed to know him."
    m "尽管我和他素昧平生，但我知道他是有力的支柱，是有幸认识他的人的爱的源泉。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2038
translate chinese skystressrelief_fc20299c:

    # m "May his memory forever be a guiding star, illuminating the lives of his loved ones and inspiring them to walk in the footsteps of his wisdom and compassion."
    m "愿他的记忆永远成为指引的星辰，照亮他所爱之人的生活，并激励他们沿着他那充满智慧和慈悲的足迹前行。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2039
translate chinese skystressrelief_fc58ba75:

    # m "Grant them the fortitude to carry on his legacy, to find joy in the moments he shared, and to feel his presence in the whispers of the wind."
    m "赐予他们坚韧的力量，让他们能继续传承他的遗产，从他分享的时刻中找到快乐，并在风的低语中感受到他的存在。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2040
translate chinese skystressrelief_1a3df06f:

    # m "Watch over them, oh Lord, and envelop them in your boundless grace, so that they may find peace in the knowledge that he rests eternally in your celestial embrace."
    m "亲爱的主啊，请看顾他们，用您的无边恩典将他们包围，让他们知道他永远安息在您的天国怀抱中，让他们得到宁静。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2041
translate chinese skystressrelief_57880a46:

    # m "Amen..."
    m "阿门……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2056
translate chinese skystressrelief_b07ae5b1:

    # k "He chose this path... and knowing him, he wouldn't have wanted me to interfere. I'll let him rest here in peace."
    k "他选择了这条路……我了解他，他不会愿意让我插手的。就让他在这里安息吧。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2069
translate chinese skystressrelief_b96676f0:

    # yt "I will finish this, mark my words."
    yt "我会结束这一切的，我说到做到。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2110
translate chinese skystressrelief_c7994fc8:

    # ew "He talked about you a lot, and had mentioned your interest in photos several times."
    ew "他经常说你的事，好几次提到过你对摄影感兴趣。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2121
translate chinese skystressrelief_b80515d3:

    # ew "But that's behind us now. We've lived long enough, seen too much. Peace of mind is all we want."
    ew "但那些事都过去了。我们只想过平静的生活。我们已经活了够久，见了够多了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2156
translate chinese skystressrelief_3f85afd6:

    # j "I'm not going sugarcoat it, Fang: do you really find fulfillment living this way?"
    j "我就直说了吧，獠牙：你这样子真的会有满足感吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2157
translate chinese skystressrelief_a265b9a8:

    # m "You were the one who put me in this position. Why are you now questioning how I'm living?"
    m "明明是你让我这样的。怎么现在又来质疑我的生活方式？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2173
translate chinese skystressrelief_c88a0452:

    # j "Leave this place and do something meaningful. Not for us, not for others, but for yourself."
    j "离开这里，做些有意义的事情，不是为了我们，不是为了别人，而是为了你自己。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2175
translate chinese skystressrelief_ad8f3ac2:

    # j "I think I know someone who might be able to help you—No, I have this feeling you might just help each other."
    j "我认识一个说不定能帮你的人——不，我感觉你们能互相帮助。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2190
translate chinese skystressrelief_adaed172:

    # m "{i}Little did I realize that fate was pulling us {b}back together{/b}..."
    m "{i}我根本没想到，命运在让我们{b}重聚{/b}……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2193
translate chinese skystressrelief_f018b8ff:

    # m "{i}Oddly enough, it wasn't a comforting sensation, so I tried to put up a brave face every time our eyes met."
    m "{i}真是奇怪，这种感觉一点也不好。所以我们每次目光交汇的时候我都会尽力摆出一副勇敢的表情。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2204
translate chinese skystressrelief_6d4fcfcf:

    # m "{i}You're unlike anyone I've ever met. Your eyes often carry a hint of pity."
    m "{i}你和我遇见的其他人都不一样。你的眼里总是有一丝怜悯。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2205
translate chinese skystressrelief_8fdb6ac2:

    # m "{i}I don't desire it, yet I find comfort knowing you're here to watch over me, just as I'm determined to protect you-"
    m "{i}我内心并不渴求这样，可我只要知道你在注视着我，就觉得安心，我也下定了决心要保护你——"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2209
translate chinese skystressrelief_29a224de:

    # m "{i}-My Lord..."
    m "{i}——我的王……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2220
translate chinese skystressrelief_8462c365:

    # m "... Sorry, I was resting my eyes."
    m "……抱歉。就是休息一下眼睛。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2221
translate chinese skystressrelief_a22dd6e0:

    # mc "No, no, it's okay. Come on, they're here."
    mc "不不，没事的。来吧，他们已经到了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2232
translate chinese skystressrelief_23bbe84b:

    # un "Well, not only me, but..."
    un "嗯，也不只是我一个人，其实……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2235
translate chinese skystressrelief_32cee21b:

    # un "... A certain guy didn't like my usual look, that's all."
    un "……有个人不喜欢我平常的打扮，仅此而已。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2239
translate chinese skystressrelief_6d5d901e:

    # m "What did you do?"
    m "你做了什么？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2240
translate chinese skystressrelief_7934acd3:

    # cl "Don't worry about it."
    cl "不必在意。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2291
translate chinese skystressrelief_277e92a6:

    # a "But, yeah... He mentioned he's looking for a place or something. He didn't elaborate further."
    a "但是总之……他说他正在找一个地方还是什么的。他没说得太清楚。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2294
translate chinese skystressrelief_9bda16c0:

    # la "I see. Then if everyone else is here, we should start."
    la "我明白了。那，如果其他人都在的话，我们就开始吧。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2299
translate chinese skystressrelief_31d96e00:

    # mc "I think it's better if only you guys watch it. The rest should just listen."
    mc "最好还是只让你们几个看吧。其他人只用听着就好了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2303
translate chinese skystressrelief_461aac3e:

    # a "*whispers* He's so intimidating."
    a "*低语* 他好吓人啊。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2304
translate chinese skystressrelief_46b9e818:

    # g "*whispers* I know, right? Something's off about his presence."
    g "*低语* 对吧？总感觉他这人不太对劲。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2323
translate chinese skystressrelief_c8955eb8:

    # mc "Yeah, you guys heard it right..."
    mc "嗯，你们想得没错……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2333
translate chinese skystressrelief_6e38cec0:

    # la "We'll pay him a visit as soon as we can. Pay him our full respects."
    la "我们会尽快去看他的。向他表达我们的敬意。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2339
translate chinese skystressrelief_c7b39ff1:

    # la "Now then, as for the rest of what Jovian revealed..."
    la "那么，至于剩下的部分……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2345
translate chinese skystressrelief_d4cd614d:

    # j "I still can't believe it, but you, [mc], have the last serum we were looking for."
    j "我仍然没法相信，但是你，[mc!t]，身上有我们正在寻找的最后一支血清。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2346
translate chinese skystressrelief_b37296c0:

    # mc "So you guys knew about this?"
    mc "所以你们全都知道？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2349
translate chinese skystressrelief_b6ba287a:

    # la "I did say we have information that you don't. We only needed confirmation in order to share this confidential detail."
    la "我的确说过我们手上有你不知道的情报。我们只是在分享这些机密情报之前需要做好确认。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2350
translate chinese skystressrelief_f49f7523:

    # la "And with that, there's no doubt about it."
    la "而现在，情况已经确凿无疑了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2351
translate chinese skystressrelief_50c09c98:

    # j "For the past two years, we were scouring every corner of the globe to find it. Who would've thought it was right under our noses this whole time?"
    j "过去两年来，我们找遍了整个地球。谁能想到一直以来就在我们眼皮子底下？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2366
translate chinese skystressrelief_662b5e18:

    # la "If we were to let these people roam free without supervision, just think of what they could do."
    la "如果不对他们进行监督，让他们肆意妄为，后果不堪设想。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2367
translate chinese skystressrelief_4b0e71d9:

    # la "I'm talking about those who turned to crime, those who joined wicked causes to exploit what they possess."
    la "事实上他们之中已经出现了成为罪犯，靠着能力胡作非为的人。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2385
translate chinese skystressrelief_b190c7d1:

    # j "Feel free to. But expect a chain reaction from a few people in this room."
    j "请便。不过这房间里的好几个人都会出现连锁反应的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2391
translate chinese skystressrelief_355ea170:

    # la "{size=-10}Switch with me. You only have a few minutes..." with dissolve
    la "{size=-10}跟我交换吧。你只有几分钟的时间……" with dissolve

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2412
translate chinese skystressrelief_de174968:

    # ala "Be at ease, young ones. Allow me to introduce myself properly."
    ala "别着急，年轻人们。请允许我正式做一下自我介绍。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2417
translate chinese skystressrelief_364c5737:

    # ala "We are very please to meet you, people of the new era."
    ala "我们很高兴能够见到你们这些新时代的人们。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2418
translate chinese skystressrelief_9687805c:

    # cl "Oh, I'm not sure if she feels the same way..."
    cl "噢，我可不好说她是不是也这么想……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2427
translate chinese skystressrelief_023f892a:

    # ala "Before you, there was us... the \"Experimental Test Subjects\". Or, to put it simply, the failed iterations of the serum."
    ala "在你们之前，还有我们……所谓的“原型试作体”。或者简单来说，就是失败品。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2432
translate chinese skystressrelief_e3eef163:

    # ala "The core principle behind the serum is the combination of DNA from two individuals: the living and the exhumed."
    ala "血清的核心机制就是让两个人——活体和死体——的DNA结合在一起。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2439
translate chinese skystressrelief_ac882dee:

    # ala "Indeed. Aveline and I are deceased mercenaries from a bygone era. The creator managed to locate our remains and utilized them for their experiments."
    ala "没错。我和艾芙琳都是来自过去的雇佣兵，早已死去。血清的制造者找到了我们的尸体，用来做实验。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2492
translate chinese skystressrelief_a00ea4b2:

    # ala "{size=-10}Let us switch back..." with dissolve
    ala "{size=-10}交换回来吧……" with dissolve

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2498
translate chinese skystressrelief_cee3dcda:

    # a "I can't believe this... I'm having a hard time trying to process what I'm seeing..."
    a "我没法相信……我都理解不了刚刚发生的事……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2499
translate chinese skystressrelief_050b2afe:

    # g "So it's possible for two consciousnesses to exist within one body? Well damn, that's... wild!"
    g "原来一个身体里还能有两个意识？我去，厉害啊……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2503
translate chinese skystressrelief_4e12f510:

    # la "As incredible and advantageous as that sounds, there are serious repercussions."
    la "听起来是很厉害很先进，但这是有副作用的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2505
translate chinese skystressrelief_35a6f9d8:

    # la "And they're not just any simple repercussions. They affect ones vital organs, weakening them."
    la "而且还不是普通的副作用。血清会让体内的重要器官慢慢衰竭。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2506
translate chinese skystressrelief_4b428d92:

    # la "Since the exhumed are meant to be stronger than normal people, it's like using a truck engine in a moped."
    la "死体都是要比普通人更强的，让他们寄宿在普通人体内，就像是给摩托用大卡车的发动机一样。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2512
translate chinese skystressrelief_d46a0fa1:

    # la "Exactly. Eventually, it harms our eyes, causing us to cry blood. And there are no countermeasures for it."
    la "没错。副作用最终会影响到我们的眼睛，让我们流血泪。没有治愈的手段。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2517
translate chinese skystressrelief_ce21aad2:

    # la "I know this is a lot to take in, but it's better for us to lay it all out for you now. You have another question, right?"
    la "我知道这么多事情很难消化，但对我们来说，还是一下子全告诉你们更好。你还有别的问题，对吧？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2524
translate chinese skystressrelief_f337e10f:

    # la "Do you really want to know-?"
    la "你真的想知道吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2537
translate chinese skystressrelief_dbc5d8c3:

    # cl "This is... interesting... No, this shouldn't even be possible..."
    cl "这……有意思……不，这应该根本不可能才对……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2538
translate chinese skystressrelief_77616783:

    # la "Well, we're delighted to hear about it, Ms. Secretary."
    la "我们都很想听听看，秘书小姐。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2541
translate chinese skystressrelief_74d3056c:

    # cl "These two are... Do you know anything about Suehara?"
    cl "这两个人是……你们听说过末原国吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2543
translate chinese skystressrelief_8eab52d4:

    # j "That data has been nothing but accurate. The fact that it's there means that it's true."
    j "那里面存的数据都是绝对真实准确的。只要能在里面查到，就一定是真的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2547
translate chinese skystressrelief_a219bfeb:

    # mc "What's it about?"
    mc "什么意思？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2553
translate chinese skystressrelief_7d16a13a:

    # cl "In the ancient times of Suehara, there existed an empire where the sun never dared to set without first kissing the golden spires of its capital, Tsukizaki."
    cl "在遥远的古代，有个名叫末原的王国。在那里，阳光势必要先亲吻首都月琦的雄伟城楼，之后才会照耀其他地方。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2569
translate chinese skystressrelief_676cfd69:

    # cl "Sora, who had served at the palace since her youth, found in the emperor not just a ruler, but a man of deep compassion and understanding."
    cl "而空自幼便在宫中服侍，在她眼里，国王不仅是一国之君，更是一个富有同情心、善解人意的男人。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2575
translate chinese skystressrelief_4dc4f7a7:

    # cl "The empire, accustomed to his unorthodox ways, celebrated the union, for the happiness of their beloved emperor ensured the prosperity of Suehara."
    cl "国家早已习惯他离经叛道的做法，为国王的大婚举行了盛大的庆典，庆祝他们心中给末原国带来繁荣的敬爱的国王找到了幸福。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2589
translate chinese skystressrelief_105421bf:

    # cl "A neighboring kingdom, envious of Suehara's prosperity and peace, launched a surprise attack. The empire, caught off guard, faced unprecedented peril."
    cl "一个邻近的王国嫉妒末原国的繁荣与和平，发动了奇袭。王国对此毫无准备，面临着前所未有的危机。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2598
translate chinese skystressrelief_76addd5a:

    # cl "The emperor fell, mortally wounded. With the last of his strength, he uttered his last words declaring his eternal love for Sora and his empire."
    cl "国王摔在地上，身受重伤，在死前低语着他对空和末原国永恒不灭的爱。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2599
translate chinese skystressrelief_077e8d82:

    # cl "Though the war against the enemy had been won, the empire could not celebrate its Pyrrhic victory."
    cl "尽管末原国赢得了战斗，却无法庆祝这代价过于高昂的胜利。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2601
translate chinese skystressrelief_e7b3a7d5:

    # cl "The world they had dreamed of building together, a world of enduring peace and love, had crumbled before her eyes, shattered by the tip of an arrow."
    cl "他们那一起建立一个充满爱与和平的世界的梦想，就这么被一支箭射穿，在她眼前崩塌。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2608
translate chinese skystressrelief_0664f6c5:

    # cl "With a heart drowned in grief, Sora chose to follow her beloved into death, committing seppuku in the imperial garden where Kaito had first declared his love for her."
    cl "空的内心被悲伤压垮，于是她来到了海人第一次向她倾诉爱意的花园，切腹自尽，随爱人而去了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2617
translate chinese skystressrelief_360ce266:

    # cl "And so, in the heart of Suehara, amidst the whispering winds and beneath the eternal sky, the love of Kaito and Sora endures, a beacon of light in a world of shadows."
    cl "因此，在末原国的心脏地带，在低语的微风中，在永恒的天空下，海人和空之间的爱一直持续着，给充满阴影的世界带来了一束光。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2643
translate chinese skystressrelief_16e00382:

    # a "NO WAY!!!!" (multiple=2)
    a "{b}不会吧！！！！" (multiple=2)

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2644
translate chinese skystressrelief_9e7e074a:

    # g "REALLY??!!" (multiple=2)
    g "{b}真的吗？？！！" (multiple=2)

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2647
translate chinese skystressrelief_d7f3f9fa:

    # mc "Hey, don't freeze up. It's already getting weird in here."
    mc "哎，别傻愣着啊。气氛本来就有点奇怪了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2649
translate chinese skystressrelief_fca5b18f:

    # m "I-I-I-I'm not... ready for this! Please give me some time!"
    m "我-我-我-我还没……做好心理准备！再给我点时间！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2650
translate chinese skystressrelief_36df42ea:

    # mc "Where did that playful side of you went to...?"
    mc "你喜欢调皮捣蛋的那一面跑到哪去了……？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2658
translate chinese skystressrelief_1d7e8809:

    # a "What's the point of living anymore...? What's the point...?"
    a "活着还有什么意义……？什么意义……？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2659
translate chinese skystressrelief_07029a41:

    # g "Serves you right."
    g "你活该啊。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2663
translate chinese skystressrelief_6a1a3d6b:

    # m "It... it has to be. There's no other explanation."
    m "一定……一定是这样的。不会有其他原因。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2667
translate chinese skystressrelief_eabf8faa:

    # la "It may not be the same, but Lucien and Aveline have a certain connection between them, too. I'm sure that goes for the rest of the Early Stages as well."
    la "虽然情况可能不太一样，但是卢希恩和艾芙琳之间也有一种联系。我想其他所有早期型肯定也都是这样。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2671
translate chinese skystressrelief_85048a8c:

    # g "You fuck? Like a real husband and wife do?"
    g "上床做爱？就像真正的夫妻那样？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2678
translate chinese skystressrelief_0b33fc67:

    # la "You've been through a lot today. It's a good idea to take some time off."
    la "你们今天经历了很多，最好还是休息一下吧。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2684
translate chinese skystressrelief_eddea171:

    # la "You charged him for Nicole and Yuna's service?! Seriously?!"
    la "喊妮可和由奈来一趟，你居然还收他的钱？！认真的吗？！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2685
translate chinese skystressrelief_f3413574:

    # j "What are you talking about? You're the one who started our agency in the first place!"
    j "你说什么呢？这个机构明明是你建立的啊！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2686
translate chinese skystressrelief_f7be6baa:

    # j "nO oNe GeTs A fReE sErViCe, blah, blah, blah...!"
    j "“绝对不给任何人提供免费服务”，这的那的……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2690
translate chinese skystressrelief_0a781be0:

    # cl "Okay, okay. I'm not going to be your referee, so let's just get out."
    cl "行了，行了。我懒得给你们当裁判。我们赶紧出去吧。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2693
translate chinese skystressrelief_5df33aff:

    # cl "See you later... [mc]."
    cl "再见了……[mc!t]。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2694
translate chinese skystressrelief_1dbbd741:

    # mc "T-take care..."
    mc "再-再见……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2697
translate chinese skystressrelief_1aa6c6e0:

    # yt "What's with that mischievous grin...?"
    yt "那个调皮的笑容是什么意思……？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2714
translate chinese skystressrelief_c7bce606:

    # mc "Yeah, says the one who was blushing like a tomato moments ago."
    mc "你刚刚脸还红得跟番茄一样呢。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2721
translate chinese skystressrelief_8a05d2b3:

    # m "I'm not sure. This time, I just don't know how to react or what to make of how I feel."
    m "我不知道。这一次，我只是不知道该做什么反应，也不知道该怎么理解我内心的感受。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2723
translate chinese skystressrelief_884394f0:

    # m "This is a first for me..."
    m "这对我来说还是第一次……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2742
translate chinese skystressrelief_d33ea293:

    # mc "It's crazy that you have such a deep understanding of concepts but haven't experienced them yourself. Why is that?"
    mc "你对各种概念理解挺深，自己却没亲身体验过，真是奇怪啊。为什么会这样？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2743
translate chinese skystressrelief_92a30b6c:

    # m "I learned through observing others. Over time, I accepted those observations as truths."
    m "那都是我通过观察其他人学来的。我慢慢就把那些观察当做事实接受了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2748
translate chinese skystressrelief_f49fff8f:

    # mc "Yeah?"
    mc "嗯？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2753
translate chinese skystressrelief_4fe3ab78:

    # m "Then what do we do now? I have no idea what to make of it."
    m "那我们该怎么办？我不知道该怎么理解这件事。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2754
translate chinese skystressrelief_acb3fe0f:

    # mc "We can't just ignore the fact, nor do I want us to."
    mc "我们不能直接忽略这一点，我也不想那样。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2756
translate chinese skystressrelief_3dd3ea58:

    # mc "That said, do you simply want us to forget about it?"
    mc "话虽这么说，你想直接无视掉这事吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2763
translate chinese skystressrelief_9135a4cb:

    # m "No, I don't wanna!"
    m "不想！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2764
translate chinese skystressrelief_f0741a23:

    # yt "*laughs* She sounded so childlike just now. Another rare Moon mannerism: I'll add it to my list."
    yt "*大笑* 她刚刚的声音就跟小孩子一样。又是一件几乎不会看到她做的事。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2767
translate chinese skystressrelief_14184a24:

    # mc "Then we'll have to accept it. Maybe not right away, but let it come naturally, gradually. I don't want to force you into this."
    mc "那我们就只能接受。不用立马接受，自然点，慢慢来。我不想强迫你。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2774
translate chinese skystressrelief_bb0c7699:

    # mc "But then again, knowing the risks, maybe it's better if it stays hidden."
    mc "不过呢，考虑到背后的风险，可能还是保密更好。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2804
translate chinese skystressrelief_c0194f9f:

    # m "Ee...fuh... Eefuh. It's spelled A-O-I-F-E, but that's how you pronounce it."
    m "艾……法……艾法。写法是A,O,I,F,E。读法就是艾法。（译注：Aoife是个很罕见的爱尔兰名字，所以月才会对主角拼读这个名字。）"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2808
translate chinese skystressrelief_7e8219e6:

    # m "Jess and her crew have been aware that Aoife's still alive, but they've never been able to catch her."
    m "婕斯他们已经知道她还活着，但一直找不到她。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2811
translate chinese skystressrelief_330ac987:

    # mc "What will you do once you find her?"
    mc "找到她以后，你打算怎么办？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2824
translate chinese skystressrelief_e654ba92:

    # m "Six, Eight, and I were part of the Activists, trying to initiate change from within. Because we saw ourselves as prisoners, not soldiers, fighting someone else's war."
    m "六号，八号和我是反对派的，想从内部做出改变。因为我们觉得自己是囚犯，而不是士兵，我们是在被迫替别人卖命。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2827
translate chinese skystressrelief_621be484:

    # mc "I take it that you failed?"
    mc "我猜你们失败了？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2829
translate chinese skystressrelief_9b44ffe4:

    # m "Informed by a spy, we planted a bomb in a Loyalist hideout where One and Two often stayed."
    m "我们在忠诚派的基地里装了炸弹，因为有一个间谍报告说一号和二号经常会去那里。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2835
translate chinese skystressrelief_ad1e5c1e:

    # yt "It's not a battle for justice, but a fight for revenge with no clear right side... I see..."
    yt "原来如此……这并非正义之战，而是难以辨别谁对谁错的仇恨循环……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2841
translate chinese skystressrelief_2bc02fa9:

    # mc "Listen, Moon: I know you're hurting over this, but going after Aoife won't solve anything."
    mc "听我说，月。我知道你很受伤，但是去找艾法也什么都解决不了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2842
translate chinese skystressrelief_08b28836:

    # mc "Even if you get your revenge, it won't bring your friends back or undo the past."
    mc "哪怕你最后成功复仇了，你的朋友也不会回来，过去也不会改变。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2843
translate chinese skystressrelief_eddb8a8b:

    # mc "You said the same to [landlady], so I know you get that, right?"
    mc "你对[landlady!t]说了一样的话，所以你肯定懂这些的，对吧？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2845
translate chinese skystressrelief_5b0273ab:

    # mc "Moving forward means letting go of that resentment."
    mc "向前看就意味着放下这种怨恨。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2847
translate chinese skystressrelief_8ca553a9:

    # mc "How long are you going to endure it?"
    mc "你打算永远这样子下去吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2848
translate chinese skystressrelief_0ec62db9:

    # m "I... I'm not sure I can let it go, Commander. It's totally different from Klara. Their deaths aren't something I can just forget."
    m "我……我没法就这么算了，指挥官。这跟克拉拉的情况完全不一样。她们的死没法就这么算了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2849
translate chinese skystressrelief_31ba3399:

    # mc "I'm not saying you have to forgive her. But if there's a chance to stop the fighting, don't let it pass by."
    mc "我不是说让你原谅她。可是如果有机会结束战斗的话，就不要错过。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2858
translate chinese skystressrelief_c6250dc3:

    # mc "Whether you go after Aoife or choose to let go and move forward, there's no wrong choice here. Focus on what {i}you{/i} believe you should do."
    mc "不管你是要去找艾法，还是选择向前迈进，都不是错误的选择。专注于{b}你{/b}该做什么就好。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2873
translate chinese skystressrelief_a1cb2a9c:

    # fr "I've gathered enough resources, father."
    fr "我已经准备妥当了，父亲。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2874
translate chinese skystressrelief_b8d828a7:

    # fr "Everything is in place; we're ready to make our move."
    fr "万事俱备；随时可以行动。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2878
translate chinese skystressrelief_071481eb:

    # fr "Yes. I heeded your warning about {i}that{/i} soldier."
    fr "是的，我听从了你有关{i}那个{/i}士兵的警告。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2879
translate chinese skystressrelief_d8bb6c8e:

    # fr "If everything we know about her is accurate, then we'll need a stronger soldier to counter her."
    fr "如果我们对她的了解是准确的，那就需要一个更强的士兵来对付她。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2885
translate chinese skystressrelief_ff2a9be8:

    # bo "Subject Number Two, reborn from a marksman renowned in history, set against a Legend-class like Sora? Dubious... but intriguing."
    bo "二号实验体，寄宿着历史上知名的神枪手，对抗空这样的传奇人物啊……好坏参半……但是有趣。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2895
translate chinese skystressrelief_9ccaab47:

    # bo "You have my full backing. I am eager to witness the fruits of your strategy."
    bo "我会全力支持你。我迫切地想看看你的策略最后会有什么成果。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2896
translate chinese skystressrelief_466762c1:

    # bo "Do entertain me, Francis."
    bo "让我好好娱乐一下，弗朗西斯。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2897
translate chinese skystressrelief_671f214e:

    # fr "We have everything we need. Plus, I have my own reasons for targeting him first. He's as good as dead."
    fr "我们已准备好了一切。而且，我也有我个人的理由先从他开刀。他死定了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2898
translate chinese skystressrelief_1fcbdefb:

    # bo "Personal vendettas can sharpen one's determination, or cloud one's judgment. Tread carefully with the double-edged sword you've unsheathed, Francis."
    bo "私人恩怨能强化决心，也能蒙蔽双眼。要小心对待你手上这把双刃剑，弗朗西斯。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2899
translate chinese skystressrelief_5ba44496:

    # fr "It's not mere anger, father. Believe me, he won't know what hit him."
    fr "并非只有愤怒，父亲。相信我吧，他绝对毫无还手之力。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2900
translate chinese skystressrelief_b5bae7de:

    # bo "So be it."
    bo "去吧。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2909
translate chinese skystressrelief_fb64ca31:

    # bo "Perhaps my experiments weren't my biggest mistake, but you, Francis..."
    bo "或许我最大的错误不是那些实验，而是你，弗朗西斯……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2921
translate chinese skystressrelief_83a9f3ae:

    # mc "Yeah... we found him, but at the same time we lost him again."
    mc "是啊……我们在找到他的同时又失去了他。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2922
translate chinese skystressrelief_77ebecbc:

    # mc "It's always like this. We solve one problem, but then another one pops up."
    mc "一直都是这样的。解决了一个问题，立马又出现另一个。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2923
translate chinese skystressrelief_7a985d2d:

    # mc "When will we finally achieve something truly beneficial?"
    mc "什么时候才能做成一件真正有好处的事呢？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2927
translate chinese skystressrelief_2ce8742e:

    # yt "I should change the topic. I don't want her to worry too much."
    yt "换个话题吧。不能让她太担心。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2930
translate chinese skystressrelief_c173469d:

    # mc "Anyway, where did you and Shu go yesterday?"
    mc "对了，你跟修那天去哪了？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2931
translate chinese skystressrelief_a0b84074:

    # f "Well... he asked me to keep it a secret, but we were looking for... a venue to prepare for something."
    f "嗯……虽然他让我保密……不过我们其实是去找……场馆。是为了给一件事做准备。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2937
translate chinese skystressrelief_5bd3bde7:

    # f "That, I don't know. He didn't tell me. Likely for an event of some sort, that's for sure."
    f "我不知道。他没告诉我。不过肯定是用来举办什么活动的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2946
translate chinese skystressrelief_2e68c641:

    # f "Who's that? A customer?"
    f "那是谁？客人吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2969
translate chinese skystressrelief_82b1f717:

    # yt "... I don't know what those bioluminescent eyes were telling me. Could she be..."
    yt "……那双会发光的眼睛实在不同寻常。难道她……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2970
translate chinese skystressrelief_9b136dba:

    # yt "What are the chances, right?"
    yt "说不定呢？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2973
translate chinese skystressrelief_04fc95b9:

    # mc "... I see."
    mc "……原来如此。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2974
translate chinese skystressrelief_74a58cb1:

    # f "Hm?"
    f "嗯？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3017
translate chinese skystressrelief_0c12cb16:

    # au "While I'm aware of your connection to Jess, I must emphasize that it doesn't influence our hiring process. Everyone is evaluated on the same criteria here."
    au "我清楚你和婕斯有关系，所以我必须强调一下，这对我们公司的招聘流程毫无影响。我们对所有人一视同仁。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3026
translate chinese skystressrelief_599d3466:

    # au "I see. The job market is broad; there are many opportunities out there."
    au "好吧。就业市场很广阔，别的地方还有很多机会。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3027
translate chinese skystressrelief_d2f9c3cb:

    # au "I can provide you with some recommendations for where to apply next. That's the best assistance I can offer at the moment."
    au "我可以给你推荐几个接下来可以尝试的地方。这是我眼下能给你的最大帮助了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3061
translate chinese skystressrelief_62357fac:

    # jane "Hello, Moon. Thank you for showing interest in our law firm. I've taken the time to review your application and résumé thoroughly."
    jane "你好，月。谢谢你愿意选择本律师事务所。我已经详细查阅了你的申请和简历。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3062
translate chinese skystressrelief_82e9bb34:

    # m "Oh, uhm, thank you so much for considering my application. I'm really grateful for the opportunity."
    m "噢，呃，非常感谢你愿意考虑我的申请。能有这次机会，我很感激。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3068
translate chinese skystressrelief_7f2cb156:

    # jane "Unfortunately, I don't think there is anything for you here."
    jane "很遗憾，我认为你没有什么能做的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3095
translate chinese skystressrelief_f6a01e70:

    # mall "The pornography industry, to put it simply. I can't fit you in here unless you want to become an adult video actress."
    mall "简单来说就是色情行业。除非你想下海拍片子，不然我们这没你能干的活。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3128
translate chinese skystressrelief_faf1a195:

    # kai "Oh hey, a new fitness enthusiast?"
    kai "噢，来健身的新人？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3129
translate chinese skystressrelief_2e2d4119:

    # m "No, I'm-{w=0.5}{nw}"
    m "不，我是——{w=0.5}{nw}"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3145
translate chinese skystressrelief_72d4b7a7:

    # kai "Yeah? Alright then, how about this? Prove to me you can handle the job."
    kai "是吗？好吧，那这样如何？向我证明你能干好。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3146
translate chinese skystressrelief_0933ef42:

    # kai "Show me what you've got, then I'll think about it."
    kai "给我看看你的本事，然后我就考虑考虑。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3163
translate chinese skystressrelief_052695ee:

    # kai "Why the wait? Let's-{w=0.7}{nw}"
    kai "还等什么呢？赶快——{w=0.7}{nw}"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3180
translate chinese skystressrelief_8c09fe29:

    # m "Thank-{w=0.5}{nw}"
    m "谢——{w=0.5}{nw}"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3187
translate chinese skystressrelief_c2cdba70:

    # mill "You're applying for the combat instructor role, right? Unfortunately, we just filled that position yesterday."
    mill "你是来应聘格斗教练的，对吧？很抱歉，昨天这个岗位已经招到人了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3190
translate chinese skystressrelief_513c2079:

    # kai "Filled? But you haven't closed the job posting yet!"
    kai "招到人了？但是招聘的广告还没撤下来呢！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3191
translate chinese skystressrelief_54476f02:

    # mill "Well... my fault..."
    mill "这个……是我的疏忽……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3199
translate chinese skystressrelief_fb2927e0:

    # m "So there's a possibility it'll open up again?"
    m "所以，将来可能还会再招人？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3215
translate chinese skystressrelief_a33b42c0:

    # kai "You're making a big mistake, Millie!"
    kai "你会后悔的，米莉！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3269
translate chinese skystressrelief_b979e3c7:

    # m "{size=+10}{b}AOIFEEEEEEEEE!!!"
    m "{size=+10}{b}艾法！！！！！！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3314
translate chinese skystressrelief_35ca3606:

    # fr "Ack!{w=0.5}{nw}"
    fr "啊！{w=0.5}{nw}"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3321
translate chinese skystressrelief_d69cbe31:

    # fr "M-m-my face! My precious, priceless face!!"
    fr "我-我-我的脸啊！我完美无瑕，价值连城的脸啊！！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3322
translate chinese skystressrelief_c879815a:

    # fr "Do you have any idea how much my beauty routine costs?!"
    fr "你知道我每天光美容就要花多少钱吗？！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3364
translate chinese skystressrelief_9e421ccd:

    # m "Her aim is just as sharp as it was. Did she intentionally miss that second shot, or..."
    m "她的枪法还跟以前一样准。她的第二枪是故意打偏的，还是……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3376
translate chinese skystressrelief_c7b73f03:

    # m "Her only weakness is close combat. I need to find a way to get close-"
    m "她唯一的弱点就是近身战。我得想办法接近——"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3382
translate chinese skystressrelief_e83ced9f:

    # m "How are you still alive, Aoife?! After all these years, why show your face to me now?!"
    m "你怎么还活着，艾法？！过了这么多年，为什么现在又来找我？！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3384
translate chinese skystressrelief_ddcf25b3:

    # m "... You're still mouthless, I see. Why did I even bother asking?"
    m "……看来你还是不肯张口。我干嘛费事问你呢？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3407
translate chinese skystressrelief_185a66cd:

    # fr "Oh no, no, no! We have far more things in store for you."
    fr "噢，不不不！我们可是为你准备了很多东西。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3410
translate chinese skystressrelief_465cc0f8:

    # fr "Allow me to introduce you to my associate here."
    fr "向你介绍一下我的助手。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3411
translate chinese skystressrelief_a47d9c41:

    # fr "This is Malice. He's positively brilliant at extracting information. But we won't need that from you."
    fr "他叫马利斯。他在获取情报这件事上非常有天赋。不过我们不需要你的情报。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3416
translate chinese skystressrelief_00621ecd:

    # mal "I can't tell you how eager I am to take care of you."
    mal "我等不及要让你知道我有多想跟你亲密接触了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3422
translate chinese skystressrelief_65cf75fb:

    # fr "I'll leave you two to get better familiarized."
    fr "我就不打扰你们两个的私人时间了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3426
translate chinese skystressrelief_19567df8:

    # mal "With pleasure. This one seems like he'll last a while. The tough ones are always most fun to break."
    mal "非常乐意。他看起来像是能坚持挺久的样子。把结实的人弄坏总是更有意思。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3431
translate chinese skystressrelief_a0e0b637:

    # mc "You look absolute shit, by the way. Has anyone ever tell you that?"
    mc "怕你不知道跟你提一嘴，你长得就跟屎一样。没人跟你说过吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3432
translate chinese skystressrelief_c843637c:

    # mal "Oh yeah? Let's see how long you can keep that attitude up."
    mal "是吗？来看看你能保持这个态度多久。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3472
translate chinese skystressrelief_19d7897d:

    # e "No, this won't do, I'm going to find him myself!"
    e "不，这样下去不行，我要去找他！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3473
translate chinese skystressrelief_3f33d832:

    # g "Without any leads or clues? Surely you're not the type to charge ahead without plans, Em!"
    g "一点线索都没有，怎么找？你可不是那种不做计划就四处乱撞的人，小艾！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3474
translate chinese skystressrelief_4d23de83:

    # e "Then what do you propose I should do?!"
    e "那你倒是说我该怎么办啊？！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3475
translate chinese skystressrelief_624c176d:

    # g "I don't know, okay? Just stay put and wait for them to arrive!"
    g "我也不知道，行了吧？你就乖乖等着他们来就好了！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3480
translate chinese skystressrelief_b4becb3a:

    # a "Ugh..."
    a "唉……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3484
translate chinese skystressrelief_83c85bee:

    # a "EVERYBODY, SHUT THE FUCK UP! YOUR CRIES ARE NOT HELPING!"
    a "{b}各位，都他妈闭嘴！越哭越帮倒忙！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3485
translate chinese skystressrelief_efcdb1fa:

    # k "... Thank you, dear."
    k "……谢谢你，亲爱的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3496
translate chinese skystressrelief_9e964f80:

    # g "It wasn't your fault, Freya. We're just thankful you didn't get involved too. It could've been much worse."
    g "不是你的错，芙蕾雅。没有连你一起带走就已经是万幸了。不然只会糟糕得多。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3532
translate chinese skystressrelief_3eb55020:

    # f "... That Francis guy! They took him...!"
    f "……那个叫弗朗西斯的混蛋！被他们给抓走了……！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3543
translate chinese skystressrelief_cc63407b:

    # m "Why does this hurt so bad...?"
    m "为什么会这么难受……？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3544
translate chinese skystressrelief_2d38c58e:

    # m "Why?! I don't get it! This shouldn't be happening to me...!"
    m "为什么？！我不明白啊！我不应该有这种感觉的……！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3551
translate chinese skystressrelief_604a10c3:

    # m "These feelings aren't mine; they're from the one inside me. But..."
    m "这些感觉不是我的；而是属于我体内的那个人。可是……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3552
translate chinese skystressrelief_8ae4049a:

    # m "But... deep down, in my own heart... I'm desperately yearning for him..."
    m "可是……在我自己的内心深处……我也疯狂的渴望着他……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3556
translate chinese skystressrelief_3bca08b9:

    # el "I've... never seen her break down like that..."
    el "我……从来没见过她崩溃成这样……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3557
translate chinese skystressrelief_647ab5a3:

    # j "I bet no one ever has... Even herself."
    j "我想没有任何人见过……包括她自己。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3559
translate chinese skystressrelief_bbfb6161:

    # cl "But if there's one more thing that's common in all serum users, it's their conflicting emotions."
    cl "不过如果要说所有的血清使用者还有什么别的共同点的话，那就是内心冲突的情感。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3560
translate chinese skystressrelief_46e44e40:

    # cl "It's an intensely complicated feeling where you experience multiple emotions in the very same moment."
    cl "在同一时刻感到好几种不同的情绪，是种非常复杂的感觉。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3569
translate chinese skystressrelief_2ca11930:

    # j "Thanks to Freya's swift actions, we were alerted immediately."
    j "多亏了芙蕾雅行动及时，我们第一时间就接到了通知。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3572
translate chinese skystressrelief_e6d57eb8:

    # el "Come on, Fang. I'll show you something."
    el "来吧，獠牙。我有东西给你看。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3575
translate chinese skystressrelief_d3567be3:

    # el "Uh, if I may."
    el "呃，大家请听我说。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3579
translate chinese skystressrelief_ef4f89c4:

    # el "Take a look at this..."
    el "你们看一下这个……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3580
translate chinese skystressrelief_5fffe434:

    # el "By leveraging my comprehensive integration with the urban closed-circuit television network architecture, I methodically derived the vehicular trajectory employing advanced tracking algorithms."
    el "通过充分利用我对城市闭路电视网络架构的了解，我系统地利用先进追踪算法推导出了车辆的行动轨迹。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3585
translate chinese skystressrelief_fd065d84:

    # el "Oh, sorry."
    el "噢，抱歉。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3588
translate chinese skystressrelief_a08a52ee:

    # el "Well, I tapped into the city's CCTV network and managed to track their van."
    el "嗯，我看了那一片的监控，找到了那辆车。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3589
translate chinese skystressrelief_ba54a2ce:

    # el "Based on their last known location, he's here."
    el "根据他们最后的已知地点来看，他在这里。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3593
translate chinese skystressrelief_55973e71:

    # el "Yeah!"
    el "是的！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3594
translate chinese skystressrelief_f4c92683:

    # shu "And the government doesn't know this?"
    shu "而政府毫不知情？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3595
translate chinese skystressrelief_bd706937:

    # el "Nope!"
    el "没错！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3600
translate chinese skystressrelief_f808362c:

    # el "That area lacks CCTV coverage, but given the layout, there's only one way in and out. They must have taken him there."
    el "那个区域没有摄像头，不过根据这布局来看，出入口只有一个。他们肯定是把他带到那里去了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3601
translate chinese skystressrelief_6c9d92b9:

    # el "I'm currently monitoring all nearby cameras, so if they move, we'll catch it."
    el "我现在正在盯着附近所有的摄像头，如果他们移动了的话，我们也能第一时间知道。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3613
translate chinese skystressrelief_25e4b86c:

    # j "Stand back."
    j "不要动。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3641
translate chinese skystressrelief_2c863a78:

    # j "No, let them be."
    j "没事，由她们去吧。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3642
translate chinese skystressrelief_7358efc4:

    # j "Once they clash, no one can stop them. Not even us in the Agency."
    j "一旦她们吵起来，谁也拦不住。就连我们机构里的人也做不到。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3643
translate chinese skystressrelief_68a64d69:

    # k "But, I can't just..."
    k "可是，我总不能就这样……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3644
translate chinese skystressrelief_65265fdf:

    # j "Don't worry. It takes a beast to tame another."
    j "不用担心。要驯服一头野兽，就需要另一头野兽。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3662
translate chinese skystressrelief_1e79cbcc:

    # m "Get your hands off me."
    m  "别碰我。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3667
translate chinese skystressrelief_657f3de5:

    # a "I mean, I get it, but still...!"
    a "我明白，可是……！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3671
translate chinese skystressrelief_b216fd52:

    # j "She's always been uncertain of what she wants to do. But for once, she's making a choice on her own."
    j "她总是搞不明白自己想做什么。但是这次，是她自己做出的选择。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3686
translate chinese skystressrelief_677f6279:

    # j "I understand. Do what you think is best. I entrust them to you."
    j "我明白了。你就按你想的做吧。我把他们交给你了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3689
translate chinese skystressrelief_fea2c2f1:

    # k "I hate my powerlessness, but, Aine, please... bring them back safely."
    k "我真恨现在无能为力的自己……艾妮，拜托……一定要把他们平安带回来。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3690
translate chinese skystressrelief_e283546b:

    # a "I will. You have my word."
    a "我会的。我向你保证。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3735
translate chinese skystressrelief_3fe7d942:

    # yt "I just wanted answers, to understand why the world could be so cruel and unfair..."
    yt "我只想要答案，想弄清楚为什么这个世界会如此残酷、不公平……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3739
translate chinese skystressrelief_d5aa7aaf:

    # yt "I have to find out the truth, to make sense of all this. Even if it hurts..."
    yt "我一定要找到真相，要理解这一切，哪怕会如此痛苦……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3749
translate chinese skystressrelief_77087595:

    # mal "Ah, there you are! Back from a little dream world, are we?"
    mal "啊，你醒了！从梦幻世界里回来了？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3750
translate chinese skystressrelief_d45a0cea:

    # mal "You know, you're quite a fascinating case. Most people would have broken by now, but not you."
    mal "知道吗，你真是挺厉害的。一般人到这种时候都已经不行了，但你不一样。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3752
translate chinese skystressrelief_bbb03943:

    # mal "But I can see it in your eyes: the desperation, the fear. You're wondering how long you can hold out. Isn't that so?"
    mal "但是我能在你的眼睛里看到绝望和恐惧。你在想你到底还能撑多久，对吧？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3757
translate chinese skystressrelief_1b52f1fe:

    # mal "And I've got a very {i}special{/i} treat for you..."
    mal "而且我还给你准备了一个非常特别的{i}惊喜{/i}……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3766
translate chinese skystressrelief_708b84b7:

    # mal "So, go ahead. Cling to your precious truth, your pathetic hopes. They'll only make your fall that much sweeter."
    mal "所以你就继续为了你那宝贵的真相，为了你那可悲的希望坚持下去吧。这样只会让你最终的崩溃更加甜美啊。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3769
translate chinese skystressrelief_cf2f16ae:

    # mal "Now, let's see how long you can last in the cold embrace of my affection, yeah?"
    mal "好了，来看看你能在我冰冷爱意的怀抱里坚持多久吧。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3812
translate chinese skystressrelief_9e9437d2:

    # cl "You can try to be a bodyguard... {w}a savior..."
    cl "你大可以去扮演保镖……{w}扮演救星……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3813
translate chinese skystressrelief_a4557f81:

    # cl "... {b}A lover{/b}."
    cl "……扮演成{b}情人{/b}。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3818
translate chinese skystressrelief_f7dabbde:

    # cl "Yet there is a truth that clings to you, one that you cannot simply forget..."
    cl "但是，赤裸裸的事实会永远跟着你，你怎么也摆脱不掉……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3826
translate chinese skystressrelief_83aa7673:

    # cl "Please, save the dramatics. You forfeited the right to sympathy the moment you walked onto your path."
    cl "省省吧。从你选择了这条路那天开始，就已经没有得到同情的资格了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3834
translate chinese skystressrelief_ee708204:

    # m "After all, you're not any different than me."
    m "说到底，你跟我也没有什么区别。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3935
translate chinese skystressrelief_b5bb2d3f:

    # m "I'm confused. Why not shoot? I'm right here."
    m "我不明白。为什么不开枪？我就在这。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3952
translate chinese skystressrelief_8f4b01cf:

    # m "{i}I wonder, how will she-"
    m "{i}不知道她会怎么——"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3954
translate chinese skystressrelief_4e4d56c1:

    # ao "I've always thought: Why does it have to be like this...? Why couldn't you guys join my side...?"
    ao "我总是在想：为什么非这样不可……？为什么你们就不能和我站在一边呢……？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3969
translate chinese skystressrelief_ba7baf81:

    # ao "But enough of the past... I'm not here to cram years of backstory in a few sentences..."
    ao "不过过去的事聊得够多了……那么多年的故事几句话也说不完……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3981
translate chinese skystressrelief_2eb524ac:

    # ao "When I heard you were still alive, I took every chance I could get just to look for you..."
    ao "我听说你还活着之后，就用尽一切办法找你……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3986
translate chinese skystressrelief_81524c53:

    # ao "Our pasts no longer matter... Right now, this is a fight of vengeance..."
    ao "我们的过去已经无关紧要了……现在，这是复仇者之间的战斗……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3988
translate chinese skystressrelief_37407e33:

    # ao "Only when I choose to open up... But you know, I really {i}hate{/i} that word..."
    ao "只有在我愿意的时候才会这样……不过，我真的很讨厌那个词……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4005
translate chinese skystressrelief_c2af3f3a:

    # m "{i}Regardless, I have no way to counter her bullets at a distance. My best chance is still up close. I have to keep the distance tight."
    m "{i}不管怎么说，我在远距离的情况下都不可能对付她的子弹。最好的办法依然是近身。我得靠近她。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4007
translate chinese skystressrelief_64ead6fe:

    # ao "We were created with specific abilities, but that doesn't mean we can't learn new ones, Four..."
    ao "我们被创造出来的时候各有不同的专长，但这不代表我们不能学新的本领，四号……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4042
translate chinese skystressrelief_f0a2305a:

    # ao "Goodbye, Moon..."
    ao "再见了，月……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4047
translate chinese skystressrelief_d456f712:

    # ao "Khhhkkk!"
    ao "……！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4081
translate chinese skystressrelief_b940f300:

    # lu "Whoops!"
    lu "哎呀，疼！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4095
translate chinese skystressrelief_8519a14d:

    # lu "But you know, the moon is a solitary sentinel, always hangs alone in the night sky."
    lu "因为月亮是个孤独的卫星，总是孤零零地挂在夜空里。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4096
translate chinese skystressrelief_78cee68d:

    # lu "Independent of the twinkling stars that keep it company."
    lu "跟宇宙里其他闪闪发光的星星都没有关系。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4097
translate chinese skystressrelief_ea69bde4:

    # lu "Right now, you're a lightless moon, but one day, you will eventually find your sun that will make you shine. I really believe that."
    lu "现在，你还是一个不会发光的月亮，但是总有一天，你会找到能让你闪亮的太阳的。一定会的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4101
translate chinese skystressrelief_8c719673:

    # er "I'll never understand your sense of pride."
    er "我永远也理解不了你这莫名其妙的骄傲是哪来的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4103
translate chinese skystressrelief_f3457243_1:

    # m "Aoife."
    m "艾法。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4106
translate chinese skystressrelief_b555b63a_1:

    # m "Her name should be Aoife."
    m "就叫她艾法吧。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4130
translate chinese skystressrelief_31ba3399_1:

    # mc "I'm not saying you have to forgive her. But if there's a chance to stop the fighting, don't let it pass by."
    mc "我不是说让你原谅她。可是如果有机会结束战斗的话，就不要错过。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4136
translate chinese skystressrelief_3e3207b3:

    # m "Sometimes, I wonder if this is really what Lumi, Erma, or even One would have wanted—us fighting over what's left of their memories. Over their long-lifeless bodies."
    m "有时候我会想，这一切战斗，厮杀，为了他们留下的记忆，为了他们早就没了生命的尸体争个你死我活——这真的是卢米，伊尔玛，甚至是一号想要的吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4139
translate chinese skystressrelief_9114e138:

    # m "Every year, we mourn their deaths, the pain comes back."
    m "每一年，我们都为他们的死哀悼，与之相伴的痛苦也就阴魂不散。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4141
translate chinese skystressrelief_d3b50ae4:

    # m "And if they could see us now, I'm sure Lumi and Erma would do everything to stop us."
    m "如果她们能看到这一切的话，我想卢米和伊尔玛一定会全力阻止我们的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4181
translate chinese skystressrelief_f9f763fd:

    # bo "Reviving the dead seemed like an impossible dream. Yet, I never ceased in my pursuit."
    bo "起死回生似乎是永远无法实现的妄想。不过，我从来没有停下脚步。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4193
translate chinese skystressrelief_bc6b9ae8:

    # bo "With their backing and financial assistance, I searched every corner of the world for individuals with remarkable histories."
    bo "凭借着他们的支持和金钱援助，我走遍了全世界，寻找曾经青史留名的伟大人物。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4196
translate chinese skystressrelief_abf2e939:

    # bo "Ahh... Emperor Kaito and Lady Sora. A truly fascinating piece of history."
    bo "啊……国王海人和空姬。历史上的一段佳话。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4200
translate chinese skystressrelief_e1c12b3c:

    # bo "But on the battlefield, your connection could have become a liability."
    bo "但是在战场上，这就未必是一件好事了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4201
translate chinese skystressrelief_f05f1d8a:

    # bo "Considering how Kaito protected Sora, I knew Sora would never allow that to happen again, disrupting the patterns of your creation."
    bo "海人是为保护空而死，我知道空绝对不会允许这种事再次发生。这就违背了你们的设计目的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4207
translate chinese skystressrelief_de0c3ae1:

    # bo "[mc] deliberately planned this and made Francis dance in his palm. All to discover our location."
    bo "[mc!t]故意策划了今天的事，把弗朗西斯耍得团团转。都是为了找到我们的藏身处。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4208
translate chinese skystressrelief_9534b227:

    # bo "To end this once and for all."
    bo "为了一次性地解决一切。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4209
translate chinese skystressrelief_b6705c2b:

    # bo "I commend his strong will to pull this off, but he will die for you in exchange for all this information, Moon Chi. There's no escaping that fate."
    bo "我钦佩他能够做到这些事的坚强意志，但作为代价，他会为你而死，气月。这是他无法逃脱的命运。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4211
translate chinese skystressrelief_bd6cd284:

    # m "{i}I knew your plan was too convenient for me to believe. So, all that was just to put our minds at ease?"
    m "{i}我就知道你的计划太过想当然了。原来那都只是为了让我们安心而已？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4220
translate chinese skystressrelief_50cc3772:

    # m "What you've told me isn't enough, and killing you would be an act of mercy. Instead, I'm going to take you into Sicae's custody."
    m "你还有太多东西没交代清楚，杀了你都算是便宜你了。我要把你带回西卡关起来。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4226
translate chinese skystressrelief_48db2fba:

    # m "However, I'll make sure you lose the remnants of your sanity."
    m "不过呢，我保证，我一定会把你折磨得痛不欲生的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4233
translate chinese skystressrelief_485f402b:

    # m "So, where's your god now?"
    m "现在不扯什么神的力量了？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4249
translate chinese skystressrelief_843e973a:

    # mal "You see, it seems your precious little girlfriend has decided to play the heroine."
    mal "其实呢，好像是你的小女朋友来当英雄了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4260
translate chinese skystressrelief_cb803f28:

    # mal "Ah, there's that spirit! That fire, that anger! I was wondering if I'd see any left in you."
    mal "啊，就是这样！就是这种熊熊燃烧的怒火。我还以为我再也看不见你的反抗了呢。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4264
translate chinese skystressrelief_79b519b8:

    # mal "Big words from a man who can't even stand. But by all means, keep struggling. It makes victory that much sweeter."
    mal "连站都站不起来，还真敢说啊。不过请便，继续挣扎吧。只会让最终的胜利更加甜美。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4265
translate chinese skystressrelief_7a703f4a:

    # mal "And when she's finally broken, she'll know just how much of a failure you were."
    mal "等她终于坏掉之后，她就会明白你到底有多无能了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4269
translate chinese skystressrelief_d24619eb:

    # mal "*laughs* Oh ho ho... I'm going to enjoy my time with her!"
    mal "*大笑* 啊哈哈……那我要玩得超级开心了！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4270
translate chinese skystressrelief_04867a3e:

    # mal "And you... will watch every single second of me exploring her depths!"
    mal "而你呢……就好好看着我慢慢享用她的身体吧！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4284
translate chinese skystressrelief_a2ed7b18:

    # m "What am I? Sounds like something I could answer..."
    m "什么怪物？这我倒可以回答你……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4289
translate chinese skystressrelief_222d4dba:

    # mc "We were sailing smoothly back there, but you know, I don't take any threats to my girls so kindly..."
    mc "之前的事都只是小打小闹，不过呢，敢威胁我的女人，那我可不会随便就算了……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4306
translate chinese skystressrelief_442cb33c:

    # mc "I told you, didn't I? I'll rip you apart with my..."
    mc "我说过吧？我要亲手……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4307
translate chinese skystressrelief_c426e149:

    # mc "Bare..."
    mc "把你……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4309
translate chinese skystressrelief_307ac594:

    # mc "{b}Hands{/b}."
    mc "{b}撕碎{/b}。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4313
translate chinese skystressrelief_33dc36d9:

    # mal "I... enough... plea-"
    mal "我……别打了……求——"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4341
translate chinese skystressrelief_61507b49:

    # m "I know it hurts, I know you're tired, but you have to stay alive!"
    m "我知道很疼，我知道你很累了，但是你绝对不能死！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4365
translate chinese skystressrelief_a5263f0e:

    # m "I took one of these back in the war. It may hurt, so if you can somehow hear me, please brace yourself!"
    m "这是我以前在战场上用过的东西。可能会很疼，你要是能听到我的话，就把全身绷紧点！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4388
translate chinese skystressrelief_1d8ff99b:

    # mar "I apologize, but she didn't mention anything about her destination."
    mar "很抱歉，她完全没有提过她要去哪里。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4392
translate chinese skystressrelief_df6b2823:

    # a "... Actually, I'll put you in charge of what's left of the group for the time being. Make sure everyone has food and receives equal treatment."
    a "……组织里还能运作的部分的事就先暂时交给你来处理。要让大家都吃得上饭，待遇平等。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4396
translate chinese skystressrelief_e94ddf37:

    # j "Yes, your mother had good intentions. She had no desire for power."
    j "是的，你妈妈是一片好意，她丝毫不贪图权力。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4405
translate chinese skystressrelief_8d223aeb:

    # j "We get to address unfinished business, and you gain more chances to secure the peace you wanted."
    j "既可以让我们把遗留的工作做完，也能让你们更快迎来你们想要的平静生活。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4408
translate chinese skystressrelief_e23fe900:

    # j "That being said, I can only offer limited personal support. I can't officially work on your behalf."
    j "话虽这么说，我也只能提供一些有限的私人帮助。我没法在明面上给你干活。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4416
translate chinese skystressrelief_5355e156:

    # a "I thought it would only be a game of cat and mouse; I never expected things to become this heavy... but he did..."
    a "我一开始以为这只会是个猫捉老鼠的游戏；我从来没想过事情会变得这么沉重……但是他想到了……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4417
translate chinese skystressrelief_389e76d2:

    # a "Now that this all happened, I realize he anticipated things all along."
    a "在一切都发生之后，我才意识到他从一开始就预料到了这些。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4429
translate chinese skystressrelief_a6b065e7:

    # k "I knew that silence was saying more than his words could..."
    k "我就知道那时候的沉默别有深意……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4438
translate chinese skystressrelief_998b9272:

    # j "*sighs* Not to throw everything at you, but there's both good and bad news."
    j "*叹气* 既有好消息，也有坏消息。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4442
translate chinese skystressrelief_22bc3c4e:

    # j "Yes, the serum. It's the same with Fang, Lance, and Claire. They always heal a bit faster than normal people."
    j "对，是血清。跟獠牙，长矛还有克莱尔的情况是一样的。他们恢复的速度比常人快。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4449
translate chinese skystressrelief_28ed9566:

    # k "How... How is this all possible? The serum, its wonders, risks... How can such a thing even exist?"
    k "这……这怎么可能呢？这个血清，这么厉害，又有这么大的风险……这种东西怎么会存在？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4454
translate chinese skystressrelief_3f5b4b32:

    # j "Going back to [mc]'s case... He's healing, but all we can do is wait, and hope for the best."
    j "说回[mc!t]的情况……他正在恢复，但我们能做的只有乖乖等着，希望没有意外出现。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4455
translate chinese skystressrelief_bb8e4b4e_8:

    # a "..."
    a "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4457
translate chinese skystressrelief_e4447e7a:

    # j "Ah, you shouldn't worry about her. She was built to last."
    j "啊，不用担心她。她结实得很。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4461
translate chinese skystressrelief_83d71c9f:

    # j "Now that we know who they are, if possible, let's allow them to keep their pasts to themselves."
    j "虽然我们都知道他们的真实身份了，不过还是尽量不要在他们面前提起吧。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4476
translate chinese skystressrelief_db1c1fd7:

    # a "I have so much to tell you, [mc]. So you'd better wake up soon."
    a "我有好多话想对你说，[mc!t]。快点醒过来吧。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4498
translate chinese skystressrelief_682172ab:

    # shu "... I've prepared a lot for you, so try not to keep me waiting for too long."
    shu "……我给你准备了很多东西，可别让我等太久啊。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4500
translate chinese skystressrelief_04c1afda:

    # shu "*wheeze* Actually, scratch that! I've still got a few hours here, so you're stuck with me and my magnificence!!"
    shu "算了，撤回！我还有几个小时的时间，你就继续好好欣赏我的美貌吧！！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4501
translate chinese skystressrelief_40fe2948:

    # shu "That's right! Yours truly will be by your side, using my eloquent words to nurse you back to health!"
    shu "没错！小爷我会陪着你，用我这滔滔不绝的三寸不烂之舌把你给治好！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4502
translate chinese skystressrelief_cfbfd091:

    # shu "Well, until they kick me out... but anyway, where were we?"
    shu "呃，直到我被医生和护士赶出去为止……不过不想这个了，我们刚才说到哪了？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4510
translate chinese skystressrelief_0ae9bcd0:

    # ""
    ""

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4514
translate chinese skystressrelief_547cdf44:

    # g "You never forced us to be with you: it was our choice. Our lives were never your cross to bear."
    g "你从来没有强迫过我们跟你在一起；那都是我们自己的选择。你根本不用背负我们的人生。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4516
translate chinese skystressrelief_8777b346:

    # g "It's over now--you did it."
    g "现在都结束了——你成功了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4517
translate chinese skystressrelief_2bae719b:

    # g "So please, don't ever do anything like that again, okay?"
    g "所以，拜托你，以后不要再做那种事了，好吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4518
translate chinese skystressrelief_8c5e0e0a:

    # g "Emma's done with the Winters' case, so she'll be able to visit you tomorrow."
    g "艾玛已经解决完温特斯家的事了，所以她明天就能来看你了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4528
translate chinese skystressrelief_6ff889f9:

    # e "But that's exactly what you would've told me to do, right?"
    e "不过这肯定也是你希望我做的，对吧？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4532
translate chinese skystressrelief_75157b27:

    # e "You never needed to prove yourself as a hero, [mc]. In my eyes, you've always been one."
    e "你从来都不需要证明自己是英雄，[mc!t]。在我眼里，你一直都是英雄。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4533
translate chinese skystressrelief_287f5385:

    # e "Without you, I can't even begin to imagine where I'd be right now."
    e "要是没有你，我都不知道现在的我会是什么样子。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4534
translate chinese skystressrelief_6a1edb2f:

    # e "Yes, our journey to get to where we are today has been filled with tears, with both of us giving up so much."
    e "我们至今为止的经历的确充满了泪水，我们两个都失去了很多。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4535
translate chinese skystressrelief_2fcdef5e:

    # e "But don't forget that I'm by your side just as much as you've been by mine."
    e "但是不要忘记，我会一直陪着你，就像你一直陪着我一样。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4549
translate chinese skystressrelief_4f86a9eb:

    # s "We lost [landlord], now [mc]'s like this..."
    s "[landlord!t]已经不在了，他又成了这样……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4551
translate chinese skystressrelief_23027a28:

    # k "Don't say that, Sky. He'll wake up, he has to."
    k "别这么说，斯凯。他会醒的，一定会。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4552
translate chinese skystressrelief_997279aa:

    # k "But right now, we've got to hold onto hope."
    k "我们现在绝对不能放弃希望。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4580
translate chinese skystressrelief_c17e3262:

    # f "You had me scared shit out of my mind, do you know that?"
    f "你可是把我吓坏了，你知不知道啊？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4584
translate chinese skystressrelief_eeaf836a:

    # f "Yeah, she's fine, but she's been a bit hesitant to see you. Can't figure out why, though..."
    f "她情况很好，但就是不太想来看你。搞不明白是为什么……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4585
translate chinese skystressrelief_0d4253b0:

    # f "Seeing her tears filled with blood like that, man, I was speechless. I've never seen anything like it."
    f "看她眼里流那么多血出来，天呐，我都说不出话来。我从来没见过这种事。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4594
translate chinese skystressrelief_9eed3e6d:

    # m "I experienced her heartache over losing Emperor Kaito firsthand. It makes me wonder... have you seen Kaito's memories too?"
    m "我亲身体会到了她失去海人时的那股心痛。于是我就在想……你是不是也看到了海人的记忆呢？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4599
translate chinese skystressrelief_7eb7b045:

    # m "Lying there, unconscious, I know you can't respond, but I have to tell you... I have to let out these feelings that aren't only Lady Sora's, but mine as well."
    m "你就这么静静地躺着，我知道你没法回答，但我必须告诉你……我必须发泄出这些感情，不仅是空的感情，也是我的感情……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4600
translate chinese skystressrelief_e2f17a11:

    # m "In these memories, I feel Sora's love for Kaito. It's so deep that it transcends time itself."
    m "我从那些记忆里感受到了空对海人的爱，那份感情真挚到超越了时间。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4601
translate chinese skystressrelief_d02bed19:

    # m "And standing by your side, I understand that love because I feel it too."
    m "现在，我在你身边，我理解了那份爱，因为我心里也有一样的感觉。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4602
translate chinese skystressrelief_d1ec8a86:

    # m "It's not only because of the memories or the feelings passed down to me: it's because of who you are, and the time we've spent together."
    m "不只是因为那些被传递给我的感情与记忆。是因为你就是你，是因为我们一起度过的时间。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4625
translate chinese skystressrelief_94e1f9f6:

    # mc "I was conscious, but couldn't move or even open my eyes..."
    mc "我一直都清醒着，只是没法控制身体，连眼睛都睁不开……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4634
translate chinese skystressrelief_a07698ec:

    # m "Now that we have you as proof, I'm sure of it."
    m "没错，现在有你的情况当做证据，我很确定了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4635
translate chinese skystressrelief_10560b51:

    # mc "Everything felt... normal. Nothing changed, yet I knew I could do things I couldn't do before..."
    mc "我感觉一切都很……正常。没有什么变化，可是我很清楚我能做到我以前做不到的事了……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4642
translate chinese skystressrelief_d4f6c163:

    # m "Just remember, we aren't immortal. We age and will eventually die. Don't let your abilities get to your head, and you'll be fine."
    m "只要记住，我们也不是不会死就行了。我们一样会变老，最终死掉。只要别太得意忘形就不会有问题的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4679
translate chinese skystressrelief_6ebd72b4:

    # mc "It's been a long time. Did you two get along?"
    mc "已经过了好久了。你们俩能好好相处吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4681
translate chinese skystressrelief_6a13a7a1:

    # shu "So come on! I'll drive us there!"
    shu "走吧走吧！我开车！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4690
translate chinese skystressrelief_187e5d02:

    # mc "So are we just going to leave our old place behind?"
    mc "所以旧房子就这么丢掉不管了？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4693
translate chinese skystressrelief_bb37f4cb:

    # k "It will always hold a special place in our hearts."
    k "那个地方永远都会在我们的心里。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4698
translate chinese skystressrelief_ba7f2ab8:

    # s "You had us all worried!"
    s "你让我们都担心死了！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4711
translate chinese skystressrelief_48b05cbb:

    # mc "Give us some time. I know we have a lot to sort out in the aftermath, but right now, she's my priority."
    mc "给我们俩一点时间吧。我知道这事还有很多余波要处理，但眼下我最在意她的事。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4744
translate chinese skystressrelief_53ddefa1:

    # mc "... All this time, we've been pondering our relationship, whether it's driven by those experiences from our past lives, or the ones we have now."
    mc "……一直以来，我们都在琢磨我们的关系，前世的关系，还有现在的关系。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4745
translate chinese skystressrelief_48e69c33:

    # mc "We didn't know the answer, and we didn't know what to do with it."
    mc "我们不知道答案是什么，不知道该做什么才好。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4746
translate chinese skystressrelief_18738b5c:

    # mc "But now, I realize... What we needed has been with us this whole time..."
    mc "但是，我现在明白了……我们需要的东西一直以来都近在眼前……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4747
translate chinese skystressrelief_0e6b41da:

    # mc "Our connection isn't in our minds: it's in our hearts."
    mc "我们的联系不是在脑子里，而是在心里。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4749
translate chinese skystressrelief_7055b556:

    # mc "That's right, don't think about it. Just let our hearts dictate everything from here."
    mc "没错，不要去想。从今往后只要把一切都交给内心去决定就好。"

translate chinese strings:

    # game/ch1ep4.rpy:4732
    old "There's nothing more beautiful..."
    new "再美也美不过你……"

# TODO: Translation updated at 2024-06-03 22:23

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4032
translate chinese skystressrelief_95cf7507:

    # ao "I've always wondered: Why does it have to be like this...? Why couldn't you simply join my side...?"
    ao "我总是想不明白：为什么非这样不可……？为什么你们就不能和我站在一边呢……？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4051
translate chinese skystressrelief_26f1a0fb:

    # m "{b}{i}Your{/i}{/b} friends."
    m "也是{b}{i}你的{/i}{/b}朋友。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4076
translate chinese skystressrelief_d0198fdd:

    # m "What do you want from us?! Why join them?!" with hpunch
    m "你到底有什么目的？！为什么要加入他们？！" with hpunch

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4147
translate chinese skystressrelief_4d4c5781:

    # m "{i}But my Iaido uses a little distance to emphasize power. I can't rely on it. I need to switch to Kendo."
    m "{i}但是我平常用的居合道流派就是要拉开一点距离才有威力。现在不能用了。我得用普通的剑道。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4157
translate chinese skystressrelief_dae578ab:

    # m "You're right, and I don't have time for you. I'm ending this now..."
    m "你说得对，我也没时间在你身上浪费了。现在就结束吧……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4169
translate chinese skystressrelief_39f62add:

    # m "What defense?"
    m "什么防御手段？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4261
translate chinese skystressrelief_d6732530:

    # ao "I will dictate my own fate...!"
    ao "我的命运由我自己决定……！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4303
translate chinese skystressrelief_c14e5d90:

    # un "Aoife."
    un "艾法。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4304
translate chinese skystressrelief_223edfb9:

    # un "Her name should be Aoife."
    un "就叫她艾法吧。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4327
translate chinese skystressrelief_20e0aecd:

    # ao "... Thank you... for giving me my name..." with Dissolve(2.0)
    ao "……谢谢你……给了我这个名字……" with Dissolve(2.0)

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4387
translate chinese skystressrelief_1219198a:

    # lu "Now it's your turn to be reborn!"
    lu "现在轮到你重获新生了！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4418
translate chinese skystressrelief_224496d8:

    # er "I'll never understand your sense of pride, woman."
    er "我永远也理解不了你这莫名其妙的骄傲是哪来的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4421
translate chinese skystressrelief_08a78ca7:

    # lu "And lastly, Two-{w=1.0}{nw}"
    lu "那还有最后一个，二号——{w=1.0}{nw}"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4464
translate chinese skystressrelief_b8eb34c1:

    # m "So that's why you..."
    m "所以你才……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4465
translate chinese skystressrelief_ff403dac:

    # m "... You never intended to kill me..."
    m "……你根本就不想杀我……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4466
translate chinese skystressrelief_abcfede5:

    # ao "I'm... all tired of this, too... Moon..."
    ao "我……也已经厌倦这一切了……月……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4490
translate chinese skystressrelief_9f849485:

    # m "I refuse to be chained by grievances, or to be forced to do something against my will anymore, so I will choose for myself."
    m "我不想再被仇恨束缚，不想再被逼着做不想做的事。所以我要为我自己做出选择。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4496
translate chinese skystressrelief_5cf1e337:

    # m "He's all that matters to me now, Aoife. I don't care about anything else."
    m "他是我现在唯一在乎的人，艾法。其他任何事我都不会放在心上。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4504
translate chinese skystressrelief_3a9b9d01:

    # m "You said you get to dictate your fate, but I disagree."
    m "你刚刚说你的命运由你自己决定，我不同意。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4505
translate chinese skystressrelief_d7272ca2:

    # m "The fact that you're still alive, means there's still something you can and must do."
    m "只要你还活着，就代表你有能做的事，和必须做的事。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4506
translate chinese skystressrelief_db1c58e3:

    # m "Find another purpose and live, just like I did. It's not the end yet, Aoife."
    m "你就和我一样，找到新的目标，然后继续活下去吧。还没有到终点，艾法。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4507
translate chinese skystressrelief_47d10809:

    # ao "You really are... such a kind girl..."
    ao "你真是个……善良的人……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4508
translate chinese skystressrelief_a394019a:

    # ao "How can you be so...-"
    ao "你怎么能如此……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4509
translate chinese skystressrelief_56f4b23c:

    # ao "No, nevermind that... What's your plan from here...?"
    ao "不，算了……你接下来打算怎么办……？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4524
translate chinese skystressrelief_a80027c9:

    # ao "Moon...!"
    ao "月……！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4525
translate chinese skystressrelief_7a5c1899:

    # m "Yes?"
    m "怎么了？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4526
translate chinese skystressrelief_598cfad7:

    # ao "Let's talk about the past properly... the next time we meet again..."
    ao "我们下次见面的时候……就好好聊聊过去的事吧……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4527
translate chinese skystressrelief_24f8a350:

    # ao "No guns, no blades. Just our hearts."
    ao "没有剑拔弩张，没有针锋相对……只有两颗真心。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4528
translate chinese skystressrelief_3f841853:

    # ao "I'll look forward to that day."
    ao "我期待着那一天早日到来。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4536
translate chinese skystressrelief_47d10809_1:

    # ao "You really are... such a kind girl..."
    ao "你真是个……善良的人……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4635
translate chinese skystressrelief_973cf611:

    # bo "Now then, what will you do? Should you entertain me-{w=2.0}{nw}"
    bo "好了，你打算怎么办？你要满足我——{w=2.0}{nw}"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4647
translate chinese skystressrelief_614ee048:

    # bo "You think you can—{w=1.0}{nw}"
    bo "你以为你能——{w=1.0}{nw}"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4675
translate chinese skystressrelief_6afbacc2:

    # m "Puny god."
    m "好弱的神。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4719
translate chinese skystressrelief_5700c6db:

    # mc "No...! Moon...! I won't let you touch her!"
    mc "不……！月……！我不会让你碰她的！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4747
translate chinese skystressrelief_cc411c05:

    # mc "For someone who's supposed to be interrogating me... you talk too much..."
    mc "你一个理应该审问我的人……废话真是多……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4748
translate chinese skystressrelief_c7d809a6:

    # mc "You... and everyone in this goddamned organization... are all idiots..."
    mc "你……还有这个狗屁组织里的所有人……全都是傻逼……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4778
translate chinese skystressrelief_25bc8674:

    # mc "What am I? Sounds like something I could answer..."
    mc "什么怪物？这我倒可以回答你……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4827
translate chinese skystressrelief_92e63868:

    # mal "I... enough... plea-{w=0.5}{nw}"
    mal "我……别打了……求——{w=0.5}{nw}"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4831
translate chinese skystressrelief_6abaa6bd:

    # mal "I-{w=0.5}{nw}"
    mal "我——{w=0.5}{nw}"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4835
translate chinese skystressrelief_6067193c:

    # mal "Plea-{w=0.5}{nw}"
    mal "求——{w=0.5}{nw}"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4964
translate chinese skystressrelief_68a1b64d:

    # m "Hnn! Hnng! Hnnh! Hnnh!"
    m "你可以的！挺住！加油啊！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4970
translate chinese skystressrelief_987d3101:

    # m "Hnn! Hnng! Hnnh! Hnnh! Hnnh!"
    m "我会救你的！你绝对不能死！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5017
translate chinese skystressrelief_18183907:

    # a "{i}What on earth happened here...?"
    a "{i}这里究竟发生了什么……？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5018
translate chinese skystressrelief_7c009680:

    # a "{i}She did this... all by herself?!"
    a "{i}这些全都是……她自己一个人干的？！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5034
translate chinese skystressrelief_4baa1b4e:

    # a "... Thank you. You can rest now. I'll take care of the rest."
    a "……谢谢你。你可以休息了。剩下的都交给我吧。"

# TODO: Translation updated at 2024-06-09 16:28

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2481
translate chinese skystressrelief_d2bc72b0:

    # av "..."
    av "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2484
translate chinese skystressrelief_0afde842:

    # av "Yes, brother... I would be more than inclined..."
    av "好的，哥哥……我非常乐意……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3622
translate chinese skystressrelief_e54ce139:

    # av "Really now?"
    av "你认真的？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3624
translate chinese skystressrelief_a209097c:

    # av "Stand down? This isn't the military, Fang."
    av "待命？你还以为你在军队里啊，獠牙？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3810
translate chinese skystressrelief_66634481:

    # av "You can run as far as you like, but escaping who you are is impossible. You've taken thousands of lives."
    av "不管你逃多远，都不可能逃避你自己。你夺走过千百条生命。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3811
translate chinese skystressrelief_a2efc24b:

    # av "Struggle as you might to distance yourself from your past, it won't change a thing."
    av "不管你再怎么远离你的过去，也什么都不会改变。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3812
translate chinese skystressrelief_dcede4ac:

    # av "You can try to be a bodyguard... {w}a savior..."
    av "你大可以去扮演保镖……扮演救星……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3813
translate chinese skystressrelief_fe91ffa6:

    # av "... {b}A lover{/b}."
    av "……扮演成{b}情人{/b}。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3818
translate chinese skystressrelief_f262e151:

    # av "Yet there is a truth that clings to you, one that you cannot simply forget..."
    av "但是，赤裸裸的事实会永远跟着你，你怎么也摆脱不掉……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3819
translate chinese skystressrelief_8c3ec70a:

    # av "Despite your efforts, you cannot erase the fact that you are..."
    av "不管你再怎么努力，你也没法否认你是个……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3822
translate chinese skystressrelief_16285bec:

    # av "A monster..."
    av "怪物……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3826
translate chinese skystressrelief_3d977f41:

    # av "Please, save the dramatics. You forfeited the right to sympathy the moment you walked onto your path."
    av "省省吧。从你选择了这条路那天开始，就已经没有得到同情的资格了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3827
translate chinese skystressrelief_4ce494c9:

    # av "And now, [mc] is in peril because of your mistake, the one soul who managed to look beyond the monster that you are..."
    av "现在，[mc!t]，唯一一个能不把你当怪物看待的人……也因为你的失误，生命垂危。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3829
translate chinese skystressrelief_aba44794:

    # av "You'd better. Should death come to him, you'll find yourself drowning in blame."
    av "你最好说到做到。如果死神带走了他，你就要被骂名淹没了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3838
translate chinese skystressrelief_755665f9:

    # av "*chuckles*"
    av "*笑*"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5057
translate chinese skystressrelief_d35fe8a1:

    # a "Why didn't you guys help her then? You and your crew are more than capable to take on her problems."
    a "那你们为什么不帮她？你们的人有足够的能力帮她解决问题。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5115
translate chinese skystressrelief_f822bc85:

    # j "Ah, you shouldn't worry about her. She's built to last."
    j "啊，不用担心她。她结实得很。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5131
translate chinese skystressrelief_9a33b55a:

    # a "I'm back. Sorry, I had to send them off."
    a "我回来了。抱歉，我得把她们送走。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5136
translate chinese skystressrelief_46b3bbbe:

    # a "The others are hesitating to visit because they can't bear to see you like this, especially Sky. But I'll try to persuade them again."
    a "其他人都不忍心看到你这个样子，都在纠结要不要来看你。特别是斯凯。不过我会再去劝劝她们的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5283
translate chinese skystressrelief_935f5188:

    # mc "Seriously, you've changed a little since we discovered what we are to each other..."
    mc "说真的，你在我们知道我们过去的关系之后也变了一点……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5371
translate chinese skystressrelief_aa173488:

    # f "Ugh, bummer..."
    f "唉，没劲……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5425
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_3323826f:

    # mc "Aine."
    mc "艾妮。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5426
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_a06134bc:

    # a "[mc], we need to talk."
    a "[mc!t]，我们得谈谈。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5427
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_0ba12197:

    # mc "Yeah, I was about to look for you."
    mc "嗯，我正打算去找你。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5428
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_cc39de6d:

    # a "Let's head down stairs, then."
    a "那我们下楼说吧。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5434
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_81c2b6ed:

    # mc "I see, so you already took over..."
    mc "原来如此，你已经接手了……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5435
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_a63f79e6:

    # mc "Sorry, I kind of pushed you into it."
    mc "抱歉，你算是被我逼着去干的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5436
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_06ff46c6:

    # a "No, don't be. I did hesitate, yes. But after learning about the group's state, I couldn't leave it hanging. It was such a mess."
    a "不，不用道歉。我是有过犹豫。但是考虑到组织目前的状况，我没法再继续优柔寡断了。真是一团乱麻。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5437
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_2c7aa656:

    # mc "How did her men take it?"
    mc "她的手下意见大吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5438
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_b2f0baae:

    # a "Well... they welcomed me with open arms."
    a "嗯……他们非常欢迎我。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5439
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_7f0b1cac:

    # a "She left them just like that; it's not like they had any choice, anyway."
    a "她一声不吭就离开了；他们本来也没有其他的路可走。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5440
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_5f866040:

    # a "[mc], we eventually need to decide what we should do about it. You, especially. We can no longer take this as a joke."
    a "[mc!t]，我们迟早要决定该怎么办。特别是你。已经不能再把这事当儿戏了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5441
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_ef88bdc6:

    # mc "I know, it's just... there's something I don't get about your mother's ideology..."
    mc "我知道，只是……我搞不太懂你妈妈的想法……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5442
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_3de1e843:

    # mc "Why reform a mafia group into a charity?"
    mc "为什么要把黑手党改组成慈善组织？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5443
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_b95d7701:

    # mc "Because she wants to give back to those who work for her? Because that's what she and her husband want? Because she's a good person behind the facade?"
    mc "因为她想回报给她工作过的人？因为这是她和她老公的梦想？因为她其实心底里是个好人？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5444
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_bf9faec4:

    # mc "I don't think that's all there is to it."
    mc "我不觉得这些原因足够解释。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5445
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_ed51d0b2:

    # a "I know the real reason... and this is where our {i}real{/i} problem comes."
    a "我知道真正的原因……也知道我们真正要遇上的麻烦。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5446
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_2836b329:

    # a "While you were asleep, I got to talk to Bonheur."
    a "你昏迷的时候，我去找了博纳尔。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5448
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_4de64d36:

    # bo "*chuckles* That's where you're mistaken, Miss Agnor."
    bo "*笑* 这你就说错了，阿格诺小姐。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5449
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_01afa189:

    # bo "I didn't plan to control you and your friends; you all simply got caught in my... let's say, skirmish."
    bo "我无意控制你和你的朋友们；你们只是……被卷进了我们的冲突里。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5450
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_29266dd4:

    # bo "Hera saw through my intentions and tried to counter the possible future by reforming the mafia."
    bo "赫拉看穿了我的目的，想通过改革黑手党来避免可能发生的未来。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5451
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_855aec73:

    # bo "So, I attempted to stop her by arranging for either myself or my son to marry you, thus taking full control of the throne."
    bo "所以，我就打算通过安排我或者我儿子和你结婚来完全掌权，从而反制她。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5452
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_693e92d7:

    # a "Keep dreaming."
    a "你做梦。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5453
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_dda7e293:

    # bo "Certainly, it is all but a dream now, isn't it?"
    bo "当然，现在这一切都只是一场梦了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5454
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_23ff1b80:

    # a "And what's your goal after sitting on the throne?"
    a "那你完全掌权之后打算做什么？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5455
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_daab37c0:

    # bo "It was quite simple: not to waste the Agnor Mafia's potential."
    bo "很简单：充分利用阿格诺黑手党的潜力。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5456
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_c51a2da1:

    # bo "Its resources could easily revive my past project, which sadly shut down after the war between Glabia and Sha Crea concluded."
    bo "很不幸，我的血清计划在格拉比亚和沙克雷亚的战争结束之后就终止了。通过组织的资源，我很容易就能让计划起死回生。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5457
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_197c88d2:

    # a "And you failed."
    a "而你失败了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5458
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_f64e0fdc:

    # bo "*laughs* Failed? No, not at all, Miss Agnor."
    bo "*大笑* 失败？不，完全没有，阿格诺小姐。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5459
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_0f2b87fa:

    # bo "Do whatever you wish to me. After all, the die is cast."
    bo "随你们怎么处置我。毕竟，事已至此。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5460
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_2c19b8e9:

    # bo "Do you think a lowly human being like me can do the work of the Gods?"
    bo "你真的认为像我这般低贱的人类可以完成神的功绩吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5461
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_64348921:

    # bo "In the far future, something significant is coming..."
    bo "在遥远的未来，将会有前所未有的大事发生……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5462
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_efad1ddc:

    # bo "In the grand scheme of things, and the future of this world, I am... but a mere observer."
    bo "在宏大的命运，以及这个世界的未来面前，我……只是个观察者。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5463
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_6acb4cc8:

    # a "What... the hell are you up to?"
    a "你……到底有什么打算？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5464
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_ab773a60:

    # bo "My tongue is tied; I am forbidden to talk. In any case, I'll be kind enough to give you a warning..."
    bo "我不能透露一丁点消息。不过，我就贴心地给你一个警告吧……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5465
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_f3887849:

    # bo "Be careful about Francis."
    bo "当心弗朗西斯。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5466
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_2117134a:

    # bo "Now that there's no one to control him, who knows what he'll do."
    bo "现在没有人能控制他了，天知道他会做出什么事来。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5467
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_1c87be14:

    # a "Don't tell me he's a Number, too?"
    a "可别告诉我他也注射了血清啊。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5468
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_9c7f69c0:

    # bo "No, he is not. My project was long gone before I even found him."
    bo "不，他没有。我的计划早在我找到他之前就已经烟消云散了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5469
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_a70f380b:

    # bo "He's... not what you think he is."
    bo "他……没有你想的那么简单。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5470
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_9927a658:

    # a "Tell me what he's up to."
    a "把他的目的告诉我。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5471
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_14d55872:

    # bo "I don't know that either."
    bo "我也不知道。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5472
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_0bae359a:

    # bo "All his charades to get Olivia back, his so-called sister... are all in his head."
    bo "他所有那些为了找回所谓的姐姐奥莉薇娅的闹剧……都只是妄想。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5473
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_cd2ec116:

    # bo "This Olivia person does not exist."
    bo "那个叫奥莉薇娅的人根本不存在。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5476
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_4b9aa846:

    # mc "Did he say anything else after that?"
    mc "那之后他还说什么了吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5477
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_63eb959d:

    # a "No, he refused to talk no matter how much we pushed him."
    a "不，之后我们不管怎么逼他，他都不肯开口。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5478
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_675434cd:

    # a "Unfortunately, we couldn't find Francis in that mansion. He ran with his tail tucked between his legs."
    a "可惜，我们在那间宅子里没找到弗朗西斯。他肯定是夹着尾巴逃跑了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5479
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_9b0aa679:

    # mc "To be expected. I'm pretty sure I told his father the same thing before."
    mc "我就知道。我还记得我还对他爸也说过一样的话。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5480
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_3b533b76:

    # mc "Let's arrange a search for Francis. Before we decide what to do with the mafia, let's make use of it."
    mc "我们派人去找他。在最终决定如何处置黑手党之前，先好好利用一下这个组织。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5481
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_2d6f0af5:

    # a "Good call. We can't let him roam free in the streets. There's really no telling what he'll do."
    a "好主意。现在根本搞不明白他想做什么，不能让他到处乱跑。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5482
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_eb78bf92:

    # a "Hey, we found this though..."
    a "还有，我们找到了这个……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5483
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_95613309:

    # a "I'm not sure if she wants it back, but I'll leave it to you to return it to her."
    a "我不知道她还想不想要回去，不过就交给你还给她吧。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5484
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_2b35b6fe_30:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5485
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_e9217b4c:

    # mc "Just... how many lives did this thing take?"
    mc "这把刀……夺走了多少条生命？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5486
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_7cb5373d:

    # a "... Moon can be so cruel, but she's also the most gentle soul I've ever met. I'm glad to have her as my friend, [mc]."
    a "……月有残忍无情的一面，但也是我见过最温柔的人。能有她做朋友，我很高兴，[mc!t]。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5487
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_05c197e7:

    # mc "Yeah, I know that more than anyone."
    mc "是的，这一点我比谁都清楚。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5488
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_df014cbb:

    # a "When I arrived to get you two out of there, I saw someone in so much pain kneeling before you. Not on the outside, but on the inside."
    a "我去那里接你们两个的时候，看到她非常痛苦地跪在你身前。不是身体上的痛苦，而是内心的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5489
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_e60dd889:

    # a "I want to protect her, as much as she wants to protect us. I don't... want to see her in that state again, [mc]."
    a "我想保护她，就像她也想保护我们一样。我……再也不想看见她那种样子，[mc!t]。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5490
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_2b35b6fe_10:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5497
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_15ea446a_1:

    # m "[mc]?"
    m "[mc!t]？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5498
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_5b50a0f1:

    # mc "*chuckles* I can't express how it feels not being called \"Commander\" the first thing you say every time you see me."
    mc "*笑* 你见到我之后的第一句话终于不是“指挥官”了，让我感慨万千啊。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5499
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_21244bdf:

    # m "Then how about I call you \"My Lord\" instead? As I rightfully should."
    m "那我喊你“王”怎么样？我本来也该那么称呼你的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5500
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_bdf6fd4c:

    # mc "That's even worse."
    mc "那我更受不了了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5501
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_e365eda2:

    # mc "No need for those titles anymore, Moon. We're way past those times already. Just call me by my name. That's more than enough."
    mc "没有必要再用那些头衔了，月。我们已经过了那个阶段。只要喊名字就足够了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5502
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_71510bb3:

    # m "Alright."
    m "好的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5503
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_e7df83db:

    # mc "Anyway, here. Aine found it when she got us out."
    mc "总之，给你这个。艾妮去接我们的时候找到的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5505
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_7481a1c5:

    # m "You keep it."
    m "你留着吧。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5506
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_2876efd9:

    # mc "Why?"
    mc "为什么？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5507
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_f09cd719:

    # m "I already have you; I don't need it anymore, [mc]. And..."
    m "我已经有你了，[mc!t]，再也用不上它了。而且……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5508
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_c38a7f56:

    # m "It was yours to begin with."
    m "它本来就是你的东西。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5509
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_dad7a8db:

    # mc "That's right..."
    mc "是啊……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5510
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_36c701e9:

    # m "It's about time I fully let go of the past."
    m "我是时候完全放下过去了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5511
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_a98387b4:

    # m "No, {i}we{/i} will let go of the past."
    m "不，{i}我们{/i}都该放下过去了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5512
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_2feb1b4f:

    # m "What happened to me during the war, or to us hundreds of years ago, no longer matters. What matters now is the two of us today."
    m "战争时我遇见的事，或者是几百年前我们遇见的事，都已经不重要了。重要的只有现在的我们。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5513
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_a0db4123:

    # m "Whether you're my husband or not, whether I'm your bodyguard or not..."
    m "不管你是不是我的丈夫，不管我是不是你的保镖……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5514
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_4ca47e07:

    # m "I will still love you from the bottom of my heart."
    m "我都会发自心底地爱你。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5515
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_d7f29f5b:

    # m "I don't want to just stay by your side, [mc]. I will walk with you until the end of time."
    m "我不想只是陪在你身边，[mc!t]。我会和你一起走向时间的尽头。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5516
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_c20c79e6:

    # m "After all, in heart and spirit, we... are a singular fate."
    m "毕竟，我们的心，灵魂，命运……都是一体的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5517
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_ba306907:

    # m "That is the answer I found."
    m "这就是我找到的答案。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5520
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_e5f0ae20:

    # m "Uh... Commander?"
    m "呃……指挥官？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5521
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_f49fff8f:

    # mc "Yeah?"
    mc "嗯？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5522
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_a7299b66:

    # m "Are you really my husband?"
    m "你真是我的丈夫吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5523
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_6e88ffe1:

    # mc "If the history records and the details about the serum are correct, then technically, yes..."
    mc "如果那个故事还有血清的作用都没错的话，那严格来说，没错……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5524
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_a1f3250d:

    # m "And I'm your wife?"
    m "我是你的妻子？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5525
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_a87a337b:

    # mc "Yep."
    mc "对。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5526
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_4fe3ab78:

    # m "Then what do we do now? I have no idea what to make of it."
    m "那我们该怎么办？我不知道该怎么理解这件事。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5528
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_2b35b6fe_20:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5529
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_b04079c7:

    # mc "Jesus... Just how many times do you want this man's heart to flutter?"
    mc "天啊……你是想把我甜死吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5530
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_81c602e8:

    # m "As many times as you want me to express what I feel for you."
    m "以后你每次想听我说心里话，我都会让你甜死的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5531
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_254a4baf:

    # mc "*chuckles* I'll hold you to that."
    mc "*笑* 那我可很期待了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5532
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_3b8c21f3:

    # shu "Hey, hey, hey!"
    shu "嗨嗨嗨！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5533
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_2658638b:

    # mc "Of course, you always have to show up at the perfect time."
    mc "好兄弟，你可真是太会在合适的时候出现啦。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5534
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_a44e9190:

    # shu "Sorry, did I interrupt something?"
    shu "抱歉，我打扰到你们了吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5535
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_c932f59b:

    # mc "No, don't worry about it."
    mc "没事，不用在意。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5536
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_ce0ed11c:

    # shu "Anyway... Are you ready?"
    shu "总之……你准备好了没？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5537
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_ea2d5aaa:

    # mc "Hm? Ready for what?"
    mc "嗯？准备什么？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5538
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_ab8acb9b:

    # shu "Seriously...?"
    shu "你搞笑呢吧……？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5539
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_11455b53:

    # mc "What?"
    mc "啊？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5540
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_d32e1625:

    # shu "It's almost your freakin' birthday, you twat!"
    shu "马上就到你的生日了，你个傻子！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5541
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_2e9b645f:

    # mc "Oh shi-"
    mc "我去——"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5542
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_bcd5cee8:

    # mc "Yeah... I forgot about it."
    mc "是啊……我都忘了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5543
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_8e850da7:

    # m "It's the 24th tomorrow, which means..."
    m "明天是24号，也就是说……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5544
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_df6a0c18:

    # shu "IT'S MERRY FUCKIN' CHRISTMAS, MATE!"
    shu "圣诞他妈的快乐，伙计！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5545
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_a23647f1:

    # mc "Stop talking like Naomi, and my birthday is on the 25th."
    mc "别学娜奥米说话了，而且我的生日是25号。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5546
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_19a1d6ef:

    # shu "But it's right on time, no?"
    shu "但是也不远了，对吧？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5547
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_e89449dc:

    # shu "We've prepared a venue for it. I've already invited everyone to come!"
    shu "我们已经准备好地方了。我也邀请大家都来了！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5548
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_4e6b8fbc:

    # shu "And we're staying there, not just for one day, but for several days until the New Year!"
    shu "而且我们可不是只在那里待一天，要一直住到新年！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5549
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_c2a9bced:

    # mc "So that's what you and Freya have been missing in action for."
    mc "原来你和芙蕾雅失踪那么久是干这个去了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5550
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_f158314d:

    # shu "Yep! She helped me pick a venue. Honestly, nothing beats her taste when it comes to stuff like this."
    shu "没错！是她帮我挑的好地方。说实话，这种事情上，谁的品味都比不过她。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5551
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_bad60a95:

    # mc "It hasn't been long since we went to that beach island to unwind, but..."
    mc "我们前不久才去沙滩岛放松过，不过……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5552
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_e9a9feed:

    # mc "... I'm really looking forward to this."
    mc "……这次我也很期待。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5553
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_72f998b7:

    # mc "Thanks, buddy. I don't know how much money you spent on it this time, but I really appreciate it."
    mc "谢了，兄弟。不知道这次你花了多少钱，真的很感谢你。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5554
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_2988fe3e:

    # shu "Anytime!"
    shu "小事一桩！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5555
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_97c3092a:

    # a "Uh, guys...? Dinner is ready!"
    a "晚饭做好了，各位！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5556
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_0df33570:

    # a "If you don't come in soon, Klara will... Well, you know what will happen."
    a "要是不赶紧进来，克拉拉就……呃，你们知道会发生什么的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5557
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_5ee9eaa1:

    # mc "Let's go."
    mc "走吧。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5563
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_0f90f1fb:

    # am "Have you secured the place?"
    am "附近都看过了吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5564
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_11f687cf:

    # ee "Yes. It seems she's not around."
    ee "是的。她似乎不在。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5565
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_bbf20073:

    # ee "I also summoned 7th to watch the perimeters, just to make sure."
    ee "以防万一，我也召唤了七警戒四周。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5566
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_4e8caa2c:

    # am "That's good to know."
    am "很好。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5567
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_a401d043:

    # ee "Mistress, may I ask something?"
    ee "主人，我能问一个问题吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5568
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_61497916:

    # am "Yes?"
    am "什么？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5569
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_b488694d:

    # ee "Why are we watching over these people? Why are you so fond of their stories?"
    ee "为什么我们要监视这些人？为什么你这么喜欢他们的故事？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5570
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_1b7833b9:

    # am "For a lot of reasons."
    am "有很多原因。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5571
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_8cb44de1:

    # am "You know the most important one. And the rest is a little... personal."
    am "最重要的原因你已经知道了。剩下的比较……私人。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5572
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_ae1ae731:

    # am "I've lived since this world's first sunrise, E..."
    am "我的生命甚至早于这个世界的第一次日出，E……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5573
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_3532202d:

    # am "... They are the only ones who remind me of what being human is like. Of what it feels like not being bound to this eternal curse."
    am "……只有他们能让我回想起身为人类的感觉。回想起不被这永恒的诅咒束缚的感觉。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5574
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_fffc30c4:

    # am "I will not allow her to tamper with their fates, especially [mc]'s."
    am "我绝不允许她玩弄这些人的命运，特别是[mc!t]的命运。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5575
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_1b99387c:

    # ee "... Perhaps I will never understand what that means, but I will carry out your will without question."
    ee "……或许我永远无法理解这些话的含义，但我会毫无疑问地执行你的命令。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5576
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_c520e462:

    # am "You have a lot to work on, E..."
    am "你还有很多要学的，E……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5577
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_5788c22a:

    # am "A time will eventually come when someone changes who you are. Only then will you finally open your eyes."
    am "迟早会出现一个可以改变你的人。只有到那时，你才终于能睁开双眼。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5578
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_b4fc19e4:

    # ee "But... I won't be able to see, either way."
    ee "可是……无论如何，我依然无法看见。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5579
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_89fffeba:

    # am "*sighs* That's not what I meant..."
    am "*叹气* 我不是那个意思……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5580
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_ba8445e2:

    # am "Anyway, we're done here. Call off Maya and Jinn. We'll return for the time being."
    am "总之，我们在这里的事情已经做完了。去喊玛雅和金。我们暂时先回去。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5581
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_6198a491:

    # ee "Right away."
    ee "明白。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5584
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_4e25b9c1:

    # nee "Hey, you made it this far! You've finally reached the end of Chapter 1!"
    nee "恭喜，你来到了第一章的结尾！真是好长一段故事！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5585
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_9cdba2e6:

    # nee "That means you really like the game despite its shortcomings, and that means a lot to us."
    nee "这代表着你非常喜欢这款也有不少缺点的游戏，这对我们来说非常重要。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5586
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_20d17a25:

    # nee "If you enjoyed it, please consider supporting {b}NiiChan{/b} on his Patreon page."
    nee "如果你玩得开心的话，请考虑去{b}Niichan{/b}的Patreon页面支持他一下。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5587
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_3f55b84e:

    # nee "Every bit of support helps and goes a long way!"
    nee "每一份支持都很重要！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5588
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_20876676:

    # nee "My Bully is My Lover will soon continue with Chapter 2, the final chapter {i}(will contain an estimate of 6-7 Episodes){/i}."
    nee "《我的爱人是霸凌女》的故事很快就会在第二章，也是最后一个章节里继续！"
    nee "别担心，说是最后，但第二章也预计会有六到七次更新。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5589
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_f9451e3f:

    # nee "I can't wait to see you guys there!"
    nee "我等不及要和大家在第二章见面了！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5590
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_1843530c:

    # nee "Thank you for playing and for your amazing support!"
    nee "谢谢你玩这个游戏，也谢谢你的支持！"
    
