# game/ch1ep4.rpy:585
translate chinese ch1ep4_bb8e4b4e_1:

    # a "..."
    a "……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2639
translate chinese skystressrelief_9d83ff6d:

    # cl "With a heart drowned in grief, Sora chose to follow her beloved into death, committing Jigai in the imperial garden where Kaito had first declared his love for her."
    cl "空的内心被悲伤压垮，于是她来到了海人第一次向她倾诉爱意的花园，切腹自尽，随爱人而去了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5669
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_17a76de7:

    # yt "This feels a little awkward given it's not my first rodeo in these situations."
    yt "我不是第一次遇见这种情况了，但还是感觉有点尴尬。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5670
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_7c256589:

    # yt "The atmosphere is quite different here than at the hospital, despite me being unconscious pretty much the whole time there..."
    yt "现在的气氛跟在医院里很不一样，尽管那时候我大部分时间都在昏迷……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5673
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_f38ed1d3:

    # m "... Comm-{w=0.5}{nw}"
    m "……指挥——{w=0.5}{nw}"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5675
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_4e2056cd:

    # "Moon catches herself real quick, softly clearing her throat."
    "月话没说完，喉咙就哽住了，她轻轻清了一下嗓子。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5678
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_968ad665:

    # m "Umm, [mc]...?"
    m "呃，[mc!t]……？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5679
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_976bff0d:

    # "You crane your neck, looking down towards Moon with a smile."
    "你转过头，脸上带着微笑低头看向月。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5680
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_f84dbcfd:

    # m "Umm, I'm feeling a little... hot..."
    m "我，我感觉有点……热……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5681
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_f109825b:

    # "You notice Moon more flushed than usual and turn to face her."
    "你发现月脸红的程度远超平常，于是转过身去面对着她。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5682
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_7dae22fe:

    # yt "Wow... she's usually more composed with herself than this."
    yt "哇哦……一般来说她不会慌成这样的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5683
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_5d61fe0a:

    # yt "Even when I picked her up at school, she didn't show a hint of bashfulness."
    yt "我去学校接她那次，她也一点害羞的感觉都没有。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5684
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_97e51de3:

    # yt "But now, it feels like she's afraid of saying or doing a single thing wrong."
    yt "可是现在，她却像是生怕说错一句话、做错一件事一样。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5685
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_9dbf5309:

    # yt "... Is it because we're in my room... on my bed... alone... and coming to terms with how we truly feel about each other?"
    yt "……是因为我们孤男寡女，共处一室……而且还明白了彼此之间最真实的感情吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5686
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_cda26d55:

    # "Trying to ease her tension, you crack a joke."
    "你试着用玩笑来缓解她的紧张。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5689
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_4c3fe128:

    # mc "You didn't catch anything while we were at the hospital, did you?"
    mc "不会是因为在医院里被传染了才觉得热吧？哈哈。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5690
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_2a2300f3:

    # m "No, being that we're numbers infused with the serum... we have disease resistance and tolerance."
    m "不，我们是注射了血清的编号者……对疾病有很强的抗性。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5691
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_74a1dedc:

    # m "If we can't reduce pathogens in our system, we can at least keep them in place until they die out naturally... leaving us unaffected."
    m "哪怕没法消灭掉体内的病原体，也能抑制住它们，直到病原体全部自然死亡……所以我们是不会受影响的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5692
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_e2d7e6af:

    # yt "Noted... though, I should have realized that given it cured my disease back then."
    yt "原来如此……不过，我小时候的病就是血清治好的，我早该意识到的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5693
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_1d367d87:

    # yt "In any case, looks like that didn't lighten the mood much. Maybe I can switch tactics."
    yt "总之，看来气氛没有轻松下来啊。该换个战术了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5697
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_35edf4ad:

    # "You place your hands on her shoulders, feeling her immediately stiffen at your touch."
    "你把手放在她的肩膀上，刚一接触，她全身就立马僵硬了起来。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5698
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_9031913d:

    # mc "Well, be that as it may... let's check to make sure. Lean forward a bit."
    mc "好吧，话虽这么说……还是检查一下，以防万一。靠过来一点。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5701
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_e27d4354:

    # "Moon's cheeks grow a deeper crimson as she leans into you, closing her eyes."
    "月闭上眼睛靠向你，脸颊早已通红。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5702
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_dcd461df:

    # "Ever so slightly, she pushes out her lips."
    "同时，她也轻轻撅起了嘴唇。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5703
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_d3e1bf35:

    # yt "So adorable-wait, does she want me to kiss her?"
    yt "真可爱啊——等等，她想让我亲她吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5704
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_30cf0d46:

    # yt "... Let's tease her a little more first..."
    yt "……先多挑逗她一会儿……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5705
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_0b38ad0d:

    # mc "Let's check your temperature using the method that people use with their loved ones."
    mc "就用那个专门用在自己爱的人的身上的办法给你量体温吧。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5706
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_654b647f:

    # mc "[landlady] used to do this with Sky and me whenever we were feeling sick."
    mc "我和斯凯以前不舒服的时候，[landlady!t]就会这样。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5710
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_ff5e9175:

    # "Moon's eyes snap open as she feels your forehead bump against hers, but she doesn't move."
    "你用额头抵上了月的额头，她猛地睁开眼睛，但没有动。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5711
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_24f1cd99:

    # "Her heat radiates against your forehead, a pulsating warmth that builds with her every breath."
    "月急促地呼吸着，一股股的热量不断传向你的额头。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5712
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_793ea6aa:

    # "You're not sure if Moon's reaction is because of the intimate skin-to-skin contact or because you mentioned \"loved ones\"."
    "你不禁好奇，月的反应是因为这肌肤相碰的亲密举动，还是因为你说了“爱的人”这个词。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5715
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_554c3ea3:

    # m "S-so, d-do I have a fever...?"
    m "那-那个，我-我发烧了吗……？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5716
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_d5e707a0:

    # mc "I don't know, actually. This is my first time doing this, and I'm not even sure what a fever feels like."
    mc "我也不知道。这是我第一次做这种事，我也不知道发烧具体会是什么感觉。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5717
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_33083b51:

    # m "Oh..."
    m "噢……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5718
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_73f74727:

    # "Moon looks into your eyes, unsure of what to do next."
    "月看向你的眼睛，不知道接下来该做什么。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5719
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_66556b2e:

    # "The long, tense stare continues for some time, each of you wondering what the other's next move will be."
    "绵长、热烈的凝视又持续了很久，你们两个都在想接下来会发生什么。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5720
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_00394d8c:

    # "Since you're in no rush, you just focus on the sight in front of you."
    "你并不急躁，只是静静欣赏着眼前的美人。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5723
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_550466b9:

    # yt "God, she's so beautiful... I want to wrap her up and hold her for all eternity."
    yt "天啊，她太漂亮了……我只想紧紧抱着她一辈子不放手。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5724
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_361d9716:

    # yt "But for whatever reason, I just can't move beyond this, as if a force is preventing me from moving."
    yt "可不知道为什么，我却没法做出任何行动来，就好像冥冥中有一股力量在阻止着我一样。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5725
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_af6d2e9d:

    # yt "A feeling of want, need, desire... to remain like this, drinking in her beauty."
    yt "这种渴望，这种欲求……这种想要永远定格在这一刻。尽情品味她的美的感觉……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5726
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_0b29e992:

    # yt "Is it Kaito? Are the feelings of the emperor moving within me?"
    yt "是海人吗？是我体内的国王的感情在翻涌吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5731
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_0ff580a3:

    # "Some rustling outside the window can be heard, bringing you both out of your reverie."
    "窗外突然传来了一阵响动，让你们两个都从思绪中惊醒了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5743
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_98f2cc9a:

    # g "When I go, to reach out and to roam...{w=4.5}{nw}"
    g "我踏上旅途，云游四方……{w=4.5}{nw}"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5746
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_33d25c2a:

    # g "There is no perception of a home...{w=5.0}{nw}"
    g "却找不到可以安顿的港湾……{w=5.0}{nw}"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5749
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_ca46d9e1:

    # g "For when it's all been said and done, I know...{w=5.0}{nw}"
    g "因为当一切都尘埃落定之时，我明白……{w=5.0}{nw}"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5757
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_7717c06c:

    # yt "*chuckles* Nice assist, Gwen."
    yt "*笑* 多谢助攻啊，格温。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5758
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_df61c0af:

    # yt "Wait, did she do this on purpose knowing that we're...?"
    yt "等等，她是故意的吗？她知道我们要……？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5759
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_92d507f5:

    # yt "Well, either way, it doesn't matter as I now feel like I can continue."
    yt "好吧，无所谓了。我觉得我可以继续了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5767
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_82c6afab:

    # mc "There's nothing more beautiful than the one right before me."
    mc "再美也美不过我眼前的人。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5770
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_137282ea:

    # "Moon covers her deepening blush; however, she can't hide her smile."
    "月用手捂住越发赤红的脸颊，却藏不住脸上的笑意。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5771
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_de4f9a44:

    # yt "God, as cheesy as that line was, her reaction is just too cute. Worth it!"
    yt "天啊，虽然这句话土到掉渣，但能换来她这么可爱的反应也算值了！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5772
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_f33eabb8:

    # yt "I can't take this anymore. My heart feels as though it's about to burst for her!"
    yt "我忍不住了。我的心都快要因为她而炸开了！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5773
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_95358d32:

    # m "You do have a way with words-"
    m "你确实很会说话——"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5776
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_de89ca65:

    # "Moon's words are cut off as you pull her shoulders towards you, drawing her face to yours, pressing your lips together."
    "你把月的肩膀拉向你，打断了她的话语。然后，你们的嘴唇重叠了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5781
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_03042d9d:

    # "Moon stares longingly at you with an anticipating look."
    "月满怀期待，充满渴望地凝视着你。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5782
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_4e29082a:

    # yt "I can't take this anymore; my heart can't take much more of this!"
    yt "我再也忍不住了；我的心脏要受不了了！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5785
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_c07fe3b6:

    # "You pull Moon's shoulders towards you, drawing her face to yours, pressing your lips together."
    "你把月的肩膀拉向你。然后，你们的嘴唇重叠了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5788
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_9e40a786:

    # "You can feel the tension in Moon's shoulders disappear, as if they're saying, \"Finally, he kissed me...\""
    "你感到月紧绷的肩膀瞬间放松了，好像在说，“他终于吻我了……”一样。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5791
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_2adc9e90:

    # "You pull away from her, revealing an amusing sight of her with pursed lips... like a fish out of water, seeking out your lips to meet hers again."
    "在吻结束之后，她依然撅着嘴唇，一副可爱的模样，再次渴求着你的双唇……好像离了水的鱼一样。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5794
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_7bd8ccd7:

    # mc "Moon, ever since we found out about our connection, we've always begged the question of whether or not our feelings are our own or fabricated by some past life."
    mc "月，自从我们发现了彼此之间的联系之后，就一直在想，我们的感情到底是我们自己的，还是被前世造就的……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5795
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_48ece8ba:

    # mc "But after the time we've spent, after everything we've gone through together, at the school and what we shared at the hospital..."
    mc "但在一起度过了这么久以后，在一起经历了这么多以后，在学校里，在医院里……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5798
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_6ae31d41:

    # yt "She's remembering what we did together at the school. How cute..."
    yt "她想起来我们在学校里做的事了。真可爱……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5801
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_ff294970:

    # mc "I realize that our connection isn't based on some mind-altering serum."
    mc "我明白了，我们之间的联系并不是因为什么能改变心灵的血清。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5802
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_ad122439:

    # mc "Instead, it's from the connection between our hearts."
    mc "而是两颗心之间的联系。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5803
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_7ac192e2:

    # m "You mean the jolt... the ache in my chest?"
    m "你是说……我胸膛里的这种鼓动、疼痛是……？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5804
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_2fd310e9:

    # mc "Yes, exactly... it's our feelings resonating with each other."
    mc "是的，没错……是我们之间的感情产生了共鸣。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5805
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_e39558b0:

    # mc "We already have something special, an unparalleled love we've fostered ourselves."
    mc "我们之间本就有了难以比拟、独一无二的爱。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5806
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_4959a5a1:

    # mc "The connection we have from the serum has only elevated it due to the Emperor and Sora's passion for each other."
    mc "而血清带来的影响，只是让海人和空之间的爱给我们的感情添砖加瓦。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5809
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_a589fdbd:

    # m "You're right. The time we shared had me wondering if my hidden desires were being solely pushed by Sora's."
    m "你说得对。我也会想，我心底的渴望，背后是不是都只有空的感情在推动。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5810
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_57b0a8b9:

    # m "But, looking back, I've always enjoyed our times together. I loved how you carried yourself from the first moment we met."
    m "但是，仔细想想，我一直都很喜欢跟你在一起。从第一次见面开始，我就喜欢上了你的一举一动。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5811
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_e3169482:

    # m "And despite knowing full well I'd be guarding you, protecting you..."
    m "而且，尽管我明白是该由我来保护你……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5812
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_384a7642:

    # m "I, myself, felt safe by your side."
    m "可我在你身边的时候，反而会觉得自己很安全。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5813
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_fbb24118:

    # "You chuckle softly at the idea of Moon also having developed feelings from the very beginning."
    "原来月也对你一见钟情，你不禁轻声笑了出来。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5816
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_6bf4f8dd:

    # m "A-are you laughing at me?"
    m "你-你是在笑我吗？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5817
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_0f8bd83b:

    # mc "Not at all. I find it amusing that I even felt some connection upon first seeing you... Your beauty blew me away."
    mc "完全没有。只是我想起来我第一眼看到你的时候就感到和你有种说不清道不明的联系……觉得很有趣。你的美深深震撼了我。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5818
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_8f148ce4:

    # mc "And this happened well before I unlocked any memories or feelings of the Emperor."
    mc "而且这都是发生在我得到海人的记忆之前的事。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5819
translate chinese kaitosorareunion_0c23ce03:

    # mc "And hearing you lay out your feelings to me at the hospital cemented mine that much more."
    mc "在医院里听到你说出你的想法，让我更加坚定了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:5820
