    h "{i}相反，这是对我织出的罪恶之网的承认，并且如果还有机会的话，是毁掉这张网的第一步。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:108
translate chinese ch1ep4_73115cf0:

    # h "{i}About Jovian... I have some information that could be useful, but unfortunately, nothing earth-shattering."
    h "{i}乔维安这边……我有一些可能有用的情报，然而没有什么重大进展。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:109
translate chinese ch1ep4_6855120f:

    # h "{i}I believe I had mentioned that I conducted a search in hopes of finding him. My last solid lead was the old Winters' place, out of town."
    h "{i}我应该提到过，我组织过对他的搜寻，其中找到的最后一条有价值的线索指向城外的老温特斯家。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:124
translate chinese ch1ep4_1944cc99:

    # h "{i}You may not know, but some people in the group are looking to build a brighter future. Those people need someone to hold them together."
    h "{i}你可能不知道，组织里还是有人盼望着光明的未来。那些人需要一个能把他们凝聚在一起的领袖。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:130
translate chinese ch1ep4_cb9dffc1:

    # h "{i}Yes, I know what you have been planning. Jess is watching over you, and I was informed of this before writing this letter."
    h "{i}我知道你们在计划什么。婕斯在盯着你们，她在我写这封信之前就已经全告诉我了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:132
translate chinese ch1ep4_8c16ee81:

    # h "{i}I've been a thorn in your side for too long. So, on [mc]'s advice, I'm stepping back. This way, you can move forward without me in the way."
    h "{i}我已经让你们烦心太久了。所以，应[mc!t]的建议，我不再插手。这样你们就能在没有我的情况下大步前进。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:234
translate chinese ch1ep4_0d9ac341:

    # m "Command, this is Replace Element, callsign Four. How copy? Over."
    m "总部，这里是“数列”小队，我是四号。能收到吗？完毕。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:236
translate chinese ch1ep4_46e0de7e:

    # comms "Four, this is HQ. Comms are five by five. Report status. Over."
    comms "四号，这里是总部。通讯良好。汇报情况。完毕。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:259
translate chinese ch1ep4_66453e77:

    # m "Solid copy, still here. Was the request for exfil granted? Over."
    m "非常清楚，我们还在。撤离请求批准了吗？完毕。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:279
translate chinese ch1ep4_18ccf8f4:

    # m "They asked us if we completed the mission and then agreed to extract us. Helo will be here in 5."
    m "先是问了任务完成了没有，然后同意让我们撤离了。直升机五分钟就到。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:285
translate chinese ch1ep4_db57ced9:

    # fi "Does it really matter now, Six? What matters is that we did it and are all getting out of here in 5 minutes. We just need to hold on a bit longer."
    fi "现在这些还重要吗，六号？重要的是我们完成了任务，5分钟之后就可以一起离开了。我们只要再坚持一小会儿就行。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:317
translate chinese ch1ep4_b3d3e600:

    # sol2 "I don't know man, I have a bad feeling about this. It's only four of them, but they still managed to take out dozens of us."
    sol2 "不好说啊，兄弟。我有不好的预感。他们才四个人，却干掉了我们几十个人。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:363
translate chinese ch1ep4_0bed1186:

    # fi "Don't give in! Use your sidearm if you have to!"
    fi "别放弃！要是有手枪就用手枪！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:432
translate chinese ch1ep4_45a6bdfd:

    # fi "Let's go everyone! Pop smokes to cover our retreat."
    fi "大家快走！扔烟雾弹掩护撤退。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:596
translate chinese ch1ep4_47d1bdec:

    # mc "Given your connections, you should reach out to Jess. Ask her to arrange for someone to watch over everyone here. Do it now if you can."
    mc "正好你可以联系上婕斯。请让她安排人来照料留下来的人。要是可以的话现在就联系她。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:608
translate chinese ch1ep4_b2a27515:

    # e "Thankfully, this case has been open for a while already. If I have the necessary information, I can have the warrant authorized by tomorrow."
    e "好消息是这个案子立案的时间不短了。只要拿到所有必要的信息，明天搜查令就能批下来。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:615
translate chinese ch1ep4_1ee8d9a3:

    # mc "I see... She mentioned that one of us knows the location. So it's you."
    mc "这样啊……她说我们之中有一个人知道位置，原来是你。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:617
translate chinese ch1ep4_3b4a11a1:

    # k "You asked me to lay low, but I can't sit idly when it comes to Jovian. If he's out there, I want first dibs to acquaint my palm with his face."
    k "你说要让我保持低调，可是对于和乔维安有关的事，我没法袖手旁观。如果他真在那里，我要第一个给他一耳光。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:639
translate chinese ch1ep4_11b5b63c:

    # m "Not exactly. But I know we've all been preparing for this. However, facing what's ahead requires us at our best, which means being well-rested."
    m "算不上。但是我知道我们都在为了这事做准备。可是，那就代表我们要用最好的状态迎接挑战，也就是必须好好休息。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:671
translate chinese ch1ep4_7b241f4f:

    # mc "I told myself I was ready, but the pressure is too much."
    mc "我告诉我自己已经准备好了，但是压力实在太大。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:693
translate chinese ch1ep4_78d595c2:

    # s "I had to use the bathroom and heard you after I was done."
    s "我去厕所了，出来之后听到了你的声音。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:758
translate chinese skystressrelief_322df741:

    # "As always, Sky seems to anticipate what you were thinking perfectly."
    "一如既往，斯凯似乎总是能完美预测到你的想法。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:792
translate chinese skystressrelief_f87084eb:

    # mc "Can't have you do all the work, right, my little ragdoll?"
    mc "总不能让你一个人出力，对吧，我的小布娃娃？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:830
translate chinese skystressrelief_7fcfce46:

    # s "Lift me up, stick it in there, and let's get this show on the road!"
    s "把我抱起来，插进去，赶快开始办事吧！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:832
translate chinese skystressrelief_4431ffff:

    # s "[mc]. It's not the first time we've done it with each other. Also, it's not like I'm an older woman like [landlady] who requires a lot of warmups."
    s "[mc!t]。我们不是第一次做了。再说了，我又不是[landlady!t]那样的老女人，要做很多热身。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:887
translate chinese skystressrelief_355700ef:

    # yt "Maybe next time. For now, just gonna enjoy Sky's amazing idea to relieve some anxiety."
    yt "之后再说吧。现在就乖乖享受一下斯凯这个绝妙的排解压力的主意。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:938
translate chinese skystressrelief_14cfda2d:

    # mc "The bond we have is special, something that I can never have with any of the other girls. You're my [roommate], after all."
    mc "你我之间的联系是特殊的，其他任何一个女生都比不了。毕竟你是我[roommate!t]嘛。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:993
translate chinese skystressrelief_90f3ed2f:

    # s "{size=-10}Next time, you'll have to fuck me twice as hard."
    s "{size=-10}下次，你要用两倍的力气操我。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1057
translate chinese skystressrelief_6a659ef1:

    # mc "Anyway, I'm [mc]. I appreciate you two stepping in to help."
    mc "总之，我是[mc!t]。感谢你们来帮忙。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1090
translate chinese skystressrelief_0108ba16:

    # nic "You two might just set a world record for the least words used in a conversation."
    nic "你们俩说不定都创造字数最少的聊天的世界纪录了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1662
translate chinese skystressrelief_7436b489:

    # jov "Sinking back into my chair, I'll keep my eyes on [mc] as the night continues. No matter what happens next, I stand by my decision."
    jov "外面的夜越来越浓，我瘫在椅子上，紧紧盯着[mc!t]。不管接下来发生什么，我都会为我的决定负责。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1681
translate chinese skystressrelief_7fdc07e0:

    # jov "I'm under no illusions about this serum or what I agreed to with Bonheur. There's gonna be a price to pay, no doubt about it."
    jov "我非常明白那个血清是什么东西，非常明白我和博纳尔做了什么交易。毫无疑问，我一定会付出相应的代价。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1682
translate chinese skystressrelief_95711b8b:

    # jov "But for now, I'm just soaking in the gratitude."
    jov "但是眼下，我心里只有感恩。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1688
translate chinese skystressrelief_d168a577:

    # jov "But that's a worry for another day. For now, I will sit back and watch this play out."
    jov "但那就留到以后再说吧。现在，我还是静静地观察事态会如何发展吧。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1692
translate chinese skystressrelief_17e01aa9:

    # jov "I just want to take this second chance and make it work with them. [mc], Sky, Klara are all my beacons of hope."
    jov "我只想抓住这第二次机会，和他们一起好好生活。[mc!t]，斯凯，克拉拉都是我的希望。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1718
translate chinese skystressrelief_cec0bf96:

    # k "You getting better was the only good thing we had at that time, and I feared that asking too many questions would ruin that."
    k "那段时间，你的病治好了是唯一的好事，我害怕问太多问题会让一切都化为乌有。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1721
translate chinese skystressrelief_f3957df1:

    # k "And maybe I was too scared to look for them, scared of what it might mean for us. I'm truly sorry."
    k "而且我可能也太害怕答案背后隐藏着的东西，不敢去寻找答案。真的很抱歉。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1722
translate chinese skystressrelief_2fe12815:

    # k "I wish I could give you the closure you're looking for. I can only say that Jovian did it all because he loved you."
    k "我也希望我能如你所愿，让你释怀。我只能说他做这些事都是因为他爱你。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1780
translate chinese skystressrelief_77079955:

    # jov "The serum kept [mc] alive, yes, but at what cost?"
    jov "的确，那个血清保住了[mc!t]的命，但代价是什么？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1784
translate chinese skystressrelief_862df952:

    # jov "\"It's honest work\", I lied, and my voice sounded as hollow as I felt. I can't even speak like myself anymore..."
    jov "我骗她说，“是正经的工作”。我的声音就和我的内心一样空洞。我甚至都没法好好说话了……"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1824
translate chinese skystressrelief_b2fc80a1:

    # jov "Sky makes sandcastles, her eyes filled with wonder."
    jov "斯凯用沙子堆了城堡，眼里满是惊奇。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1864
translate chinese skystressrelief_b2897161:

    # jov "Hera's son, just a newborn infant. I... I could hear his cries as I took its life."
    jov "赫拉的儿子，只是个刚出生的婴儿。我……我还能听见我动手的时候他的哭喊。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1865
translate chinese skystressrelief_16a7756c:

    # jov "It's like it was pleading with me, to forgive him for the sins it has never committed."
    jov "就好像在恳求我，让我原谅他根本没有犯下的罪行一样。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:1890
translate chinese skystressrelief_b1bde2ae:

    # jov "Years passed, and I still keep saying the words, as if repetition will make them come true!"
    jov "过了好几年，我还是在说这句话，好像多说几遍就能成真一样！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2013
translate chinese skystressrelief_0a519a21:

    # m "In the military, we speak a lot about sacrifice and duty. Jovian lived those values, not on a faraway battlefield, but in the silent struggles he faced for [mc]."
    m "在军队里，我们经常谈牺牲，谈使命。乔维安就做到了这两点，不是在远方的战场上，而是在为了拯救[mc!t]的无声斗争里。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2068
translate chinese skystressrelief_8efb10e4:

    # m "Though our paths never crossed, I know he was a pillar of strength and a wellspring of love for those who were blessed to know him."
    m "尽管我和他素昧平生，但我知道他是有力的支柱，是有幸认识他的人的爱的源泉。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2076
translate chinese skystressrelief_87f1fafc:

    # ew "Before he lost himself, he made us promise that whatever happens in this house, stays in this house."
    ew "在他发疯之前，他让我们保证，在这个房子里发生的事就留在这里，不传出去。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2210
translate chinese skystressrelief_b810c0bc:

    # j "Like I said, I'm not here to control you. You're always welcome to return if it doesn't work out."
    j "我说了，我不会控制你。如果最后没有结果的话，随时欢迎你回来。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2218
translate chinese skystressrelief_06dd1ebe:

    # j "Well... No matter what I say, I'm sure it will sound like that."
    j "呃……不过不管我说什么，肯定听起来都像是那样就是了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2322
translate chinese skystressrelief_c4a98d97:

    # a "But, yeah... He mentioned he was looking for a place or something. He didn't elaborate further."
    a "但是总之……他说他正在找一个地方还是什么的。他没说得太清楚。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2325
translate chinese skystressrelief_ef1a3077:

    # la "I see. Then, if everyone else is here, we should start."
    la "我明白了。那，如果其他人都在的话，我们就开始吧。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2364
translate chinese skystressrelief_c7205923:

    # la "We'll visit him as soon as we can. Pay him our full respects."
    la "我们会尽快去看他的。向他表达我们的敬意。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2376
translate chinese skystressrelief_ce03364b:

    # j "I still can't believe it, but you, [mc], have the last serum we sought."
    j "我仍然没法相信，但是你，[mc!t]，身上有我们正在寻找的最后一支血清。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2382
translate chinese skystressrelief_51727239:

    # j "For the past two years, we have been scouring every corner of the globe to find it. Who would've thought it was right under our noses this whole time?"
    j "过去两年来，我们找遍了整个地球。谁能想到一直以来就在我们眼皮子底下？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2448
translate chinese skystressrelief_6f22f42b:

    # ala "We are very pleased to meet you, people of the new era."
    ala "我们很高兴能够见到你们这些新时代的人们。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2458
translate chinese skystressrelief_dcf50cd3:

    # ala "Before you, there was us... the \"Experimental Test Subjects\". Or, simply, the failed iterations of the serum."
    ala "在你们之前，还有我们……所谓的“原型试作体”。或者简单来说，就是失败品。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2536
translate chinese skystressrelief_b80e7649:

    # la "And they're not just any simple repercussions. They affect one's vital organs, weakening them."
    la "而且还不是普通的副作用。血清会让体内的重要器官慢慢衰竭。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2538
translate chinese skystressrelief_5321d0c2:

    # la "But if you know how to care for your body, you can easily manage the side effects."
    la "但只要懂得怎么保养身体，还是能轻松应付这些副作用的。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2601
translate chinese skystressrelief_711a8796:

    # cl "Their love, though forbidden by tradition and the court's expectations, bloomed in secret, nurtured by stolen moments and silent glances."
    cl "他们的爱情尽管不被传统所允许，不被朝廷所期望，却在私下里生根发芽，被一次次秘密的聚会和沉默的对视所滋养着。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2681
translate chinese skystressrelief_fdb4da49:

    # mc "Where did that playful side of you go...?"
    mc "你喜欢调皮捣蛋的那一面跑到哪去了……？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2698
translate chinese skystressrelief_cab91e42:

    # la "It may not be the same, but Lucien and Aveline have a certain connection between them, too. I'm sure that also goes for the rest of the Early Stages."
    la "虽然情况可能不太一样，但是卢希恩和艾芙琳之间也有一种联系。我想其他所有早期型肯定也都是这样。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2819
translate chinese skystressrelief_965bff13:

    # m "Aside from us, one more serum user is still alive."
    m "除了我们之外，还有其他的血清使用者活着。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2929
translate chinese skystressrelief_fe192b7c:

    # bo "Personal vendettas can sharpen one's determination or cloud one's judgment. Tread carefully with the double-edged sword you've unsheathed, Francis."
    bo "私人恩怨能强化决心，也能蒙蔽双眼。要小心对待你手上这把双刃剑，弗朗西斯。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:2983
translate chinese skystressrelief_d7d0943c:

    # mc "Hey, can we help you with something? We're opening in thirty minutes if you're here to eat."
    mc "你有什么事吗？是来吃饭的吗？我们半个小时之后才开门。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3052
translate chinese skystressrelief_31e9727c:

    # au "Currently, we don't have openings that match your skill set. However, if you're interested in a janitorial position, we can immediately offer that opportunity."
    au "目前，我们没有匹配你的能力的职位。不过，如果你对清洁工的职位感兴趣的话，我们可以立即聘用你。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3111
translate chinese skystressrelief_dcfa4f25:

    # jane "Continue to pursue your professional ambitions, and I'm confident you'll discover an opportunity that perfectly matches your skills and goals."
    jane "继续追求你的职业目标，我相信你会找到一个与你的技能和目标完美匹配的职位。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3130
translate chinese skystressrelief_db7cc7dc:

    # mall "You have a lot of potential. You look cute and have just the right curves to appeal to a mass audience. I'm sure I can pair you up with someone."
    mall "你有很大潜力。长得可爱，身材也足够吸引大部分观众。我肯定能给你找来好搭档。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3460
translate chinese skystressrelief_a0fea042:

    # mal "With pleasure. This one seems like he'll last a while. The tough ones are always the most fun to break."
    mal "非常乐意。他看起来像是能坚持挺久的样子。把结实的人弄坏总是更有意思。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3594
translate chinese skystressrelief_ba01b725:

    # cl "It's an intensely complicated feeling where you experience multiple emotions simultaneously."
    cl "在同一时刻感到好几种不同的情绪，是种非常复杂的感觉。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3634
translate chinese skystressrelief_92bdb679:

    # el "That area lacks CCTV coverage, but there's only one way in and out given the layout. They must have taken him there."
    el "那个区域没有摄像头，不过根据这布局来看，出入口只有一个。他们肯定是把他带到那里去了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:3786
translate chinese skystressrelief_2699c913:

    # mal "But I can see it in your eyes: desperation and fear. You're wondering how long you can hold out. Isn't that so?"
    mal "但是我能在你的眼睛里看到绝望和恐惧。你在想你到底还能撑多久。对不对？"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4092
translate chinese skystressrelief_14dc3888:

    # m "He's not just a friend! He's my husband!"
    m "他不是什么朋友！他是我的丈夫！"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4178
translate chinese skystressrelief_020a6629:

    # m "{i}All I did was give her the distance she wanted. But if I hadn't, her knife would've pierced my neck."
    m "{i}这样反而如她所愿，拉开了距离。但要是不踢开她，她的刀就要扎穿我的脖子了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4404
translate chinese skystressrelief_5ae31dd2:

    # si "Hmm, how about me, though? I've been thinking about it, but couldn't come up with one."
    si "嗯，那我呢？我想了很久，但是想不出来。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4526
translate chinese skystressrelief_a73eaab7:

    # m "Right now, I'm devoted to one person and intend to be his and his alone."
    m "现在，我的心只属于一个人，我只想和他共度余生。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4527
translate chinese skystressrelief_cc8a7536:

    # m "I refuse to be chained by grievances or forced to do something against my will anymore. It's time to choose for myself."
    m "我拒绝继续被仇恨束缚，被逼着做不想做的事。我该自己做出选择了。"

# game/ch1ep4.rpy:4542
translate chinese skystressrelief_ad0f1ca2:

    # m "The fact that you're still alive means there's still something you can and must do."
